b(0, 102, 204) !important;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow-x:visible !important;overflow-y:visible !important;word-break:normal !important;}</style><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/><title>New Template</title></head><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F3F4F6;"><table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" align="center" bgcolor="#F3F4F6" style="width:100%;background-color:#F3F4F6;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" style="background-color:#d9dbde;padding:32px 16px;"><table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:32px;min-height:500px;height:1933px;width:594px;"><img src="https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/email-template/images/1789622279912-jtlc83pv.png" style="max-width:100%;display:block;width:252px;height:92px;margin:0 auto 16px;border:0;"/><img src="https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/email-template/images/1789622295156-3tsv9ws4.jpg" alt="Add an image" style="display:inline-block;max-width:100%;height:296px;border:0;width:571px;"/><div data-te-role="image-wrapper" style="width:100%;text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px;"></div><div style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;margin:0 0 12px;height:1546px;width:555px;"><p style="margin:0px 0px 22px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;"><strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">Dear Team,</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 22px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;"><strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">Greetings of the Day!</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 26px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;"><strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">I hope you’re doing well.</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;">My name is <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">Rupali</strong>, and I am reaching out to explore potential collaboration opportunities between your organization and <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">IUOVA Design Company.</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;">At Iuova, We <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">partner with Hardware Product Companies across Industrial Design, Mechanical Engineering and Modelmaking, </strong>helping take concepts from early-stage development through to <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">Manufacturing Readiness.</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;">Our team <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">helps reduce iteration cycles, address technical risks early, and keep programs aligned with production timelines.</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;">We would welcome the <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">opportunity to collaborate as an extended product development partner for your portfolio companies.</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 18px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;"><strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">You may explore our capabilities and selected projects in our company catalogue.</strong></p><p class="m_-9177519761775394687link-row" style="margin:0px 0px 10px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;">• <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">Catalogue</strong> - <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1q7u7Qr7aH1JoP8D5k8rIeFSJrgUWv7tf" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://novreeapdwjnpzflyiey.supabase.co/functi