y><tr><td align="center"><table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" class="container" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;"><tbody><tr><td class="top"><img src="https://novreeapdwjnpzflyiey.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/email%20template/images/1788000994928-80f155e6-0973-4ae7-909a-a63e82d0b64a.png" width="190" alt="IUOVA Design Company" class="logo" style="display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;"/><img src="https://novreeapdwjnpzflyiey.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/email%20template/images/1788000982799-b4b62745-cc25-462c-a789-927461f289de.png" width="556" alt="IUOVA Design Company" class="hero" style="display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;"/></td></tr><tr><td class="content"><p><b>Dear Sir,</b></p><p><b>Greetings of the day!</b></p><p>I''m <b>Rupali</b> from <b>IUOVA Design Company.</b></p><p><b>We specialize in product design and development services</b>,
and I believe our expertise could offer significant value to your
design or innovation team on future projects.
</p><p><b>At IUOVA Design Company</b>
(<a href="https://www.iuovadesign.com">www.iuovadesign.com</a>),
we partner with companies to transform ideas into market-ready products.
Our comprehensive services include:
</p><ul><li><b>Designing &amp; Conceptual Modeling</b></li><li><b>Advanced Rendering &amp; Prototyping</b></li><li><b>Manufacturing Solutions</b></li></ul><p><b>We follow a systematic process for product development cycle -</b></p><ol><li><strong>Research &amp; Development:</strong> Identifying the best design and material solutions.</li><li><strong>3D CAD Modeling &amp; Assembly:</strong> Creating precise digital representations.</li><li><strong>Analysis Simulation:</strong> Ensuring performance and viability.</li><li><strong>Optimization &amp; Value Engineering:</strong> Refining designs for efficiency and cost-effectiveness.</li><li><strong>Tool &amp; Mould Die Development:</strong> Preparing for production.</li><li><strong>Branding &amp; Packaging Solutions:</strong> Ensuring a strong market presence.</li></ol><p>You can explore our full capabilities and a selection of our projects in our:</p><ul><li><b>Catalogue:</b><a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1q7u7Qr7aH1JoP8D5k8rIeFSJrgUWv7tf?usp=sharing">
Iuova Design Company Catalogue 2026
</a></li><li><b>LinkedIn Company Page:</b><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/iuovadesign/">
Linked In Profile
</a></li><li><b>Website:</b><a href="https://www.iuovadesign.com">www.iuovadesign.com</a></li></ul><p><b>
Our clients include industry leaders such as Godrej, Hamilton, Cello,
Havells, Crompton, Bajaj, and Tata Motors, among many others.
</b></p><p>
(P.S. Due to client confidentiality agreements (NDAs), our portfolio
showcases a curated selection of projects developed in-house,
alongside client work where permitted.)
</p><p>We''d be delighted to discuss your current product development requirements.</p><p><b>Please feel free to reply to this email or on</b><a href="mailto:info@iuova.in"><b>info@iuova.in</b></a></p><p><b>Fill out our</b><a href="https://forms.gle/N3K8UzopGTvapezx6"><b>Product RFQ Form</b></a>
to help us understand your needs.
</p><p>Our team will then share tailored Techno Commercials along with timelines.</p><p><b>Looking forward to working together.</b></p><p><b>We can schedule a brief 15-minute discovery call</b>
to walk you through our work and explore how we can contribute
to your upcoming initiatives.
</p><a href="https://www.iuovadesign.com/contact" class="cta">
Schedule The Discovery Call
