0px 0px 22px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;"><strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">Greetings of the Day!</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 26px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;"><strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">I hope you’re doing well.</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;">My name is <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">Rupali</strong>, and I am reaching out to explore potential collaboration opportunities between your organization and <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">IUOVA Design Company.</strong></p><p style="margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-size:16px;break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;min-height:0px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important;">At Iuova, We <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">partner with Hardware Product Companies across Industrial Design, Mechanical Engineering and Modelmaking, </strong>helping take concepts from early-stage development through to <strong style="break-before:auto !important;break-after:auto !important;break-inside:auto !important;">Manufacturing Readiness.</stro