Thank you!', 'mail sent', 'job-application'),
	(239, '2026-08-05 17:30:10.557741+00', 'mydesignminds@gmail.com', 'Proposal for Mechanical Product Design Support – Retainership / Project Basis', 'Dear Ms Pratiksha,

I came across your LinkedIn post regarding the requirement for a Senior
Mechanical Design Engineer at IUOVA Design Company. While I am not looking
for a full-time role, I believe my experience can add significant value to
your engineering team.

I am Abhishek Sharma, Founder & CEO of My Design Minds, an engineering
design and product development company based in Greater Noida. Over the
past several years, my team and I have worked with startups, MSMEs, and
large enterprises across multiple industries, supporting them from concept
development to manufacturing.

Our expertise includes:

* 3D CAD Modelling & Detailed Manufacturing Drawings (SolidWorks, Creo,
AutoCAD)
* Plastic Part Design for Injection Moulding
* Sheet Metal, Die Casting & Machined Components
* DFM/DFA & Manufacturing Optimization
* GD&T, Tolerance Stack-up & Design Validation
* Reverse Engineering
* FEA & CFD Simulations
* Prototype Development and Manufacturing Support

We have delivered engineering solutions for organisations such as Lenskart,
AIIMS Delhi, IPCA Laboratories, Diageo, GKB Group, and several industrial
manufacturing companies.

If your team requires additional engineering bandwidth, I would be happy to
support IUOVA in either of the following engagement models:

* Engineering Retainership Model – Dedicated design support for a fixed
number of hours each month.
* Project-to-Project Model – End-to-end execution of specific product
development or CAD engineering projects.

This model enables you to scale your engineering capacity without the
overhead of hiring additional full-time resources while maintaining
high-quality deliverables and quick turnaround times.

If this aligns with your current or future requirements, I would be glad to
schedule a brief call to understand your needs and explore how we can
collaborate.

Looking forward to hearing from you.

*Thanks and Regards*
*Abhishek Sharma <https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhishek--dmm/>*

*Founder & CEO: My Design Minds <http://www.mydesignminds.com/>*
*Product Design Strategist | Design Thinking PractitionerBuilding scalable,
Design-led solutions.*
*Contact No. +919289249363 | +919205509565*



*📍 Uttam Nagar, New Delhi*

*Follow us on  *
*Linkedin <https://www.linkedin.com/company/my-design-minds/>*
Facebook <https://www.facebook.com/mydesignminds/>

Please consider the Environment before printing this Email

