	(11, '2026-05-25 05:33:10.448831+00', 'manisha777@gmail.com', 'Industrial Design & Product Development Enquiry – Chronelle PBM System', 'Dear Team,

I hope you are doing well.

My name is Manisha Shaw Dias, and I am currently developing a premium
beauty-tech and skincare brand called Chronelle.

We are exploring the development of a luxury clinical-inspired
Photobiomodulation (PBM) skincare device system integrating advanced red,
blue, and potentially green light technology, along with a compatible
skincare ecosystem.

At this stage, we are looking for a capable industrial design and product
development partner who can support us with:

• Premium industrial design aesthetics
• Ergonomic product development
• Prototype visualization
• Product housing/enclosure design
• CAD development
• Design-for-manufacturing guidance
• Coordination with electronics/hardware engineering teams where required

The product direction is intended to combine clinical functionality with
luxury beauty positioning, rather than a generic consumer LED device
aesthetic.

Before sharing detailed technical concepts and development materials, we
would prefer to execute a Mutual NDA.

Please let us know:

   1. Whether your team undertakes projects in the beauty-tech / wellness
   device category
   2. Your typical product development workflow
   3. Whether you support prototype-to-manufacturing transition
   4. Approximate timelines for industrial design and prototype stages
   5. A suitable contact person for further discussions

Looking forward to hearing from you and exploring a potential collaboration.

Warm regards,


Manisha Shaw Dias.
(Developing: Chronelle Beauty-Tech & Skincare)
Mumbai, India

+919892230462.', 'mail sent', 'product-design-inquiry'),
	(12, '2026-05-26 12:00:21.23257+00', 'development6@m-techindia.com', 'ECTS Locking System', 'Dear Team,

 

I am Bhumika From MTech Innovation Ltd. 

 

We are currently working on the development of an Electronic Cargo Tracking
System (ECTS) and are looking for design support for a custom
electro-mechanical smart locking system integrated with our device.

 

The proposed system is required to support:

*	RFID/Smart card-based unlocking
*	Password-based access control
*	Automatic lock/unlock functionality
*	Embedded electronics integration
*	Rugged mechanical locking mechanism suitable for cargo applications

 

The locking mechanism will be integrated with GPS/GSM-based electronics and
should be designed for reliable field operation with tamper-resistant
functionality.

 

We would appreciate the opportunity to discuss the project requirements
further and understand your design capabilities for such a product. I have
attached the images of the product for your reference. 

 

Kindly let us know a suitable time for discussion.

 

Looking forward to your response.', 'mail sent', 'product-design-inquiry'),
