	(40, '2026-06-18 10:00:12.893876+00', 'eshaan@mersiv.in', 'Project Enquiry — BLOB : A physical AI desk creature', 'Hello team IUOVA,

I tried filling out the project enquiry form on iuovadesign.com but it didn''t go through so reaching out directly instead.

My name is Eshaan Mehta, I''m the founder of Mersiv Labs LLP, building BLOB — a physical AI desk creature built on an off-the-shelf ESP32-S3 hardware platform with a custom personality, memory, and behaviour layer designed from the ground up to feel and behave like a living creature. 

The hardware BOM, cloud backend, companion app, and firmware are close to production readiness. What''s missing is the body, the industrial design that does justice to everything else we''ve built.

I''m looking to scope a focused V1 engagement with the right design partner. In brief:

Scope of work:

Industrial design of the Blob enclosure — a creature-first form factor housing the existing electronics (ESP32-S3 audio board, 1.47" IPS LCD, three capacitive touch sensors, speaker, microphones, LiPo battery, USB-C port).

A seamless visor/face panel over the LCD so the display edges disappear and animated eyes appear to float in a dark, character-like face (reference: Anki Vector / Cozmo ).

Touch sensor integration behind the curvature of the shell so the three touch zones invite petting and poking, not button-pressing. 

CMF direction supporting the living-creature feel.

Product engineering / CAD-for-manufacturing with DFMA-aware choices baked in.

At least one fully-assembled, hand-held physical prototype suitable for demos, user testing, and investor conversations.


Out of scope: cloud backend, firmware, companion app, AI/LLM pipeline, and the electronics BOM — all already built and locked.


Budget: ₹5-10 lakhs for this scoped V1 engagement.

 Timeline: 1-2 months ideal.



Happy to jump on a 30-minute call to walk through the product and the core idea behind it.


Looking forward to hearing from you.


Best,

Eshaan




