	(52, '2026-06-26 15:30:16.029108+00', 'sales@sysmpl.com', 'RFQ: 3D CAD & 2D Manufacturing Drawings for Industrial Gearbox', 'Dear Design and Engineering Team,
Greetings from SysMetica Mechatronics Pvt. Ltd. (SMPL)!
We are a growing manufacturing company based in Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar (Aurangabad), Maharashtra. We have our own manufacturing facility equipped with Vertical Machining Centers (VMCs) and Precision Lathes.
We are currently planning to launch our own range of Industrial Gearboxes. We are looking for a reliable, technically sound, and cost-effective mechanical design partner to provide us with production-ready drawings on a project basis.
Project Requirement (Initial Phase):
 Product: In-line Helical Gear Motors
 Power Rating: 1.0 HP to 5.0 HP (Standard Ratio 1:10)
 Mounting: Foot Mounted
What We Need from You (Scope of Work):
1. 3D CAD Modeling: Complete design of the gearbox assembly.
2. 2D Manufacturing Drawings: Detailed drawings with exact micron-level tolerances and GD&T. (Crucial requirement: The Cast Iron housing will be machined entirely in-house on our VMCs. Therefore, the design must be strictly DFM (Design for Manufacturing) and machining-friendly).
3. Bill of Materials (BOM): List of standard market-available components (e.g., SKF bearings, oil seals).
Since we are doing the housing machining in-house and outsourcing the gear hobbing/heat treatment to our local vendors, we need a consultant who understands practical manufacturing limitations and can deliver highly accurate drawings.
Could you please review this requirement and share a preliminary techno-commercial proposal or an estimated cost for designing this first model? Please also mention your expected lead time.
We are open to signing a Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) before proceeding. Please let us know a suitable time for a quick 10-minute introductory phone call to discuss this further.
Looking forward to hearing from you.
Best Regards,

Ramesh Kale
Sysmatica Mechatronics Private Limited
Sector 5, Plot No. 91-4, Auric City, DMIC Shendra,
Chh. Sambhajinagar - 431007
Mob.: +91-7447777800', 'mail sent', 'product-design-inquiry'),
