	(126, '2026-07-02 06:30:10.813967+00', 'ayushi.majithia@anu.edu.in', 'Invitation: Design Placements 2027 | Anant National University', '*Dear Mr. Vatsal,*

Greetings from *Anant National University* <http://www.anu.edu.in/>, India’s
premier design university, dedicated to training students to devise
solutions for global problems. Guided by visionary leadership, Anant brings
together a globally experienced faculty to deliver practice-led,
