Internship programme,* I am pleased to share some details about us and
*invite Iuova *to participate in the programme* for the graduating batch of
2027*.

We, at Anant University, offer the following multidisciplinary programmes
at the undergraduate level that will have *campus placements starting*
*in **September
2026*:

·            Bachelor of Design
<https://anu.edu.in/programme/bachelor-of-design/> *(Communication, Space,
Product, Sustainable Fashion and Textile, Interaction, Moving Image and
Transdisciplinary Design)*

