<https://anu.edu.in/programme/b-tech-in-climate-change>

·            Anant Fellowship in Sustainability and Built Environment
<https://anu.edu.in/programme/anant-fellowship/>

Please *Click Here
<https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rWcdvlMCxortKIq1erWAEY7-9BWng9Dp?usp=drive_link>*
to access our *Programme Structure,* which will help you understand our
programmes in detail and the career pathways that our students can pursue.

*Joining Timelines:*

   *Bachelor of Design and BTech in Climate Change students: *

·       Undergo a 6-month Capstone/Graduate Project in the industry
starting from *January 2027*, followed by full-time employment with the
organisation from *May/June 2027* onwards.

·       OR they can join as a full-time employee starting *May/June 2027*

* Bachelor of Architecture, Bachelor of Design in Space and Bachelor of
Visual Arts students :*

·       Join as full-time employees starting *May/June 2027. *

With this mail, I request your earliest time of convenience for a
call/virtual meeting/in-person meeting to discuss a possible collaboration,
