**About Us:*

*Anant National University,* India’s premier design university, is
dedicated to training students to devise solutions for global problems.
Guided by the visionary leadership of *Mr Ajay Piramal, President, Dr
Sanjeev Vidyarthi, Provost and Dr Pramath Raj Sinha, Founding Provost*,
Anant brings together a globally experienced faculty to deliver
practice-led, interdisciplinary education.

At Anant, students are trained to think critically, collaborate across
domains and translate design thinking into actionable solutions. This
approach develops graduates who are analytical, adaptable and
industry-ready, equipped to contribute meaningfully to organisations
addressing sustainability, innovation and human-centred problem-solving at
scale.

Anant’s future-focused academic model encourages students to engage in
real-world projects, interdisciplinary studios and industry-linked
assignments from the first year itself. By the time they graduate, they
develop robust portfolios that demonstrate their ability to conceptualise,
design, prototype and execute solutions across complex professional
contexts. Supported by experienced faculty mentors and global exposure, our
students are well-equipped to contribute meaningfully in the corporate
setting.

Our* DesignX pedagogy*, where ‘X’ is the symbol drawn from mathematics,
representing enhancement, is a new learning approach that multiplies
traditional design pedagogy with liberal arts disciplines, emerging
technologies and knowledge drawn from hands-on community experiences to
help understand our world better and to devise impactful solutions. Our
undergraduate, postgraduate and doctoral programmes across *design,
architecture, climate action, visual arts* and allied disciplines integrate
traditional knowledge systems with cutting-edge technologies to address
contemporary and future challenges. We nurture our students to become
future-ready professionals who combine creative thinking with practical,
solution-oriented mindsets.

Anant National University has been recognised as a *Centre of Excellen', 'mail sent', 'job-application'),
