We are currently developing a premium automated retail amenity platform
under *ELVARQ*, designed for luxury residential developments, five-star
hotels, premium commercial spaces, hospitals, airports, and other high-end
environments.

As part of our pilot development, we have already finalized our product
vision, industrial design direction, CMF strategy, and user experience
requirements. We have also been working closely with vending machine
manufacturers to evaluate the manufacturing feasibility of our first
product.

While the internal vending platform and dispensing mechanism are readily
available, the level of industrial design customization we are targeting
has proven challenging to achieve at pilot quantities due to manufacturing
limitations.

We are therefore looking for an experienced *Industrial Design & Product
Development partner* who can help us evaluate the most practical approach
to achieving a premium appliance-grade product by leveraging an existing
vending platform while redesigning and refining the external product
experience.

We are specifically looking for expertise in:

   - Industrial Design
   - Product Engineering
   - Design for Manufacturing (DFM)
   - CMF Development
   - Prototype Development
   - Manufacturing Feasibility
   - Vendor Coordination

Our objective is not simply to create a visually appealing product, but to
develop a commercially manufacturable premium product that can scale into
production.

If this aligns with your expertise, we would be pleased to schedule an
initial discussion. Following your confirmation, we will be happy to share
our Product Vision & Manufacturing Requirement Deck for your review prior
to the meeting.

We look forward to hearing from you.

Kind Regards,

*Team ELVARQ*
