	(162, '2026-07-08 14:00:39.089637+00', 'gnmrugank@gmail.com', 'Application for Industrial Designer – Mrugank Ghogale', '*Dear Hiring Team,*

I am writing to express my interest in the Industrial Designer position at
Iuova Design Company. Your work across consumer products, medical devices,
IoT, and EVs immediately caught my attention because it reflects the kind
of multidisciplinary design environment in which I enjoy working.

As an Industrial Designer, I believe that successful products are created
through a balance of functionality, aesthetics, and engineering. While
functionality forms the foundation of every design decision, form
development, proportion, and visual storytelling are what create intuitive
and engaging user experiences.

My graduation project at Tata Technologies taught me the importance of
surface development, proportions, ergonomics, and translating design intent
into production-ready solutions. In my current role at iCreate, I
collaborate with engineers and startups to develop innovative products,
gaining experience in concept development, rapid prototyping, iterative
refinement, and cross-functional collaboration.

I enjoy taking ownership of products from concept through production and
