quality control instruments. We manufacture products such as Dissolution
Test Apparatus, Disintegration Test Apparatus, Friability Testers, Tap
Density Testers, Leak Test Apparatus, and other QC equipment used by
pharmaceutical companies across India and overseas.

As we build the next generation of our product portfolio, we are
redesigning our instruments with:

  - Modern touchscreen interfaces
  - 21 CFR Part 11 compliant software
  - Improved usability and serviceability
  - A completely new industrial design language

While our instruments are technically competitive, we believe the product
design should reflect the same level of engineering and establish a strong,
globally competitive identity for our brand. We are looking for an
industrial design partner who can help us:

  - Develop a premium and consistent design language across our product
range
  - Design manufacturable enclosures using sheet metal and plastic
components
  - Improve ergonomics, serviceability, and overall user experience
  - Create a distinctive visual identity for Electronics India

Additionally, we are exploring the MSME Design Scheme and other government
initiatives that support industrial design and product development. We
would love to understand whether your team has experience working under
these schemes and if you could assist with the application process and
project execution.

If this sounds like a good fit, we would be happy to schedule a short
introductory call to discuss the project. We would also appreciate it if
you could share a relevant portfolio or case studies regarding any previous
work on laboratory or scientific instruments.

You can learn more about us at https://electronicsindia.co.in.

