	(176, '2026-07-11 06:00:08.205072+00', 'blanche.dias@nmims.edu', 'FW: Invitation for Campus Placements at NMIMS School of Design', 'Greetings from NMIMS School of Design! hr@aethroneareospace.com<mailto:hr@aethroneareospace.com>
We are delighted to announce that Campus Placement 2025 has commenced, and we invite your esteemed organization to participate in the recruitment process at NMIMS School of Design, Mumbai.

About NMIMS School of Design:  In response to the evolving landscape of design practice, the School of Design at the Mumbai campus of NMIMS Deemed-to-be-University is dedicated to offering future-focused design education. Our mission emphasizes a transdisciplinary approach to immersive, holistic, and futuristic learning opportunities.

The role of designers today is dynamic and comprehensive, combining design with technology and sciences to address business and social needs. Whether designing communications or businesses, the boundaries are merging.

The NMIMS School of Design offers an AICTE-approved, four-year undergraduate Design program (B.Des.) in Humanising Technology. "Humanising Technology" involves designing technology to make it accessible, usable, and delightful for users. This distinctive program addresses intricate nuances in design, providing a multidisciplinary edge to the field.

Program Highlights

  *   Foundation Years (I & II): Generalist foundation, emphasizing core design principles.
  *   Focus Years (III & IV): Specialization in designing seamless product experiences with emerging technologies such as the Internet of Things (IoT), Virtual Reality (VR), and Augmented Reality (AR).
  *   Capstone and Industry Exposure (Year IV):
     *   Capstone Degree Project
     *   Research Paper
     *   Five-month industry internship, culminating in placement opportunities.

Our B.Des. (Humanising Technology) program equips students with cutting-edge design skills and a strong foundation in integrating technology with design. Our students specialize in:

  *   Designing solutions with emergent technologies (IoT & XR)
  *   Interaction Design
  *   Behavioural Design
  *   Design Research
  *   Data Visualization
  *   Experience Design
  *   Communication Design
  *   UI/UX Design

With a rigorous curriculum and hands-on industry exposure through internships and capstone projects, our graduates are ready to bring innovation and value to your organization.

We look forward to collaborating with you to connect talent with the opportunities to make meaningful contributions in the industry.

Explore Our Students'' Work

We invite you to explore some of the exceptional academic projects undertaken by our students in the B.Des. (Humanising Technology) program. You can view these projects at: https://design.nmims.edu/student-projects.php

Additionally, the program brochure detailing the curriculum and learning outcomes is attached for your reference. More information is available at our website: design.nmims.edu<https://design.nmims.edu>.

We extend a warm invitation to visit the NMIMS School of Design at your convenience. Feel free to call me on 9833516006 to take the process further.

Looking forward to a fruitful collaboration and a promising beginning.

Thanks & Regards,
Blanche Dias
Placement Executive
NMIMS, School of Design
(D) # 022-4233 5190
http://design.nmims.edu<http://design.nmims.edu/>
