	(224, '2026-08-03 07:30:11.133387+00', 'parthvikamsey@gmail.com', 'Exploring a Watch Design Collaboration', 'Hi iUOVA Team,

I’m Parth Vikamsey, co-founder of an upcoming India based Watch Brand
focused on creating original watches inspired by the power and elegance of
the wild.

We have developed some visual direction and core concept for our first few
watches. I am now looking to work closely with an experienced industrial or
product designer who can help us take these concepts from visual renders to
properly engineered, manufacturable watch designs.

The scope would include:

   - Refining the case, dial, lugs, crown, bracelet and caseback
   architecture
   - Improving proportions, ergonomics and overall product detailing
   - Identifying design or manufacturing challenges early
   - Developing accurate 2D drawings and 3D CAD models
   - Defining dimensions, tolerances, materials and surface finishes
   - Preparing files that can be reviewed and prototyped by watch
   manufacturers

I will be visiting my manufacturer soon and would like to lock the primary
design direction before the visit, so that I can have more productive
discussions with manufacturers and suppliers.

I would love to meet you, show you the designs we have developed so far,
understand your process and explore whether we could work together on this
project.

Please let me know your availability for a meeting or call over the next
few days.

Best regards,
Parth Vikamsey
