	(242, '2026-08-06 11:00:13.204549+00', 'sarvesh.sonawane1@gmail.com', 'Product Design & Prototype Development Enquiry – Innovative Beverage Dispensing Cap', 'Dear Team,

I hope you are doing well.

My name is *Sarvesh Sonawane*, and I am currently working on an innovative
consumer product in the beverage packaging space. I am looking for a
product design and engineering partner who can help me convert my concept
into a functional prototype.

The product is a *500 ml disposable water bottle with a sports sipper cap*.
Unlike a conventional bottle, the cap contains a *sealed chamber that
stores a powdered beverage mix*. Upon user activation, a *breakable
membrane mechanism* releases the powder into the water, allowing the
consumer to shake the bottle and instantly prepare a fresh functional
beverage such as an electrolyte drink, energy drink, or vitamin drink.

At this stage, I am looking for support with:

   - Product concept refinement
   - Industrial design
   - Mechanical design of the dispensing cap
   - CAD modelling and engineering drawings
   - Design for manufacturing (DFM)
   - Prototype development (preferably using 3D printing initially)
   - Guidance on tooling and mass production

Since the concept involves a new product idea, I would appreciate
discussing the project under a *Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA)* before
sharing detailed design information.

Kindly let me know if your team has experience in consumer product
development, injection-moulded plastic products, or dispensing mechanisms.
I would also appreciate an indication of your design process, estimated
timelines, and commercial proposal for such a project.

I look forward to hearing from you and hopefully working together to bring
this product to market.

Thank you for your time and consideration.

Kind regards,

*Sarvesh Sonawane*
