	(256, '2026-08-12 07:30:09.134216+00', 'vamsikottapallimfgengg@gmail.com', 'Request for Quotation - TapCook Smart Rice Cooker | Product Development & Prototype Manufacturing', 'Dear IUOVA Team,

We are reaching out to explore a product development partnership for
TapCook, a smart home-kitchen appliance that automates the rice-cooking
process end to end - from rice and water dispensing through washing,
draining, transfer and cooking - initiated and monitored via a connected
app.

TapCook is currently at the concept/MVP stage, and we are looking for an
end-to-end design and engineering partner who can take it through
industrial design, mechanical and electronics engineering, PCB development,
firmware, prototype fabrication, testing and validation, and finally DFM to
a manufacturing-ready prototype.

Please find attached our Hardware Project Specification & Request for
Quotation, which covers:
- Project overview and functional process flow
- Major subsystem specifications (rice storage, water storage, washing
chamber, transfer mechanism, cooking unit, electronics & PCB)
- Connectivity, software and industrial design requirements
- Engineering, prototype, testing and DFM requirements
- Expected deliverables, IP terms and quotation structure requested
- An NDA (Annexure A) covering confidentiality of the concept and technical
details

We would appreciate it if you could review the attached document and share:
1. A detailed technical proposal covering your understanding of the scope
2. A commercial quotation broken down by the categories listed in Section 14
3. Your proposed development timeline against the milestones in Section 15
4. Answers to the specific questions listed in Section 17 of the document

We are happy to sign the NDA first and schedule a call to walk through the
requirement in more detail, whichever works best on your end. Please let us
know a suitable date and time, and who from your team we should be
coordinating with.

Looking forward to hearing from you.', 'mail sent', 'product-design-inquiry'),
