	(315, '2026-09-07 14:30:20.388669+00', 'shahsherya6@gmail.com', 'Application | Senior Industrial Designer', 'Dear Iuova Design Team,

I’m writing to apply for the Senior Industrial Designer position at Iuova
Design Company.

I’m a Product Designer with experience across industrial design, product
development, prototyping, manufacturing, and visual/brand design. In my
current role, I’ve worked across the product lifecycle—from concept
development and CAD modelling to prototyping, vendor coordination,
packaging, and taking products towards production.

The opportunity to work across consumer products, medical devices, IoT, and
EVs particularly interests me, as I enjoy working on products that require
