	(361, '2026-09-16 00:00:13.090984+00', 'nuno.costa@flama.pt', 'Potential Collaboration – Development of Small Domestic Appliances', 'Dear,
I hope you are doing well.
I am reaching out to explore a potential collaboration between FLAMA and your company in the area of product engineering and development.
We currently have several product development projects where our internal engineering capacity is fully allocated. As a result, some projects are currently on hold, and we are looking for external engineering partners who could support us as an extension of our R&D team.
The projects we have in our pipeline can have different levels of maturity, for example:

  *   New product developments: starting from an approved design concept, requiring full product engineering, 3D CAD development, mechanical design, prototyping, testing and preparation of the product for industrialization.
  *   Existing products in mass production: projects where we would like to implement product improvements, cost reductions, design optimizations or technical changes, but currently do not have the internal capacity to dedicate sufficient resources to them.
  *   Development support: specific engineering activities where we need additional capacity from concept development through to a production-ready solution.
Our objective would be to establish a flexible collaboration model, where your engineering team could take ownership of specific projects or work packages, while working closely with our R&D and industrial teams.
I would therefore like to understand more about your capabilities, experience and typical way of working, and discuss whether there could be opportunities for collaboration.
If this is of interest, I would be happy to arrange a short meeting to present FLAMA, the type of products we develop and some of the projects we currently have in our pipeline.
Please let me know if you would be available for a meeting in the coming weeks.


Cumprimentos \ Best Regards,

