	(372, '2026-09-17 07:30:09.728657+00', 'mohnish_sugand@hotmail.com', 'VYUN — Consumer Product Engineering & Prototype Development Enquiry', 'Dear IUOVA Design Team,
I am developing VYUN, a premium reusable scent/incense consumer object designed for modern homes and hospitality spaces.
I am currently looking for a product-development partner to help take the concept through engineering, CAD, functional prototyping, DFM, and a production-oriented design direction.
The product is a vertical architectural object with a thermally isolated incense combustion system, visible burn progression and a removable ash system. It also includes a passive Smoke Sculptor: an interchangeable top element designed to influence the smoke plume into distinctive natural forms such as a spiral, twin plume or halo
Our current retail pricing hypothesis is approximately ₹999–₹1,499, so the design needs to be commercially disciplined as well as aesthetically strong.
We are therefore particularly interested in:

  *
low part count and efficient assembly
  *
Prototyping with different materials
  *
practical manufacturing processes
  *   scalable architecture
  *   transparent BOM/cost thinking
  *   a clear path from prototype to approximately 1,000–10,000 units
  *   avoiding unnecessary tooling or complexity at this stage

I have shared a product concept brief and renders. Further, detailed technical information can be shared under an NDA.
Please let me know a suitable time for an introductory call.
Best regards,
Mohnish Sugand
VYUN
