	(381, '2026-09-21 06:30:04.554993+00', 'atifurqaan@gmail.com', 'Application – Senior Mechanical Design Engineer | Atif Furqaan', 'Dear Hiring Team,

I am writing to apply for the Senior Mechanical Design Engineer
