I am a CSWE-certified Mechanical Design Engineer with over five years
of professional experience in mechanical product design, 3D CAD
modelling, detailed manufacturing drawings, sheet metal, moulded
products, DFM/DFA, GD&T, tolerance analysis, engineering calculations
and production support.

My primary expertise is in SolidWorks, supported by experience with
Siemens NX, AutoCAD, Autodesk Inventor and Fusion 360. In my previous
UK-based role, I delivered more than 300 production drawing packs for
