assemblies and components from initial requirements through detailed
design, manufacturing documentation and production release.

My experience includes sheet-metal design, weldments, fabricated
assemblies, mould tooling, cavity modifications, GRP enclosures,
mechanical components and process equipment. I regularly prepare
detailed 2D drawings, assemblies, BOMs and production documentation
while considering manufacturing processes, part interfaces, tolerances
and assembly requirements.

I have strong experience applying DFM/DFA, GD&T, tolerance stack-up,
limits and fits, material selection and dimensional inspection to
ensure components can be manufactured and assembled reliably. I also
carry out hand calculations and engineering calculations for load
paths, bending, deflection, member sizing, moment balance, fitment and
design validation, supported where required by SolidWorks Simulation
