One of the areas I particularly enjoy is taking an initial concept and
developing it into a practical, production-ready product. I have
worked closely with customers, fabricators and manufacturing teams to
resolve design, fit and production issues, and I am comfortable
balancing engineering performance with manufacturability, cost and
