	(394, '2026-09-23 09:00:09.016621+00', 'alksarioglou@gmail.com', 'Purpose:Labs - agentic business card hardware prototype', 'Dear team,

I’m Alkinoos, co-founder of Purpose:Labs. We’re part of a startup program
backed by Sam Altman, and we want to build an *agentic business card*, a
consumer hardware device and software experience designed to help turn
in-person introductions into meaningful relationships.

The device is carried by the user and *holds their selected personal
context and their AI agents on-device*. When two people meet, their devices
can exchange approved parts of that context, allowing their agents to
identify how they might collaborate, help one another, or create value.

We’re looking for a partner who can move quickly across some combination of
industrial/product design, UX and interaction design, electronics and
engineering, embedded systems, rapid prototyping, and small-batch build
support.

Our immediate goal is to produce *2–3 functional, visually compelling
physical demo units by the end of October 2026* for fundraising and
November demo days.

The first engagement would be short and intense. If there is a strong fit,
this could develop into a substantially larger long-term
product-development program after our next financing round. *Budget is open
for discussion.*

If this is something your team could take on, we’d love to know what parts
you could own, your earliest possible start date and a rough development
schedule and cost range.

Happy to jump directly on a call already from tomorrow:
https://calendly.com/alksarioglou/connect

Best,

*Alkinoos Sarioglou*
