	('c6e21432-ec81-4b22-b756-683809429768', 'Mohnish Sugand', 'mohnish_sugand@hotmail.com', '9920690195', 'Beauty Touch', 'NA', 'I am developing VYUN, a premium reusable scent/incense consumer object designed for modern homes and hospitality spaces.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'I''m looking for a product-development partner to take the concept through engineering, CAD, functional prototyping, DFM, and a production-ready design.

The product is a vertical architectural object with a thermally isolated incense combustion system, visible burn progression and a removable ash system. It also includes a passive Smoke Sculptor: an interchangeable top element designed to influence the smoke plume into distinctive natural forms such as a spiral, twin plume or halo
Our current retail pricing hypothesis is approximately ₹999–₹1,499, so the design needs to be commercially disciplined and aesthetically strong.

We are therefore particularly interested in:
low part count and efficient assembly
Prototyping with different materials
practical manufacturing processes
scalable architecture
transparent BOM/cost thinking
a clear path from prototype to approximately 1,000–10,000 units
avoiding unnecessary tooling or complexity at this stage', '{"Prototyping Services","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'Create an object that reads as a piece of contemporary interior design rather than conventional incense 
packaging 
 Keep the central incense axis, large top opening, visible burn state and ash containment legible without 
exposing a cluttered mechanism 
