and limited brass accents. (Provisional hypothesis and can be changed) 
 Preserve the ability to refill and service the product rather than treating it as disposable packaging. 
 Design the architecture for eventual hospitality use: stable, cleanable, repeatable, easy to inspect and 
suitable for small production batches', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Product Category: Packaging and FMCG products
