26-06-06T03:30:10.915Z","status":"sent","templateId":"tc-client-followup-1","messageIdHeader":"<4e78b536-80c3-e2a1-039a-264f6f8a7b5d@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":"19e7414a6224e71f","references":"<d3976104-19a9-38a8-15a6-0bc7904ab3d4@iuova.in> <ce1b543e-3224-2a0f-eb89-9c586b397e10@iuova.in>","direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-tc-gmail-19e97e0fb5b9d0ea","to":"n.sankpal@zitrushealthcare.com","cc":[],"subject":"Re: Request for Technical Support & Quotation – 46L Class B Steam Sterilizer Development","body":"Hi Nikhil,\r\n\r\nFollowing our meeting, we are awaiting the details of the 23L sterilizer\r\nand aesthetic references. Please share the CAD files for the 23L sterilizer\r\nand any relevant references.\r\n\r\nThese details will allow us to fully understand your requirements and\r\nprepare a tailored techno-commercial proposal for your review.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nOn Sat, May 30, 2026 at 10:16 AM Rupali Sirsath <crm@iuova.in> wrote:\r\n\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Hi,Greetings of the day!*\r\n>\r\n> Thanks for reaching out to IUOVA Design Company.\r\n>\r\n> *Please fill out the RFQ form with your detailed product requirements so\r\n> we can better understand your needs.*\r\n>\r\n> *RFQ Form Link: Product RFQ Form <https://iuovadesign.com/contact>*\r\n>\r\n> Our team will review it and respond with Techno-commercial details and\r\n> Project timelines.\r\n>\r\n> In the meantime, feel free to explore our* Product Catalogue 2026: **Iuova\r\n> Design Company Catalogue.\r\n> <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1C5wWC2v4y-VlZidpg1ZatRddvpiQxb0K/view?usp=drive_link>*\r\n>\r\n> You can also connect with us on LinkedIn or visit our Website.\r\n>\r\n> LinkedIn: (https://www.linkedin.com/company/iuovadesign/mycompany/)\r\n>\r\n> Website: (www.iuovadesign.com)\r\n>\r\n> *For further information, please reply to us.*\r\n>\r\n> *Thanks & Regards,*\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Fri, 29 May 2026 at 22:05, Iuova Support <support@iuova.in> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>>\r\n>> ---------- Forwarded message ---------\r\n>> From: Nikhil Sankpal <n.sankpal@zitrushealthcare.com>\r\n>> Date: Fri, 29 May 2026, 19:42\r\n>> Subject: Request for Technical Support & Quotation – 46L Class B Steam\r\n>> Sterilizer Development\r\n>> To: <support@iuova.in>\r\n>> Cc: Shivram <shivram@zitrushealthcare.com>, info@zitrushealthcare.com <\r\n>> info@zitrushealthcare.com>\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Dear Sir,\r\n>> We are currently working on the development of a 46 Liter Class B Steam\r\n>> Sterilizer, which is essentially an upscaled version of our existing 23\r\n>> Liter model.\r\n>> For this project, we are looking for technical support and engineering\r\n>> consultation in both theoretical and practical aspects related to the\r\n>> system design, component selection, and performance optimization.\r\n>> We would like to understand the level of technical support your team can\r\n>> provide in the following areas:\r\n>>\r\n>>    - Steam chamber design and calculations\r\n>>    - Vacuum pump selection and performance calculations\r\n>>    - Steam generator design and heater sizing\r\n>>    - Radiator / condenser selection\r\n>>    - Door locking and safety mechanism design\r\n>>    - Heater specifications and optimization\r\n>>    - Selection and integration of control sensors such as:\r\n>>    - RTD sensors\r\n>>       - Thermostats\r\n>>       - Pressure sensors\r\n>>       - Safety valves and related control components\r\n>>       - Vacuum and pressure cycle performance optimization\r\n>>    - System efficiency and process validation considerations\r\n>>\r\n>> We would appreciate support in terms of:\r\n>>\r\n>>    - Design calculations\r\n>>    - Technical recommendations\r\n>>    - Component sizing and selection\r\n>>    - Practical implementation guidance\r\n>>    - Troubleshooting and performance improvement suggestions\r\n>>\r\n>> Kindly let us know:\r\n>>\r\n>>    1. The scope and level of technical support your organization can\r\n>>    provide\r\n>>    2. Whether you offer consultation on a project basis or milestone\r\n>>    basis\r\n>>    3. Expected timelines for support\r\n>>    4. Commercial terms and quotation for your services\r\n>>\r\n>> Please feel free to share any additional details regarding your technical\r\n>> capabilities, previous experience in sterilizer/autoclave systems, and\r\n>> standard support process.\r\n>> Looking forward to your response.\r\n>> Best Regards,\r\n>> Nikhil Sankpal\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n> --\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Rupali SirsathBusiness Development Executive*\r\n> M: +91 - *81044 87664*\r\n> IUOVA PRODUCT DESIGN COMPANY\r\n> 504, Filix Tower, Mulund Goregaon Link Rd, Mulund West- 400080, Mumbai,\r\n> Maharashtra\r\n> iuovadesign.com\r\n>\r\n\r\n\r\n-- \r\n*\"Note: We recommend Prototyping and Validation Analysis before\r\nManufacturing/Tooling (where applicable).\"*\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards\r\n\r\n\r\n*Waseet Saad*\r\n\r\n*Engineering Manager **(M: +91-9767342679)*\r\n\r\n*Disclaimer - Breach of confidentiality*\r\n\r\nThis email and its attachments are confidential and intended solely for the\r\nrecipient. If you have received it in error, please notify the sender\r\nimmediately and delete it. Unauthorized use, disclosure, or distribution is\r\nprohibited.","sentAt":"2026-06-05T13:02:04.000Z","status":"sent","templateId":"techno-commercial","messageIdHeader":"<CALNTVuKeDdwABa-Q0Rk8vwMv3Q7Pkx5naoXcJCoTcxP--yWJDw@mail.gmail.com>","gmailThreadId":"19e7414a6224e71f","references":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"gmail-sent"},{"id":"reply-reminder-1780371006174","to":"n.sankpal@zitrushealthcare.com","cc":["developer@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: IUOVA Meeting on Wednesday, June 3, 2026 at 11:00 AM (Asia/Kolkata) - tomorrow","body":"Hi Nikhil,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is tomorrow.\n\nDate: Wednesday, June 3, 2026\nTime: 11:00 AM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/cni-hihx-fie\n\nIf you need to reschedu