	('93ab7bb4-9b9f-4813-9419-38ad34be3c54', 'SANDEEP MODI', 'sandeep@mywoobly.com', '09565664785', 'Woobly Private Limited', 'Woobly Private Limited', 'WOOBLY has built LUXEGENIE, a smart table concierge that connects guests, staff, and management across luxury restaurants and premium spaces. It improves guest experience, service efficiency, and revenue per table through connected smart devices and real-time communication.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'Design and develop the industrial and mechanical design of i-TAP, a premium RF and Wi-Fi enabled wireless service call button for luxury meeting rooms, boardrooms, hotels, and executive spaces. The scope includes concept design, product styling, ergonomics, mechanical enclosure design, material and finish selection (CMF), Design for Manufacturing (DFM), and prototype-ready 3D CAD and engineering drawings. ', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report)","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Prototyping Services"}', '3 lakhs', '1 - 2 months', 'Luxury Design and Haptic Touch with Light and Sound', true, 'PCB and touch panel', false, true, '200  pieces', 'We wish to redesign these existing Service Call Buttons into a luxury call button.', 4, 'Google', '2026-08-12', '12:00 PM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1786437012923-k5dx3ol.jpeg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1786437012926-0d0mag.jpeg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1786437012926-5eyas8.jpeg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1786437012926-hsoxxo.jpeg"]', '2026-08-11 08:30:14.266+00', '[{"id":"reply-tc-escalation-1787196614506","to":"developer@iuova.in, info@iuova.in, waseet@iuova.in, crm@iuova.in, anirudha@iuova.in","subject":"Escalation: no response after TC follow-ups (SANDEEP MODI)","body":"Hi Team,\n\nNo response