	('5bb8f099-3869-4071-9b78-b8f6e4cfa32b', 'Stephen Jacinth', 'stephenjacinth.officials@gmail.com', '9515189906', 'haven’t finalized ', 'N/A (Pre-launch)', 'We are building a luxury wellness brand focused on premium scented face masks that combine comfort, fragrance, and elegance. Our flagship product is a reusable luxury face mask infused with long-lasting signature scents through advanced fragrance technology. The brand is designed for premium consumers, luxury hotels, spas, first-class travelers, corporate executives, and wellness-conscious individuals. Our goal is to transform the traditional face mask into a premium lifestyle accessory that delivers comfort, freshness, and a luxurious sensory experience.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are developing a premium reusable luxury face mask that combines elegant design with a long-lasting signature fragrance. The product is intended to offer a sophisticated sensory experience while maintaining comfort, breathability, and high-quality materials. The project includes industrial product design, fragrance integration, material selection, premium packaging, prototyping, engineering for manufacturability, and preparation for mass production. The objective is to create a globally competitive luxury product that appeals to premium consumers, luxury hotels, spas, airlines, and corporate clients.

This is a luxury fashion accessory created for people who value privacy, confidence, and exclusivity

The inspiration comes from 
celebrities, influencers, creators, and public figures who don’t always want to be recognized or photographed wherever they go. However, the brand is for anyone who believes that privacy is a choice and that not everyone deserves access to them.
The mask is more than something you wear—it’s a statement. It represents confidence, mystery, and control over your personal space.', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report)","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Prototyping Services","Manufacturing Services","Product Engineering Services","Product Analysis Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'The most important feature is a discreet internal pocket that allows users to easily insert and remove a fragrance cartridge or scented insert. The system should securely hold the insert while allowing convenient replacement without affecting comfort or appearance.

In addition, the product should feature premium breathable fabric, an ergonomic fit, reusable and washable construction, luxury aesthetics, skin-safe materials, and premium packaging. The design should ensure that the fragrance is noticeable to the wearer without being overpowering to others.', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'I would like to understand the technical feasibility of the removable fragrance insert system, the most suitable materials, manufacturing process, estimated tooling and prototype costs, minimum order quantity (MOQ), intellectual property and patent guidance, product testing and certification requirements, expected development timeline, and the estimated cost for moving from concept to mass production. I would also appreciate your recommendations on improving the product while preserving its premium luxury positioning.', 4, 'Google', '2026-07-09', '10:00 AM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1783497846197-tcrkq.png","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1783497846198-q8lpik.png"]', '2026-07-08 08:04:17.398+00', '[{"id":"reply-reminder-1783567804548","to":"stephenjacinth.officials@gmail.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi Stephen Jacinth,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Thursday, July 9, 2026\nTime: 10:00 AM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/nfv-xrtw-bwb\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-07-09T03:30:04.548Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<fddb5278-98c5-be0b-4bda-764b2fdd771a@iuova.in>","references_id":"<1221c614-b9a1-092c-b7ba-ae7e1cfd18f7@iuova.in> <0c1a800c-1cef-e0f2-07aa-627580315490@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/nfv-xrtw-bwb', NULL, '