	('da7821a5-cd65-4b90-8926-ba455e80100a', 'gurpreet singh', 'gsingh@swow.uk', '+44 7440 251921', 'swow ltd', 'famiwatch.com', 'Industrial Design Enquiry – FAMI Watch - in production', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are developing FAMI Watch, a new family safety wearable brand. The first product is a premium children’s safety watch focused on simplicity, durability, GPS/SOS, calling, long battery life, waterproofing and a low-distraction design.

This is not intended to be another toy-like smartwatch. We want the design to feel more like a premium safety/outdoor device: clean, durable, minimal and trusted by parents, while still appealing to children through straps and accessories.

At this stage, we are looking for an industrial design partner to help with:

product design direction
case shape and ergonomics
child/adult size options
button layout
protective bezel design
strap system
colours, materials and finish
premium but manufacturable design
concept sketches and product renders', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Manufacturing Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'We are developing FAMI Watch, a new family safety wearable brand. The first product is a premium children’s safety watch focused on simplicity, durability, GPS/SOS, calling, long battery life, waterproofing and a low-distraction design.

This is not intended to be another toy-like smartwatch. We want the design to feel more like a premium safety/outdoor device: clean, durable, minimal and trusted by parents, while still appealing to children through straps and accessories.

At this stage, we are looking for an industrial design partner to help with:

product design direction
case shape and ergonomics
child/adult size options
button layout
protective bezel design
strap system
colours, materials and finish
premium but manufacturable design
concept sketches and product renders', false, NULL, false, true, 'Prototype: 5–20 units; Pilot production: 500 units; Initial mass production target: 2,000 units, subject to final cost, testing and pre-orders.', 'na', 4, 'Google', '2026-07-02', '05:00 PM', NULL, '2026-06-30 20:19:10.211+00', '[{"id":"reply-reminder-1782963004314","to":"gsingh@swow.uk","cc":["developer@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi gurpreet singh,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Thursday, July 2, 2026\nTime: 05:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/aaw-uect-ycw\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-07-02T03:30:04.314Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<440f81bf-b6d4-5b97-0009-4c14bb3284ac@iuova.in>","references_id":"<e4a0b7e0-4709-6a3e-df50-653ae62b18e2@iuova.in> <2a5e271e-f4d6-e5a5-fbb1-25b79ef15063@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-reminder-1782876608584","to":"gsingh@swow.uk","cc":["developer@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is tomorrow","body":"Hi gurpreet singh,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is tomorrow.\n\nDate: Thursday, July 2, 2026\nTime: 05:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/aaw-uect-ycw\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-07-01T03:30:08.584Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-tomorrow","messageIdHeader":"<fd765d46-683c-10b4-8f25-ac75448bb4b3@iuova.in>","references_id":"<e4a0b7e0-4709-6a3e-df50-653ae62b18e2@iuova.in> <2a5e271e-f4d6-e5a5-fbb1-25b79ef15063@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/aaw-uect-ycw', NULL, '<2a5e271e-f4d6-e5a5-fbb1-25b79ef15063@iuova.in>', '<e4a0b7e0-4709-6a3e-df50-653ae62b18e2@i