	('5aa04a06-84d8-4f88-85d7-6c95f3f4d08a', 'Ajinkya Salunkhe', 'ajinkyasalunkhe3517@gmail.com', '9356990736', 'JSG Cymetra', 'NA', 'We are a technology-driven startup focused on developing innovative smart consumer products with an initial focus on the pet-tech industry. Our first flagship product is a smart pet wearable designed to enhance pet safety, health monitoring, activity tracking, and real-time connectivity through an integrated hardware and mobile application ecosystem.

The company’s vision is to build scalable IoT-enabled solutions that combine intelligent technology, user-centric design, and practical everyday utility for modern consumers.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are building a next-generation smart pet wearable ecosystem focused on pet safety, health monitoring, activity tracking, and real-time connectivity. The product aims to integrate IoT hardware, intelligent analytics, and a mobile application to help pet owners monitor and manage their pets more effectively.

Our long-term vision is to create a scalable pet-tech platform combining wearable technology, preventive healthcare insights, location intelligence, and smart alerts into one seamless ecosystem.', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report)","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Manufacturing Services"}', '10 - 15 Lakhs INR (Upto 20000 USD)', '5-6 months', 'We are developing a compact smart wearable device for pets integrated with sensors, GPS/location capabilities, activity tracking, and app-based monitoring. The ecosystem will provide:

Real-time pet tracking
Activity and health monitoring
Geofencing and safety alerts
Mobile app integration
Smart notifications and analytics
Waterproof and durable wearable design
Long battery optimization
Future AI-based behavioral insights

The goal is to build a scalable and premium-quality pet wearable suitable for both domestic and international markets.', false, NULL, false, true, 'NA', 'NA', 4, 'Google', '2026-06-16', '10:00 AM', NULL, '2026-06-17 08:02:08.131+00', '[{"id":"reply-tc-followup-1782790209298","to":"ajinkyasalunkhe3517@gmail.com","cc":["support@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in"],"subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi Ajinkya Salunkhe,\n\nJust checking in to see if you had a chance to review our techno-commercial proposal.\n\nIf you have any questions, please reply to this email and we will be happy to help.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-06-30T03:30:09.298Z","status":"sent","templateId":"tc-client-followup-3","messageIdHeader":"<2e1d237c-0ee7-7807-1b82-b53b233822cc@iuova.in>","references":"<652e9be7-84d7-3d69-4cb3-daef6f094d4a@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-tc-followup-1782617408559","to":"ajinkyasalunkhe3517@gmail.com","cc":["support@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in"],"subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi Ajinkya Salunkhe,\n\nJust checking in to see if you had a chance to review our techno-commercial proposal.\n\nIf you have any questions, please reply to this email and we will be happy to help.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-06-28T03:30:08.559Z","status":"sent","templateId":"tc-client-followup-2","messageIdHeader":"<41984c5d-b2e8-6e55-2282-740e58f4fdf5@iuova.in>","references":"<652e9be7-84d7-3d69-4cb3-daef6f094d4a@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-tc-followup-1782444622704","to":"ajinkyasalunkhe3517@gmail.com","cc":["support@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in"],"subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi Ajinkya Salunkhe,\n\nJust checking in to see if you had a chance to review our techno-commercial proposal.\n\nIf you have any questions, please reply to this email an