	('5547f8f7-7dc0-4ced-9879-9f72d03dd0ee', 'Sanjeev Kumar', 'sanjeev.kumar@greengine.co.in', '9984268900, 8948116363', 'Greengine Environmental Technologie''s Private Limited', 'www.greengine.co.in', 'Greengine Environmental Technologies Private Limited is a cleantech startup, providing sustainable solution to the problem of climate change by decarbonizing world through its unique Microalgae based Carbon Capture Technology.our offerrings are Industrial cacrbon capture & Direct Air carbon capture.Our esteemed clients are Indian oil corporation limited and Engineers India limited.', '0 -10 Crores INR', 'Product: We are designing a compact indoor Air Purifier intended for residential and office use. The tentative outer dimensions of the product are:

