	('6fc3738d-d4ec-439f-b696-b276ebcf9d8e', 'ANKESH', 'hello@elvarq.com', '9324041580', 'ELVARQ', 'www.elvarq.com', 'ELVARQ is building a premium automated retail amenity system for high-end residential, commercial, hospitality, and lifestyle environments. Our focus is to transform conventional vending-style machines into refined, design-led, premium appliance-like retail systems suitable for luxury spaces.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are working on a premium automated retail amenity machine based on an existing plain/base vending machine platform. The base machine will be sourced from a vending machine manufacturer, and the internal vending mechanism, core cabinet structure, electronics, and dispensing system will remain largely unchanged.

The required scope is exterior cosmetic redesign and industrial design refinement within the feasibility of the existing machine platform. This includes front fascia refinement, CMF direction, premium appliance-like exterior treatment, side/back panel detailing, logo integration, subtle lighting direction, and overall visual transformation.

We are not looking for a complete vending machine engineering redesign or a full cabinet redevelopment at this stage. The objective is to convert a plain/base vending machine into a premium, minimal, architectural, luxury-appliance-inspired automated retail amenity suitable for high-end residential clubhouses, corporate lobbies, hotels, gyms, and commercial spaces.

To clarify, this is not a vinyl sticker branding, graphic wrap, or basic logo application project. We are looking for a premium industrial-design-led exterior transformation with an appliance-grade feel, refined CMF, panel treatment, detailing, and high-end product finish.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Analysis Services","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'Key requirements:

Premium, minimal, luxury-appliance-inspired exterior design.
Cosmetic redesign of an existing plain/base vending machine platform.
No complete cabinet redesign and no change to the internal vending mechanism, electronics, or dispensing system.
CMF direction should include a premium anti-fingerprint, anti-dust, satin/matte body finish with brushed champagne silver accents.
Exterior should feel refined, architectural, and suitable for luxury residential, corporate, hospitality, and premium commercial spaces.
Design scope should include front fascia refinement, side/back panel detailing, logo integration, subtle lighting direction, and premium visual transformation.
Avoid flashy gold, bronze, gaming-style, overly futuristic, or industrial-looking design language.
Final design should remain practical and feasible for execution on a plain/base vending machine ordered from a vending machine manufacturer.
The requirement is not simple vinyl sticker branding, graphic wrapping, or surface-level branding. We are looking for a premium industrial-design-led exterior transformation with an appliance-grade feel, refined CMF, panel treatment, detailing, and high-end product finish.
We prefer to share detailed references, machine images, and proprietary brand direction after an initial discussion and NDA.', true, 'Yes. The base/plain vending machine platform will be sourced from an external vending machine manufacturer. The existing vending mechanism, cabinet structure, electronics, touchscreen, payment/dispensing system, cooling system, and internal product delivery mechanism will remain largely unchanged.

IUOVA’s scope is expected to focus on exterior industrial design, cosmetic redesign, CMF, front fascia refinement, side/back panel detailing, logo integration, subtle lighting direction, and premium appliance-like visual transformation within feasible limits.', false, false, NULL, 'We would like to first understand IUOVA’s experience in industrial design, cosmetic redesign, CMF development, exterior panel detailing, appliance-like product aesthetics, and prototype support for kiosk-style or machine-based products.

Our requirement is not to redesign the entire vending machine from scratch. We will source a plain/base vending machine from a vending machine manufacturer, and we are looking for external industrial design support to refine the exterior cosmetics, CMF, fascia, panel detailing, logo integration, lighting direction, and premium visual language within feasible limits.

To clarify, we are not looking for simple vinyl sticker branding, graphic wrapping, or basic logo application on a vending machine. The objective is to create a premium industry-level appliance feel through refined material direction, finish selection, subtle detailing, panel treatment, lighting refinement, and an overall high-end product design language.

Since the project involves proprietary brand direction and product references, we would prefer to have an initial discussion first and then proceed with NDA before sharing detailed machine images, design references, manufacturer details, and complete requirements.', 5, 'Google', '2026-08-19', '03:00 PM', NULL, '2026-07-02 12:29:01.931+00', '[{"id":"reply-tc-client-1a02850d87a95549","to":"support@iuova.in","cc":[],"subject":"Re: Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Thank you for sharing the technical and commercial offer.\r\n\r\nWe have reviewed it internally and would like to discuss it further. Please\r\nlet me know if it would be possible to connect today at 4:00 PM.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to speaking with you.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nELVARQ Team\r\n\r\nOn Sat, Aug 22, 2026 at 9:00 AM <support@iuova.in> wrote:\r\n\r\n> *Hi ANKESH,*\r\n>\r\n> *Greetings to you!*\r\n>\r\n> Just checking in to see if you had a chance *to review our Techno\r\n> Commercial offer in detail.*\r\n>\r\n> We can arrange a *quick 15 minutes meeting to explain in detail* if\r\n> required.\r\n>\r\n> If you have any questions, please reply to this email.\r\n>\r\n> We are happy to help.\r\n>\r\n> *Awaiting your positive response!*\r\n> >Regards,\r\n>\r\n> Regards,\r\n> *IUOVA Team*\r\n>","sentAt":"2026-08-22T07:12:49.000Z","status":"read","templateId":null,"messageIdHeader":"<CACKf_f37Ga0AeSc1dYaLKkA1PVmNchztCZmVd+AaaFCqZrUSbg@mail.gmail.com>","gmailThreadId":"1a02785081f51e0e","references":"<76a3a043-9d32-9b7b-7865-3316b03dff29@iuova.in> <6fbe868c-1ebf-125a-5f50-85ca10b0a2c5@iuova.in> <e4fac2a5-0c16-eab2-094d-44e520053130@iuova.in>","direction":"inbound","source":"gmail-inbox"},{"id":"reply-tc-followup-1787369425697","to":"hello@elvarq.com","cc":["support@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in"],"subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi ANKESH,\n\nJust checking in to see if you had a chance to review our techno-commercial proposal.\n\nIf you have any questions