	('d9ed3cb4-a5fc-487a-99d9-7a1e127720f8', 'Ajinkya Salunkhe', 'ajinkyasalunkhe3517@gmail.com', '9356990736', 'JSG Cymetra', 'NA', 'We are a technology-driven startup focused on developing innovative smart consumer products with an initial focus on the pet-tech industry. Our first flagship product is a smart pet wearable designed to enhance pet safety, health monitoring, activity tracking, and real-time connectivity through an integrated hardware and mobile application ecosystem.

The company’s vision is to build scalable IoT-enabled solutions that combine intelligent technology, user-centric design, and practical everyday utility for modern consumers.', '0 -10 Crores INR', 'We are building a next-generation smart pet wearable ecosystem focused on pet safety, health monitoring, activity tracking, and real-time connectivity. The product aims to integrate IoT hardware, intelligent analytics, and a mobile application to help pet owners monitor and manage their pets more effectively.

