Real-time pet tracking
Activity and health monitoring
Geofencing and safety alerts
Mobile app integration
Smart notifications and analytics
Waterproof and durable wearable design
Long battery optimization
Future AI-based behavioral insights

The goal is to build a scalable and premium-quality pet wearable suitable for both domestic and international markets.', false, 'NA', false, true, '-', 'NA', 4, 'Google', '2026-05-19', '16:19:25', 'NA', '2026-07-22 10:16:17.456741+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'NA', false, NULL, NULL),
