	('90dcdc7f-15af-4cc1-b914-9c62e2f9246f', 'Aman Mishra', 'aman.m@aivot.ai', '7869403405', 'AIVOT AI', 'www.aivot.ai', 'Aivot AI is a startup that develops artificial-intelligence solutions and products to help businesses automate tasks, analyze data, and build smarter digital systems. The company works with technologies like machine learning, natural language processing, computer vision, and IoT to create applications for areas such as healthcare monitoring, body measurement and dermatology analysis, predictive analytics, and workflow automation. In addition to building its own AI products, Aivot AI also offers consulting and implementation services to help organizations integrate AI into their existing systems.', '0 -10 Crores INR', 'Greetings from AIVOT AI.
My name is Aman Mishra, and I am reaching out regarding a potential collaboration for the industrial design and enclosure development of our device.
We have recently developed a working prototype of our device with the following specifications:
