Shamil SK', '{"Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Manufacturing Services","Product Analysis Services","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '0 - 1 months', 'E-Paper Display, Syncing feature with Mobile via App...', false, NULL, false, true, '1000', 'NIL', 3, 'Google', '2026-08-25', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24 14:03:16.993+00', '[{"id":"reply-1787655333558","to":"shamilsk1911@gmail.com","cc":["info@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in, waseet@iuova.in, anirudha@iuova.in"],"subject":"Missed Meeting - Reschedule Request","body":"Dear Shamil SK,\n\nWe hope you''re doing well.\n\nIt seems we couldn''t connect for our scheduled online meeting today. We understand that unexpected commitments can arise.\n\nPlease let us know a convenient date and time for you, and we''ll be happy to reschedule the meeting. We look forward to connecting with you.\n\nBest regards,\nTeam IUOVA","sentAt":"2026-08-25T10:55:33.558Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-missed","messageIdHeader":"<b15340bd-8669-a918-b59b-170ec9b037d4@iuova.in>","references":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<b15340bd-8669-a918-b59b-170ec9b037d4@iuova.in>', false, false, NULL, 'Hand Size E Reader', false, NULL, NULL),
	('4fb9b1e1-726c-4018-a17e-8968e5c710ef', 'Victor Villazon', 'victor.villazon@villazoncode.com', '015754390209', 'Villazon Code', 'Under development / Pre-launch stage ([www.villazoncode.com]', 'Villazon Code is an emerging, pre-launch Berlin-based menswear and accessories brand with a strong focus on hardware implementation, kinetic structures, and custom metalwork in its designs.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'Development of a high-end, kinetic articulated bodypiece shaped as a snake, designed to drape ergonomically across the torso and function as a standalone sculpture when off the body. Scope of work includes: 3D CAD engineering from concept renders, designing hidden multi-link joints/mechanisms, SLA prototyping for physical fit tests, and batch manufacturing setup (investment casting preparation, hand assembly, and electroplating oversight).', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Manufacturing Services"}', 'Budget to be finalized upon review of the technical scope and RFQ proposal post-NDA execution. Target is low-volume / batch manufacturing development.', '2 - 3 months', '1. Dual-Purpose Architecture: Ergonomic, fluid draping across the human torso when worn, while maintaining self-supporting structural balance as a standalone sculpture when on display.

2. Modular Kinetic Mechanics: Multi-link articulated structure with concealed micro-hinges and smooth pivot movement.

3. Internal Mechanism Integration: Dedicated internal housing within the links for functional/sound mechanisms.

4. Production Readiness: Precision micro-casting tolerances (brass/bronze), gem setting alignment, and concealed brand hallmarking.', false, NULL, false, true, '1 Golden Sample (Master Prototype for marketing and pre-order launch), followed by low-volume batches (10–20 units per batch).', 'NDA & Design Brief: We look forward to receiving the countersigned NDA so we can share our concept PDF, reference renders, and design preferences prior to our scheduled call.', 5, 'Google', '2026-07-29', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28 10:46:56.034+00', '[{"id":"reply-1785318524779","to":"victor.villazon@villazoncode.com","cc":["info@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in, waseet@iuova.in, anirudha@iuova.in"],"subject":"Missed Meeting - Reschedule Request","body":"Dear Victor Villazon,\n\nWe hope you''re doing well.\n\nIt seems we couldn''t connect for our scheduled online meeting today. We understand that unexpected commitments can arise.\n\nPlease let us know a convenient date and time for you, and we''ll be happy to reschedule the meeting. We look forward to connecting with you.\n\nBest regards,\nTeam IUOVA","sentAt":"2026-07-29T09:48:44.779Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-missed","messageIdHeader":"<3282240b-8ac1-fc99-c40a-206acd7f7ce5@iuova.in>","references":"<35948093-d0e4-5e62-fea2-ed0a8c30ba20@iuova.in>","direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-reminder-1785295804527","to":"victor.villazon@villazoncode.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi Victor Villazon,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Wednesday, July 29, 2026\nTime: 03:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/gvg-ssta-keb\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-07-29T03:30:04.527Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<35948093-d0e4-5e62-fea2-ed0a8c30ba20@iuova.in>","references_id":"<8b3f1e22-c49d-cf31-3