	('035103c5-3446-48d7-b409-1470a696b495', 'Abhijeet Kuwar', 'abhijeet.kuwar@sansunfitness.in', '9552538227', 'Sansun Industries Pvt Ltd', 'www.sansunfitness.in', 'Sansun Industries is one of India''s leading manufacturers of outdoor fitness, playground, sports, and recreational infrastructure with over 30 years of industry experience. As part of the Jadhav Group of Companies, Sansun is committed to designing and manufacturing high-quality, durable, and internationally compliant products that promote healthier, safer, and more active communities. With a strong presence across India and growing international partnerships, Sansun delivers innovative solutions for parks, schools, public spaces, residential projects, institutions, and smart cities.', '50 - 100 Crores INR', 'Sansun Industries aims to redefine the future of playgrounds by developing an innovative range of play equipment that goes beyond conventional slides and swings. Our vision is to create engaging, inclusive, and aesthetically striking play experiences that inspire imagination, creativity, learning, and physical development for children of all ages.

The new product range should incorporate modern design language, unique play concepts, modular configurations, interactive elements, and nature-inspired themes while ensuring the highest standards of safety, durability, and sustainability. We encourage fresh thinking that integrates sensory play, cognitive development, social interaction, adventure play, fitness, and inclusive accessibility for children with diverse abilities.

The designs should also emphasize premium visual appeal, efficient manufacturing, ease of installation, and global market relevance, positioning Sansun as an innovation leader in the playground industry. The objective is to create products that are not only fun but become iconic landmarks in parks, schools, residential communities, and public spaces worldwide.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '2 - 3 months', '1. Signature design language
2. Inclusive play (handicapped, autism, and sensory play)
3. Multi age design
4. Adventure play
5. Nature-based play
6. Open ended play
7. Sensory play
8. Interactive technology (if possible/optional)
9. Sustainability (optional)
Each design should be modular if I have to customize them.
