	('d22c527a-2c1b-42b9-b2ff-138ecc6fab4d', 'Sarvesh Sharad Sonawane', 'sarvesh.sonawane1@gmail.com', '9892738108', 'SSS Enterprise', 'Not Available', 'I am currently in the process of developing an innovative consumer product in the functional beverage industry. The venture is in its early product development stage and is focused on designing a novel dispensing-cap technology that enables on-demand mixing of functional ingredients with bottled water. I am seeking an experienced design and engineering partner to help transform the concept into a commercially viable prototype.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'The product is a 500 ml disposable water bottle with a sports sipper cap. Unlike a conventional bottle, the cap contains a sealed chamber that stores a powdered beverage mix. Upon user activation, a breakable membrane mechanism releases the powder into the water, allowing the consumer to shake the bottle and instantly prepare a fresh functional beverage such as an electrolyte drink, energy drink, or vitamin drink.

The design partner will be expected to undertake the following activities:

1. Product Concept Development

* Review and refine the product concept.
* Suggest design improvements for functionality, user experience, and manufacturability.
* Develop multiple concept options for evaluation.

2. Industrial Design

* Design the external appearance of the sipper cap.
* Ensure ergonomic operation and premium aesthetics.
* Design the bottle-cap interface.

3. Mechanical Engineering

* Design the complete dispensing mechanism.
* Develop the breakable membrane activation system.
* Design the powder storage chamber.
* Design the sipper mechanism and sealing system.
* Ensure leak-proof performance before and after activation.

4. CAD & Engineering Documentation

* 3D CAD modelling of all components.
* Exploded assembly drawings.
* Cross-sectional views.
* Manufacturing drawings with tolerances.
* Bill of Materials (BOM).

5. Prototype Development

* Produce functional prototypes using 3D printing or other suitable methods.
* Assemble and test the prototype.
* Refine the design based on test results.

6. Product Testing

* Leak testing.
* Powder release efficiency.
* Mixing performance.
* Ease of user activation.
* Durability during transportation.
* Shelf-life considerations.

7. Design for Manufacturing (DFM)

* Optimize the design for injection moulding.
* Recommend suitable food-grade materials.
* Reduce part count and manufacturing cost.
* Prepare the design for mass production.

8. Tooling Support

* Assist in tooling design for injection moulds.
* Coordinate with mould manufacturers if required.
* Support first production trials.

9. Deliverables

* Complete 3D CAD files.
* Engineering drawings.
* Exploded assembly.
* Functional prototype(s).
* Design validation report.
* DFM report.
* Tooling recommendations.
* Manufacturing-ready design package.

10. Intellectual Property & Confidentiality

* All designs, engineering documents, CAD files, prototypes, and related intellectual property developed during the project shall remain the exclusive property of the client.
* The project shall be undertaken under a mutually executed Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA), and all information shared during the engagement shall remain strictly confidential.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '2 - 3 months', 'A patented (or patent-pending) dispensing cap that stores functional ingredients separately and releases them into the water only when the consumer activates it, delivering a freshly prepared beverage in seconds.', false, NULL, false, true, '1000 to start with', 'Not Applicable', 5, 'Google', '2026-08-17', '04:00 PM', NULL, '2026-08-07 03:54:28.48+00', '[{"id":"reminder-1787726140568-aha5f3","to":"sarvesh.sonawane1@gmail.com","subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi Sarvesh Sharad Sonawane,\n\n                                                    Greetings to you!\n\n                                                    Just checking in to see if you had a chance to review our Techno Commercial offer in detail.\n\n                                                    We can arrange a quick 15 minutes meeting to explain in detail if required.\n\n                                                    If you have any questions, please reply to this email. We are happy to help.\n\n                                                    Awaiting your positive response!\n\n                                                    Regards,\n                                                    Team Iuova.","sentAt":"2026-08-26T06:35:40.568Z","status":"sent","direction":"outbound","source":"rfq-reminder-manual","gmailMessageId":"<c692dcb9-d338-8701-5b16-fe66d18d7916@iuova.in>","messageIdHeader":"<c692dcb9-d338-8701-5b16-fe66d18d7916@iuova.in>"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/dop-fadd-toh', NULL, '<ad31b86d-3342-d08f-39b1-73b2d7b2592c@iuova.in>', '<c692dcb9-d338-8701-5b16-fe66d18d7916@iuova.in>', true, true, '2026-08-18 08:26:03.784+00', 'Innovative Beverage Dispensing Cap', true, NULL, NULL),
	('b8c77afe-922b-47e9-8a3d-8467a1fee53b', 'Parth Vikamsey', 'parthvikamsey@gmail.com', '9619399147', 'NA', 'NA', 'Watch Brand from India, still in a very early phase. ', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We''re developing an original, premium automatic mechanical wristwatch collection inspired by the power, elegance and character of the wild.

