	('7307fd88-f050-4c98-b5c3-68036e056c84', 'jheel patel', 'jheelpatel1@gmail.com', '8369385414', 'Greenfield Logistics ', '.', 'We are an early-stage personal care brand focused on developing innovative and thoughtfully designed feminine hygiene products for the Indian market. Our aim is to create comfortable, user-centric products that address everyday challenges women face during their menstrual cycle. We are currently in the product research and development phase.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are developing a premium sanitary pad for the Indian market, currently at the early concept and product research stage. We have initial ideas regarding product functionality, comfort, leakage protection and overall user experience.

We are looking for a design partner to help translate these ideas into a professional, manufacturable product concept. The scope would initially involve concept development, 2D product drawings, basic 3D/CAD modelling, preliminary dimensions, layered product visualization and design documentation that can be further evaluated by a product engineer or OEM manufacturer.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Prototyping Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'The product should focus on comfort, skin-friendliness, reliable absorption, improved side-leakage protection and a premium user experience.

