	('a2378510-d4e2-4ae9-ae11-b95b1fac563e', 'Rhea Bhandari', 'rhea@neuroequilibrium.in', '9001795753', 'NeuroEquilibrium', 'www.neuroequilibrium.in', 'We are specialists in Vertigo, Dizziness and Balance Disorder diagnosis and treatment and have 300 clinics in India for the same.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'Bimodal neuromodulation means using two different types of stimulation together to influence how the nervous system processes signals. “Bimodal” means two modes; “neuromodulation” means changing neural activity.

