	('5d3d07e7-925b-49f0-aaa7-b9efd8aaece8', 'Ravikant Tyagi', 'ravikanttyagi249@gmail.com', '7024865643', 'Little Buddha', 'na ', 'Little Buddha is a premium wellness and recovery brand focused on smart cold and hot therapy systems for home and commercial use. We are developing a connected recovery platform that combines precision temperature-controlled therapy, smart hardware, and personalized recovery protocols.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'Little Buddha is a premium smart hot and cold recovery system for home and commercial use. The core product architecture, A1/A2 configurations, package space, dimensions and technology direction have already been defined. We require IUOVA to take the existing concept through industrial design, product engineering, CAD, DFM/DFA, prototyping, testing and refinement, and support it through the development of 5–10 production intent units ready for pilot deployment.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Product Analysis Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', '1. Premium industrial design and refined user experience while retaining the existing architecture and dimensions.
2. Dual hot + cold therapy with precise and reliable temperature control.
3. Modular, easily serviceable cooling system for quick maintenance and replacement.
4. Smart connectivity with app control and wearable integration through HealthKit/Health Connect.
5. Personalized recovery protocols based on user data and goals.
6. Safety, durability and reliability for both home and commercial use.
7. Design optimized for DFM/DFA, servicing and scalable production.
8. Production-intent quality suitable for pilot deployment and initial customer sales.
