	('7ec356aa-4f4c-4428-a465-c3981a17f980', 'Sharif Khan', 'force24sa@gmail.com', '9545670880', 'Force24 Lifestyle Private Limited', 'force24.in', 'Force24 Lifestyle Pvt. Ltd. is an Indian consumer products company engaged in the development, sourcing and marketing of practical lifestyle, home and electrical products. We sell products through major e-commerce channels and are currently expanding our product portfolio into consumer electrical products, including extension boards and related power accessories.

For this project, we are looking for an experienced product development and manufacturing partner who can support us from product engineering and prototyping through compliance and mass production.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'Development of a premium 5-socket extension board/power strip for the Indian market under our Force24 brand. The product concept, visual direction and key features have already been defined by us.

Scope required includes refinement of industrial design, complete mechanical and electrical engineering, component selection, safety design, DFM/DFA, 3D CAD development, functional prototyping, testing and preparation of production-ready drawings/BOM.

The product should be engineered for reliable mass production and compliance with applicable Indian safety/BIS requirements. We would also like support in identifying suitable manufacturing processes, tooling requirements and production partners where required.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Product Analysis Services","Manufacturing Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '0 - 1 months', '• 5 universal sockets suitable for Indian and commonly used international plugs
• Red child-safety shutters integrated into each socket
• Single master ON/OFF switch with integrated LED indication
• Overload and surge protection
• Appropriate earthing and electrical safety architecture
• Fire-retardant, high-quality enclosure materials
• Premium warm off-white textured front surface
• Translucent crimson-red lower housing with a subtle frosted/rain-glass effect that partially obscures internal components
• Smooth premium rounded corners and approximately 8° inclined ergonomic design
• Anti-slip rubber feet and stable desktop construction
• Approx. 2-5metre heavy-duty power cable with Indian 3-pin plug
• Target rating around 10A / 250V AC, subject to engineering validation
• Product must be designed for applicable Indian safety/BIS compliance and mass manufacturing
• Design should allow efficient injection moulding, assembly, servicing and quality control', false, NULL, false, false, '1000', 'Product Category: Electrical and electronic products
Organization Type: Retailer or e-commerce brand

We would like to understand your end-to-end capabilities for this project, particularly:

• Whether electrical/electronic engineering and safety compliance are handled in-house
• Experience developing extension boards, power strips or similar mains-powered electrical products
• Support available for BIS certification/testing and applicable Indian standards
• Prototype development process, expected iterations and prototype costs
• Injection mould/tooling development capabilities and estimated tooling approach
• Whether you can support component sourcing and vendor development in India
• Whether manufacturing can be arranged directly through your facility or approved manufacturing partners
• Ownership of final CAD files, drawings, BOM, tooling and other intellectual property after project completion
• Estimated development timeline from concept refinement to production-ready prototype
• Indicative NRE/development, prototyping and tooling costs
• MOQ and indicative production cost at different volume levels, if manufacturing support is provided

We already have a defined product concept and visual direction and can share our reference renders after initial discussion. We are looking for a partner who can convert the concept into a safe, compliant and commercially manufacturable product while maintaining the intended Force24 design identity.', 5, 'Google', '2026-09-23', '05:00 PM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1790050429327-z95p2i.png","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1790050429329-ylah6g.jpg"]', '2026-09-22 04:13:51.431+00', '[{"id":"reminder-1790685791075-wxklrc","to":"force24sa@gmail.com","subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi Sharif Khan,\n\n                                                    Greetings to you!\n\n                                                    Just checking in to see if you had a chance to review our Techno Commercial offer in detail.\n\n                                                    We can arrange a quick 15 minutes meeting to explain in detail if required.\n\n                                                    If you have any questions, please reply to this email. We are happy to help.\n\n                                                    Awaiting your positive response!\n\n                                                    Regards,\n                                                    Team Iuova.","sentAt":"2026-09-29T12:43:11.075Z","status":"sent","direction":"outbound","source":"rfq-reminder-manual","gmailMessageId":"<cf7c0193-a948-8428-ebee-dea1d8d3c6fb@iuova.in>","messageIdHeader":"<cf7c0193-a948-8428-ebee-dea1d8d3c6fb@iuova.in>"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/pmt-pcwj-rhu', NULL, '<953c9790-8bf3-63a1-0267-0fae98a5d2ec@iuova.in>', '<cf7c0193-a948-8428-ebee-dea1d8d3c6fb@iuova.in>', true, true, '2026-09-24 07:14:32.557+00', 'Force24 Lifestyle Pvt. Ltd. is an Indian consumer products company engaged in the development, sourcing and marketing of practical lifestyle, home and electrical products. We sell products through major e-commerce channels and are currently expanding our product portfolio into consumer electrical products, including extension boards and related power accessories.  For this project, we are looking for an experienced product development and manufacturing partner who can support us from product engineering and prototyping through compliance and mass production.', true, 'Electrical and electronic products', 'Retailer or e-commerce brand'),
	('c1418f74-2e67-41f5-aacf-9482369b3522', 'Pratik Pingle', 'ppingle999@gmail.com', '9403215436', 'Plora Labs', 'NA', 'PLora Labs is a consumer wellness startup founded by two Chartered Accountants and an Electronics Engineer, united by a shared curiosity to solve everyday problems through thoughtful product innovation. We believe that quality sleep is one of the most overlooked pillars of health, yet millions of Indians struggle to build consistent sleep habits. Our mission is to reimagine the bedtime experience by creating scientifically informed, beautifully designed products that transform sleep into a meaningful nightly ritual. With a strong focus on the Indian consumer, PLora Labs is building the next generation of sleep solutions that seamlessly combine technology, design, and behavioural science to help people sleep better and wake up refreshed.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are currently developing PLora Escape, a bedside sleep companion that combines light, sound, and aroma for a guided Sleep to Wake up ritual. The product operates independently after a one-time web setup, with daily routines managed onboard.

We are seeking a product development partner to build 5–10 fully functional, enclosed engineering prototypes for user testing. A clean enclosure (such as 3D-printed) is acceptable at this stage. I have attached our functional workflow document outlining the product logic and user journey.', '{"Prototyping Services","Product Engineering Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '0 - 1 months', '1. Develop a fully functional bedside device with an integrated light, speaker, aroma diffuser, physical controls and power management, housed in a clean, user-ready enclosure (3D-printed enclosure is acceptable for the prototype).

2. Develop the complete embedded firmware to execute the predefined sleep and wake workflow, including sunset/sunrise lighting, local audio playback, aroma diffusion, alarm scheduling, snooze functionality and device controls, as detailed in the attached workflow document.', false, NULL, false, true, '25', 'We are looking to develope the Prototype for the beta testing and user feedback basis which we will be developing the final architecture of the product and  ready to launch product.', 5, 'Google', '2026-08-10', '03:00 PM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1786203831462-ief31o.pdf"]', '2026-08-08 15:43:53.647+00', '[{"id":"reminder-1788866813488-h2610g","to":"ppingle999@gmail.com","subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi Pratik Pingle,\n\n                                                    Greetings to you!\n\n                                                    Just checking in to see if you had a chance to review our Techno Commercial offer in detail.\n\n                                                    We can arrange a quick 15 minutes meeting to explain in detail if required.\n\n                                                    If you have any questions, please reply to this email. We are happy to help.\n\n                                                    Awaiting your positive response!\n\n                                                    Regards,\n                                                    Team Iuova.","sentAt":"2026-09-08T11:26:53.488Z","status":"sent","direction":"outbound","source":"rfq-reminder-manual","gmailMessageId":"<53a7b32a-8fe1-1c71-e886-7e0d9652f259@iuova.in>","messageIdHeader":"<53a7b32a-8fe1-1c71-e886-7e0d9652f259@iuova.in>"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/xdq-auvf-kmf', NULL, '<90561810-af69-19a7-9e71-5ea0597b6279@iuova.in>', '<53a7b32a-8fe1-1c71-e886-7e0d9652f259@iuova.in>', true, true, '2026-08-26 10:42:13.386+00', 'Plora Escape ', true, NULL, NULL)