	('7bf53ec6-5bdd-4d8b-a22f-b2dc5b0f5fab', 'Sagar massetty ', 'sagarmassetty@gmail.com', '3614296124', 'Twister', '….', 'We are trying to build a product which is like a twist cap water bottle ', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'I want to design a cap twist mechanism ', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '3 - 4 months', 'I need the design of the cap and also its mechanism which can be used for twisting ', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'NA', 4, 'Google', '2026-08-24', '03:00 PM', NULL, '2026-08-21 12:36:40.332+00', '[{"id":"reminder-1788866822223-qndw0n","to":"sagarmassetty@gmail.com","subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi Sagar massetty ,\n\n                                                    Greetings to you!\n\n                                                    Just checking in to see if you had a chance to review our Techno Commercial offer in detail.\n\n                                                    We can arrange a quick 15 minutes meeting to explain in detail if required.\n\n                                                    If you have any questions, please reply to this email. We are happy to help.\n\n                                                    Awaiting your positive response!\n\n                                                    Regards,\n                                                    Team Iuova.","sentAt":"2026-09-08T11:27:02.223Z","status":"sent","direction":"outbound","source":"rfq-reminder-manual","gmailMessageId":"<5bed9d30-ad5e-651c-d4c7-0f8aa98e26cc@iuova.in>","messageIdHeader":"<5bed9d30-ad5e-651c-d4c7-0f8aa98e26cc@iuova.in>"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/ebn-esqc-ffe', NULL, '<71f9bdbe-01e4-f4a7-c680-1392231d04a2@iuova.in>', '<5bed9d30-ad5e-651c-d4c7-0f8aa98e26cc@iuova.in>', true, true, '2026-08-26 10:34:06.239+00', 'Twist cap ', true, NULL, NULL),
	('da9de020-e090-45cc-946c-25f45c568f62', 'Nnayan Shah', '711perfume@gmail.com', '8657117119', '711 Perfume ', '711perfumes.in', '711 PERFUME is a new premium fragrance brand focused on creating modern, distinctive and high-quality fragrance products for Indian consumers.

We are currently developing our initial fragrance range and exploring innovative fragrance formats and accessories. As part of our product innovation, we are developing a wearable fragrance product called the 711 Scent Band.

The brand is currently at the early-stage product development and launch phase, and we are looking for professional product design, engineering and prototyping support.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are developing a premium wearable fragrance product under our brand, 711 PERFUME.

The concept is a luxury wrist band with a compact fragrance module integrated into the centre of the band. The module will contain a small replaceable fragrance cartridge and a controlled fragrance dispensing system.

We are currently at the concept and prototype stage. We want to explore a miniature button-operated micro-spray mechanism that can release a very small and controlled amount of fragrance through a fine nozzle.

The product should have a premium, minimal and jewellery-inspired appearance, with a black and gold design direction.

We require assistance with product engineering, mechanism development, CAD design and functional prototyping. The first objective is to develop 1–3 working prototypes and test the feasibility of the concept before moving towards commercial manufacturing.', '{"Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'The most important features are:

1. Compact and comfortable wrist-worn form factor.
2. Premium jewellery-inspired black and gold aesthetic.
3. Replaceable and sealed fragrance cartridge.
4. Miniature button-operated fragrance dispensing mechanism to be explored and engineered.
5. Controlled release of a very small amount of fragrance through a fine nozzle.
6. Leak-resistant design with no direct contact between fragrance liquid and the user''s skin.
7. Easy cartridge replacement.
8. Secure internal mechanism suitable for daily wrist movement, sweat and normal usage.
9. The mechanism should be compact enough to be integrated into the centre module without making the band bulky.
10. The design should be suitable for future manufacturing at commercial scale.', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Product Category: Personal care, beauty, and wellness
Organization Type: Startup or new brand

We would like your team to evaluate the technical feasibility of developing this product as a compact wearable fragrance dispenser.

The key challenge is integrating a small, safe and reliable fragrance dispensing mechanism within a premium wrist-worn form factor while maintaining comfort, aesthetics, leak resistance and ease of cartridge replacement.

We would like your engineering team to advise us on the most suitable dispensing mechanism, cartridge capacity, nozzle, internal components, materials and overall architecture.

At this stage, we are looking for a functional proof-of-concept and prototype rather than mass production. We would also like to understand the estimated development timeline, prototype cost, engineering scope, intellectual property ownership and the pathway towards scalable manufacturing if the prototype is successful.', 5, 'Google', '2026-09-28', '05:00 PM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1790328958115-0flij.jpg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1790328958116-o5vpml.jpg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1790328958116-42h6ge.jpg"]', '2026-09-25 09:35:59.721+00', '[{"id":"reply-reminder-1790566210530","to":"711perfume@gmail.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi Nnayan Shah,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Monday, September 28, 2026\nTime: 05:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/xdz-mudv-xcq\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-09-28T03:30:10.530Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<6a1a101a-a97d-0525-608f-cf45f89192ad@iuova.in>","references_id":"<19ab2074-a63b-7f7a-8946-549b506b3462@iuova.in> <ccf99788-dbd8-f4ad-ba66-d330d4eea792@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-reminder-1790479804749","to":"711perfume@gmail.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is tomorrow","body":"Hi Nnayan Shah,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is tomorrow.\n\nDate: Monday, September 28, 2026\nTime: 05:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/xdz-mudv-xcq\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-09-27T03:30:04.7