UV PROTECTIVE ACRYLIC/GLASS CYLINDER', false, true, '2 EACH', 'NOT ANY ', 5, 'Google', '2026-09-08', NULL, '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1788779694805-bwfjul.jpeg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1788779694806-yt3q6l.jpeg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1788779694806-hl2ix.pdf"]', '2026-09-07 11:14:56.221+00', '[{"id":"reply-1788860923946","to":"swanne@3stechs.in","cc":["info@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in, waseet@iuova.in, anirudha@iuova.in"],"subject":"Missed Meeting - Reschedule Request","body":"Dear SANDEEP D BAGUL,\n\nWe hope you''re doing well.\n\nIt seems we couldn''t connect for our scheduled online meeting today. We understand that unexpected commitments can arise.\n\nPlease let us know a convenient date and time for you, and we''ll be happy to reschedule the meeting. We look forward to connecting with you.\n\nBest regards,\nTeam IUOVA","sentAt":"2026-09-08T09:48:43.946Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-missed","messageIdHeader":"<d4a69dcb-3b55-56c1-c003-1033785eb129@iuova.in>","references":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<d4a69dcb-3b55-56c1-c003-1033785eb129@iuova.in>', false, false, NULL, 'flashing lantern and rotation beacon', false, '', ''),
	('be8be84f-7c5e-46a4-9e9e-19ed2682e87e', 'Kenneth Sterlin', 'official.kennethsterlin@gmail.com', '+919980857777', 'Pre-incorporation Startup', 'Pre-incorporation startup – website currently under development', 'Early-stage consumer product startup developing a proprietary modular food-container system. The product is currently at concept and initial physical prototype stage, with the core architecture established. I am now looking to take it through industrial design refinement, mechanical engineering, functional prototyping, DFM and manufacturing readiness, with production intended in China.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'A proprietary modular food-container system currently at concept and initial physical prototype stage. The fundamental product architecture has already been established, and I am looking for a design and engineering partner to develop it into a validated, manufacturing-ready product.
The scope would primarily include industrial design refinement, mechanical and structural engineering, material and manufacturing-process development, sealing and closure engineering, tolerance development, functional prototyping and testing, DFM, production-ready CAD and technical documentation.
The product combines stainless-steel, injection-moulded polymer and silicone components within a common modular platform. Manufacturing is currently intended to be undertaken in China, so I would also require the design to be developed with tooling and manufacturing feasibility in mind, followed by technical handover/support with the selected manufacturer.
Detailed architecture, CAD, prototype information and proprietary mechanisms can be shared following execution of an NDA.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '3 - 4 months', 'The product must operate as a genuinely modular system, with interchangeable food modules working reliably within a common platform. Key requirements include secure leak-resistant sealing, intuitive closure and release, reliable stacking and alignment, durability under repeated daily use, food-safe materials, ease of cleaning and a compact form suitable for everyday carrying.
The Premium version combines insulated stainless-steel food-contact components with injection-moulded polymer components and silicone seals, making cross-material tolerances, sealing performance and interface reliability particularly important.
The underlying architecture should also be scalable across additional sizes and future variants while retaining common interfaces and platform logic. Detailed proprietary architecture and mechanisms can be shared following execution of an NDA.', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Product Category: Consumer kitchenware / food-storage product — a proprietary modular food-container system.
Organization Type: Startup or new brand

I would like to understand IUOVA''s experience taking mechanically complex consumer products from an established concept through detailed engineering, functional validation and manufacturing handover.
In particular, I would like to discuss how you structure projects where industrial design, mechanical engineering, multiple manufacturing processes and tolerance development need to be considered as one integrated system.
I would also like to understand the proposed project stages, expected timeline, commercial structure, number of prototype iterations included, ownership of all project-specific IP and CAD/deliverables, and the level of technical support IUOVA can provide during DFM and handover to a manufacturer in China.
As the product contains proprietary architecture, I would prefer to execute a mutual NDA before sharing the detailed technical brief, CAD and prototype information.', 5, 'Google', '2026-09-28', '11:00 AM', NULL, '2026-09-26 08:01:21.858+00', '[{"id":"reply-reminder-1790566215885","to":"official.kennethsterlin@gmail.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi Kenneth Sterlin,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Monday, September 28, 2026\nTime: 11:00 AM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/xyq-tabt-guw\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-09-28T03:30:15.885Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<1a5f2bc6-da85-7bad-f157-cbe6724df03b@iuova.in>","references_id":"<1bb57915-45d0-bb55-1b8e-72ad92a218da@iuova.in> <3f761684-0f90-579f-fb65-3ba4944bfbef@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-reminder-1790479809350","to":"official.kennethsterlin@gmail.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is tomorrow","body":"Hi Kenneth Sterlin,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is tomorrow.\n\nDate: Monday, September 28, 2026\nTime: 11:00 AM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/xyq-tabt-guw\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-09-27T03:30:09.350Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-tomorrow","messageIdHeader":"<029a4d1a-1cee-c7e2-ebc4-f024b98afdd1@iuova.in>","references_id":"<1bb57915-45d0-bb55-1b8e-72ad92a218da@iuova.in> <3f761684-0f90-579f-fb65-3ba4944bfbef@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/xyq-tabt-guw', NULL, '<3f761684-0f90-579f-fb65-3ba4944bfbef@iuova.in>', '<1bb57915-45d0-bb55-1b8e-72ad92a218da@iuova.in>', false, false, NULL, 'Modular Food-Container System (Working Title: LAYR)', false, 'Consumer kitchenware / food-storage product — a proprietary modular food-container system.', 'Startup or new brand');


