	('108050c6-817a-4ad8-9f1a-498ed3132228', 'Alok Niranjan', 'alok@parkinnovations.in', '8828586370', 'Park Innovations', 'parkinnovations.in', 'We are Startup, Founded by 4 friends, having Engineering background from IIT. We are preparing ourself to enter in to Home Appliance smart solution segment. First, We have decided to enter in to Air Purifier market.', '0 -10 Crores INR', 'PARK Innovations seeks a qualified engineering design partner to develop the PAR-400, a residential air purifier targeting the Indian and outside market. The objective is to deliver 5 functional EVT (Engineering Verification Test) units suitable for investor demonstrations, regulatory pre-compliance testing, and field trials.
This is not a conceptual industrial design exercise. We require a manufacturing-ready engineering package that proves the product can be mass-produced within strict cost targets (BOM ₹5,500–7,500 at 5k volume) while meeting performance benchmarks (CADR 300 m³/h, Noise <51 dB(A)).
Your Scope: Complete mechanical, electrical, and firmware engineering; soft-tooling for representative parts; assembly of 2 working prototypes; validation testing documentation.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design), Product Engineering Services., Prototyping Services, Manufacturing Services"}', '10 -15 Lakhs INR (Upto 20000 USD)', '3 -4 months', 'Product Type : High-Efficiency Room Air Purifier
Features : Basic
