	('1e5f27c1-0528-4d18-8583-d577961ed4a7', 'Carlvince Tan', 'carlvince@lightrig.co', '+61 426 982 339', 'lightrig', 'lightrig.co', 'Lightrig is an early-stage consumer hardware company developing bespoke modular audio and entertainment systems, with a focus on premium user experience and scalable manufacturing.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'ech0 is a modular karaoke and wireless audio system comprising a compact receiver/control puck, compatible speaker module, and wireless microphones. We need industrial design and product engineering to turn the current concept and specification into a manufacturable product, including enclosure and internal layout, magnetic/electrical interfaces, CMF, DFM, component integration, functional prototypes, testing support, and production handoff.', '{"Prototyping Services","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Manufacturing Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '0 - 1 months', 'Modular stackable architecture; compact 78 × 78 mm rounded-square receiver; secure magnetic alignment with a three-contact electrical interface; microphones connected wirelessly to the receiver; receiver output to bundled or third-party speakers via Bluetooth or 3.5 mm AUX; built-in batteries; USB-C charging and optional reverse charging; BLE/app control; premium portable enclosure; reliable low-latency audio; and a manufacturable internal layout.', false, NULL, false, true, '1000', 'We already have an initial manufacturer specification and concept references. Please advise whether these are sufficient for a rough phased quotation, and outline the expected timeline and costs for industrial design, engineering, functional prototypes, testing/certification support, tooling, and a 1,000-unit pilot run. Please also clarify revision limits, ownership of CAD/IP, and whether any development or NRE fees can be credited against production.', 4, 'Reference via person', '2026-07-21', '10:00 AM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.