{"id":"reply-tc-followup-1781321408553","to":"info@admiresign.com","cc":["support@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in"],"subject":"Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"Hi Prakash Jhajharia,\n\nJust checking in to see if you had a chance to review our techno-commercial proposal.\n\nIf you have any questions, please reply to this email and we will be happy to help.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-06-13T03:30:08.553Z","status":"sent","templateId":"tc-client-followup-1","messageIdHeader":"<5748ad51-1104-4757-ee17-3ae5bfc8cb95@iuova.in>","references":"<602e8ebd-de17-d996-7f57-e48b5d56c68d@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<602e8ebd-de17-d996-7f57-e48b5d56c68d@iuova.in>', true, true, '2026-06-12 12:28:15.575+00', 'Positive locking mechanism designing for our advertising light boxes for Metro pillars', false, NULL, NULL),
	('4786b12b-fc89-4b61-b56d-f47e2889f9a8', 'Nitesh Kashyap', 'nitesh.kashyap@butterflyindia.com', '09899903375', 'Program Manager', 'www.butterflyindia.com', 'We are Butterfly Gandhi Mathi Appliance Limited, a Chennai-based kitchen appliance company and part of the Crompton group, with operations in Chennai and Mumbai.  We have an initial product concept and we are seeking an experienced partner to help develop it further—from fine tuning the ideation to proof of concept through detailed technical design to a scalable, manufacturable solution, including tool & Mold design, processes, and electronics (as applicable).', '1000 Crores INR and above', 'We have an initial product concept and we are seeking an experienced partner to help develop it further—from fine tuning the ideation to proof of concept through detailed technical design to a scalable, manufacturable solution, including tool & Mold design, processes, and electronics (as applicable).', '{"Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)"}', 'Will depend upon scope & work to be carried out', '2 - 3 months', 'Will be discussed once NDA is signed and we align on the scope of project.', false, NULL, true, false, NULL, 'Can you provide information about technical capability of the team? We have more movable components inside the product which will require considerable study & deep driving about engagement, interference, clearances etc. hence, need to deploy resource with considerable experience in the domain.', 5, 'ChatGPT', '2026-06-26', '10:00 AM', NULL, '2026-06-23 12:47:57.223+00', '[{"id":"reply-tc-gmail-19f03b283c914368","to":"nitesh.kashyap@butterflyindia.com","cc":[],"subject":"Re: Query]Possible collaboration to connect on new product ideation, Technical design and scalable manufacturing solution","body":"Dear Niteshji,\r\n\r\nThank you for sharing the NDA.\r\n\r\nPlease find our redline attached, with changes marked in track changes for\r\nyour review, along with a clean copy for reference.\r\n\r\nMost of the agreement is fine as-is. The one point we''d really like your\r\nteam to look at closely is Clause 3 (the \"design around\" restriction). As\r\nworded, it could prevent us from working in the BLDC motor/kitchen\r\nappliance space for any other client going forward, which goes beyond\r\nprotecting your confidential information. We''ve proposed a narrower version\r\nthat still fully protects your IP.\r\n\r\nThe rest of our changes (indemnity cap, mutual confidentiality, dispute\r\nresolution, a few formatting fixes) are fairly standard and shouldn''t need\r\nmuch discussion.\r\n\r\nHappy to jump on a quick call if useful; otherwise, let us know your\r\nthoughts whenever convenient.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nTeam IUOVA\r\n\r\nOn Tue, 23 Jun 2026 at 18:29, Nitesh Kashyap <\r\nnitesh.kashyap@butterflyindia.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi All,\r\n>\r\n>    I have filled up Product RFQ form as per below mail. Kindly send invite\r\n> on Teams for further discussion on the subject.\r\n>\r\n> I am also sending draft NDA agreement for your review & feedback (if any).\r\n> This is a mandatory requirement to proceed\r\n>\r\n> further on discussion.\r\n>\r\n> Also, request to pls provide filled up vendor registration form and share\r\n> along with GST certificate, Bank details etc.\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Feel free to connect for any further query.\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Regards\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Public\r\n>\r\n> *From:* support@iuova.in <support@iuova.in>\r\n> *Sent:* 23 June 2026 15:30\r\n> *To:* Nitesh Kashyap <nitesh.kashyap@butterflyindia.com>\r\n> *Cc:* crm@iuova.in; info@iuova.in\r\n> *Subject:* Re: Query]Possible collaboration to connect on new product\r\n> ideation, Technical design and scalable manufacturing solution\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *CAUTION*: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not\r\n> click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know\r\n> the content is safe.\r\n>\r\n> Hi,\r\n>