	('71dfd4a4-3e07-4386-a982-fa0302006f6a', 'Pradeep Panda ', 'pradeeppanda@kent.co.in', '9821731807', 'Kent kitchen appliances', 'https://www.kent.co.in/kitchen-appliances', 'KENT is a trusted name in water purification and healthcare solutions. Since 1999, it has pioneered advanced technologies to provide safe, healthy, and great-tasting water. With a focus on innovation and quality, KENT offers a variety of water purifiers, air purifiers, and health-focused home solutions, making it a preferred choice for millions of families worldwide.', '1000 Crores INR and above', 'The project requires a new design, as the existing concepts do not fully meet Kent''s vision.

