	('90dcdc7f-15af-4cc1-b914-9c62e2f9246f', 'Aman Mishra', 'aman.m@aivot.ai', '7869403405', 'AIVOT AI', 'www.aivot.ai', 'Aivot AI is a startup that develops artificial-intelligence solutions and products to help businesses automate tasks, analyze data, and build smarter digital systems. The company works with technologies like machine learning, natural language processing, computer vision, and IoT to create applications for areas such as healthcare monitoring, body measurement and dermatology analysis, predictive analytics, and workflow automation. In addition to building its own AI products, Aivot AI also offers consulting and implementation services to help organizations integrate AI into their existing systems.', '0 -10 Crores INR', 'Greetings from AIVOT AI.
My name is Aman Mishra, and I am reaching out regarding a potential collaboration for the industrial design and enclosure development of our device.
We have recently developed a working prototype of our device with the following specifications:
Dimensions: 140 mm × 80 mm × 17 mm (L × B × H)
Top Surface: Two metallic plates and three functional buttons
Side Panel: One power button
Internal Components: PCB, battery, and sensor module
Additional Feature: One AUX jack
At present, the device is available in a prototype form, and we are now looking to convert it into a properly finished commercial product. Our requirement is to design a premium-looking outer body with refined aesthetics, similar in finish and feel to modern smartphones (for example, the exterior build quality seen in iPhone devices), since the device dimensions are comparable.
We are specifically looking for assistance with:
Industrial design of the enclosure
High-quality aesthetic finishing
Ergonomic and premium product appearance
Manufacturable enclosure design for production
', '{"Manufacturing Services"}', '5- 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '0 - 1 months', 'At present, the device is available in a prototype form, and we are now looking to convert it into a properly finished commercial product. Our requirement is to design a premium-looking outer body with refined aesthetics, similar in finish and feel to modern smartphones (for example, the exterior build quality seen in iPhone devices), since the device dimensions are comparable.
We are specifically looking for assistance with:
