	('c17bf9ef-4815-4862-9574-bc02df8b35f3', 'Ajay Shinde', 'biobloomboutique@gmail.com', '9637115758', 'BioBloomBoutique', 'www.biobloomboutique.com ', 'BioBloomBoutique Private Limited (BBB) is developing India''s first dedicated Diabetes Automated Dispensing Machine -- the BBB ADM Gen-1. The machine operates autonomously: a patient authenticates using their digital health identity (ABHA), the machine retrieves the prescribed medication, and the patient collects it at the dispensing window -- without pharmacist involvement in the normal dispensing transaction.
This document is an engineering requirements brief issued to OEM partners for prototype quotation and feasibility review. A full Prototype Hardware Product Requirements Specification (PHPRS, 80+ pages) is available on NDA execution.
This engagement covers a single Proof of Concept (PoC) prototype unit. The prototype objective is to demonstrate engineering feasibility to government evaluators, grant authorities, and institutional partners. It is not a commercial deployment unit.
', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'BioBloomBoutique Private Limited is developing a functional Proof-of-Concept (PoC) prototype of an Autonomous Diabetes Automated Dispensing Machine (ADM Gen-1) for demonstration to government authorities and institutional healthcare partners. The prototype is intended to validate the engineering feasibility of a fully autonomous medicine dispensing system for diabetes care.

The machine will authenticate patients using ABHA QR and biometric fingerprint, retrieve prescription data from the cloud, automatically dispense prescribed diabetes medicines and consumables from multiple dispensing zones, maintain refrigerated insulin storage (2–8°C), and update inventory records without pharmacist intervention during normal dispensing.

We require an OEM partner to undertake complete industrial design, mechanical design, electronics integration, dispensing mechanisms, refrigeration system, embedded hardware integration, sheet metal fabrication, prototype assembly, testing, documentation, and delivery of one fully functional prototype. The prototype should have a premium commercial appearance while using cost-effective engineering solutions suitable for a Proof-of-Concept. Detailed engineering specifications will be shared after NDA execution.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Manufacturing Services","Product Analysis Services"}', '50,000 - 1,00,000', '0 - 1 months', 'The prototype must demonstrate a fully autonomous patient medicine dispensing workflow with zero pharmacist intervention during normal dispensing. The machine shall authenticate patients using ABHA QR and biometric fingerprint, retrieve prescription data from the cloud, validate the prescription, and automatically dispense prescribed diabetes medicines and consumables.

Key mandatory features:

* Premium floor-standing industrial cabinet suitable for government demonstrations.
* Seven-zone modular architecture (Oral Medicines, Refrigerated Insulin, Diabetes Consumables, Monitoring Devices, Secure Device Locker, Patient Authentication & Collection, Future Expansion).
* Autonomous dispensing with accurate item retrieval.
* Refrigerated insulin storage maintaining 2–8°C.
* 27-inch patient touchscreen and pharmacist HMI.
* QR scanner, fingerprint reader, barcode verification, and label printer integration.
* Embedded controller with Ethernet, Wi-Fi, 4G connectivity, and UPS backup.
* Real-time inventory tracking and cloud-ready hardware architecture.
* Modular, serviceable design using commercially available components where practical.
* Prototype should have a finished commercial appearance externally while remaining optimized for Proof-of-Concept engineering internally.
* Complete mechanical, electrical, embedded integration, fabrication, assembly, testing, documentation, and one fully functional prototype ready for Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT).', false, NULL, false, true, '1 Prototype Unit ( 1 Functional Proof-Of-Concept (PoC). Commercial prototype quantities to be discussed after successful prototype validation)', 'We have Patented whole thing but now moving to take a grant on our Prototype and which we will do in August 2026, So we are a MedTech Startup moving towards government official permission for pilot setup ', 4, 'Google', '2026-07-06', '01:00 PM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1783064142640-3yfx1r.pdf","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1783064142640-figvtq.jpeg"]', '2026-07-03 07:35:44.66+00', '[{"id":"reply-reminder-1783308604443","to":"biobloomboutique@gmail.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi Ajay Shinde,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Monday, July 6, 2026\nTime: 01:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/ngz-vawm-oma\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-07-06T03:30:04.443Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<dbc554c0-05c3-5026-5094-6b5acbf68e92@iuova.in>","references_id":"<289f0acc-923c-e7a4-a0f4-4ce7df57672f@iuova.in> <db28b9a6-ef9f-7162-192b-340ec99f2848@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-reminder-1783222204684","to":"biobloomboutique@gmail.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is tomorrow","body":"Hi Ajay Shinde,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is tomorrow.\n\nDate: Monday, July 6, 2026\nTime: 01:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.