	('c2be5da7-20bd-4365-9e57-350143582647', 'Jai Mehta', 'jai.mehta@pittiegroup.com', '8882280994', 'Pittie Global Pvt Ltd', 'pittieglobal.com', 'We are an organisation building a product in astro-tech we want to launch a wearable device which can track health metrics of our potential user and then we can generate a report for that.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are building a next-generation wearable health device that tracks key health and fitness metrics similar to Apple HealthKit and Google Health Connect–enabled ecosystems. The product will monitor vital parameters such as heart rate, sleep, activity, SpO₂, calories, stress, and other wellness indicators, while delivering actionable insights through AI-powered analytics. We are looking for a design partner to help us create an intuitive hardware experience along with a seamless companion mobile application and user interface.', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report)","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Prototyping Services","Manufacturing Services","Product Analysis Services","Product Engineering Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'We are looking to design a next-generation wearable ecosystem consisting of a smart wearable device and a companion mobile application. The product should be capable of tracking health and wellness metrics similar to Apple Health and Google Health Connect ecosystems.

Key features required:

Real-time health monitoring (Heart Rate, SpO₂, Body Temperature, Blood Pressure, HRV)
Sleep tracking with sleep stages and quality analysis
Activity tracking (Steps, Distance, Calories, Workouts)
Stress, Mood, and Wellness monitoring
AI-powered personalized health insights and recommendations
Daily, Weekly, and Monthly health reports with trends
Goal setting, achievements, and reminders
Emergency SOS and health alerts
Bluetooth syncing between the wearable and mobile application
Integration with Apple HealthKit and Google Health Connect for data synchronization
Secure cloud backup and user profile management
Premium, modern UI/UX for both the wearable interface and companion mobile application (iOS & Android)
Scalable architecture to support future AI-driven predictive health features and third-party integrations', false, NULL, false, true, 'Can be figured out in the later stage', 'NA', 5, 'Linked In', '2026-07-22', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-21 11:52:13.191+00', '[{"id":"reply-1784704418586","to":"jai.mehta@pittiegroup.com","cc":["info@iuova.in","crm@iuova.in, waseet@iuova.in, anirudha@iuova.in"],"subject":"Missed Meeting - Reschedule Request","body":"Dear Jai Mehta,\n\nWe hope you''re doing well.\n\nIt seems we couldn''t connect for our scheduled online meeting today. We understand that unexpected commitments can arise.\n\nPlease let us know a convenient date and time for you, and we''ll be happy to reschedule the meeting. We look forward to connecting with you.\n\nBest regards,\nTeam IUOVA","sentAt":"2026-07-22T07:13:38.586Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-missed","messageIdHeader":"<229fc8ca-c920-3fe3-56c8-2003d30e5e0f@iuova.in>","references":"<8d9ea666-253e-38c1-1cde-6254ffacd00c@iuova.in>","direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"},{"id":"reply-reminder-1784691005014","to":"jai.mehta@pittiegroup.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi Jai Mehta,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Wednesday, July 22, 2026\nTime: 12:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/smq-wapy-xjg\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-07-22T03:30:05.014Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<8d9ea666-253e-38c1-1cde-6254ffacd00c@iuova.in>","references_id":"<940dac5c-70b5-a0c9-5f9c-f1a6f1913536@iuova.in> <e881a728-8090-09f6-61c4-acfdcb025419@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', NULL, NULL, '<e881a728-8090-09f6-61c4-acfdcb025419@iuova.in>', '<940dac5c-70b5-a0c9-5f9c-f1a6f1913536@iuova.in>', false, false, NULL, 'Shubhwatch', false, NULL, NULL),
