	('ce5f34ff-ce8a-4bac-87c1-e21c7323ceb7', 'Midhun Ram Saikishore', 'midhun.ram.saikishore@hitachigymnasiet.se', '+91 8555 819690', 'Nothing as of right now - Startup', 'No company website!', 'A medtech startup building life-saving resuscitation equipment. Our core product is a CPR assist device that helps rescuers deliver chest compressions at the correct depth - a critical factor in survival during cardiac arrest. We''ve already developed and tested a mechanical version, and are now moving to a motor-assisted, automated version based on interest from a hospital in Sweden and a national medical equipment specialist. Our long-term goal is for the device to be as widely available as AEDs - in hospitals, public spaces, and corporate environments alike."', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'Product Description:
Our product is a CPR assist device that helps rescuers deliver chest compressions at the correct depth and rate, combining motor-driven assistance with body-weight application. We''ve already built and tested a fully mechanical version. We now need a working, automated (motor-assisted) prototype to showcase the concept to investors.
Scope of Work:

Mechanical engineering: Custom housing/frame, motor-driven compression mechanism, CAD design
Electronics: Custom PCB for motor control and power management
Motor/actuator: Selection and integration to demonstrate consistent, convincing compression action
Firmware: Control logic to operate the motor for a live demonstration
Build: One fully functional prototype that looks and performs like the intended final product, suitable for an in-person investor demo

Deliverables: One working prototype unit, plus basic CAD/design files.', '{"Prototyping Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'motor aided, should be done mechanically as well, small form factor, run time of 30min, should physically stop. Should operate in 120bpm.', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'nothing you need right now, can share when budget works out!', 4, 'Google', '2026-07-07', '12:00 PM', NULL, '2026-07-06 08:54:56.887+00', '[{"id":"reply-reminder-1783395005669","to":"midhun.ram.saikishore@hitachigymnasiet.se","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi Midhun Ram Saikishore,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Tuesday, July 7, 2026\nTime: 12:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/oax-pkri-cef\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-07-07T03:30:05.669Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<f27add05-a9eb-531c-3b9f-1901a0fe244d@iuova.in>","references_id":"<4e9b3785-4642-3062-7814-291ae93cb04d@iuova.in> <2f1589c7-dd55-70c5-418d-199f95dbbc19@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/oax-pkri-cef', NULL, '<2f1589c7-dd55-70c5-418d-199f95dbbc19@iuova.in>', '<4e9b3785-4642-3062-7814-291ae93cb04d@iuova.in>', false, false, NULL, 'NOVA', false, NULL, NULL),
	('cfeae9df-d6bc-43d9-bf35-c5ee147c2b07', 'Siddharaj Nayak', 'siddharaj.nayak@gmail.com', '9011277326', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA / Solo founder developing a hardware - focus & wellness timer. Early product validation and prototype design underway.', '0 -10 Crores INR', 'A minimal physical focus timer designed to improve productivity and well-being through multiple modes including Pomodoro (25/5), eye care (20-20-20), breathing guidance, and a custom timer. The device will feature intuitive physical controls (mode dial + time dial), a central static disc with mode indication, and a single soft breathing LED that changes color based on mode. Current scope includes electronics prototype, basic enclosure design, interaction mapping, and phased design for manufacturability.', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report), Product Design Services (Industrial Design), Product Engineering Services., Prototyping Services, Product Analysis Services"}', '10 -15 Lakhs INR (Upto 20000 USD)', '2- 3 months', 'Support for Pomodoro (25/5) and Eye Care (20-20-20) modes, a calm LED breathing indicator, dual physical dials (mode + time), revolving disc with mode indication, and a premium visual/physical interaction model. Functional electronics prototype + basic enclosure design are needed first.', false, 'NA', false, true, 'NA for prototype stage', 'Looking for phased development: start with Phase-1 functional electronics prototype with core modes, then iterative refinement toward production-ready design.', 4, 'Google', '2025-12-15', '23:16:01', 'NA', '2026-07-22 10:16:17.456741+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'NA', false, NULL, NULL),
