	('eb39d91d-724b-4073-aa6f-4727dc74c290', 'Tanupriya Patel', 'tanupriya@mushroomworldgroup.com', '6265334603', 'Mushroom world umbrella ltd', 'http://www.mushroomworldgroup.com', 'mushroom world group is a conglomerate of 8+ thriving companies we have a venture capital mushroom world umbrella ltd ,a  BIO CNG plant , health & wellness, fitness & nutrition, films & entertainment, winery & vineyard, information technology', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'the product is a carbon capture device which uses living organism to capture co2 from the ambient atmosphere  and this product is basically a self sustainable and  independent unit and the vission behind developing this device is the increasing global warming and the adverse effect on the globe and due to rapid urbanization and  development the there is limiled soil areas to plant the trees and the living organism captures co2  more efficiently and this is the vission behind the development of this product which can be installed anywhere like soiless and  concrete areas  for eg. parks , commercial complexes, road medians , highways and many more.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'It should look very beautiful and have a well-finished, polished appearance.', false, 'internal components', false, true, 'NA', 'NA', 4, 'Google', '2026-06-19', '10:00 AM', NULL, '2026-06-22 08:19:56.061+00', '[{"id":"reply-tc-positive-ack-1782444618286","to":"tanupriya@mushroomworldgroup.com","cc":[],"subject":"Thank you for the Project Order Confirmation! Please look at next steps to start the Project.","body":"Dear Concerned Person,\n\nGreetings to you!\n\nThank you for the Project order confirmation.\n\nWe are extremely excited to work with you!\n\nOur team will review it and send the Project MOU with the Full Kitting form, then we will officially kick off the project meeting.\n\nMeanwhile, please send us the few details so