	('f0333a5c-2aa3-402b-917d-6f0e03d57931', 'Chetan Jain', 'innovation@litaski.com', '+91 98400 92595', 'Kumbhat Group', 'www.kumbhat.com / www.litaski.com', 'In business for over 50 years - Electrical distribution of multiple brands including our own brands, large supply chain, manufacturing of switches, manufacturing of lights.', '10 - 50 Crores INR', 'It is related to our existing product line. We will provide more details if a meeting is scheduled', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report), Product Design Services (Industrial Design), Product Engineering Services., Prototyping Services, Manufacturing Services, would like to understand what you mean by product analysis services?"}', '20 Lakhs and Above (Above 25000 USD)', '1- 2 months', 'Form factor, user experience', true, 'Back boxes and some electronic components if it is not decided to be in your scope of work', true, true, 'It is not possible to mention the moq as of now. Our guess is, it needs to be decided after we understand what kind of manufacturing we will need from you and what can be done at our end.', 'We feel that an initial meeting is required to understand how you work and how your services can be helpful to us. In particular we would like to understand what kind of brief you are expecting from us. In our previous discussions with design houses we have not filled a form like this and we think, giving lots of details at this juncture can jeopardize the design process. So we strongly feel that we need to first understand your methodologies and services, and answer any questions you might have once you understand what we are looking at.', 3, 'Google', '2024-12-29', '11:49:12', 'NA', '2026-07-22 10:16:17.456741+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'NA', false, NULL, NULL),
