Please let me know if your team is able to take on such a project. If yes, I would appreciate it if you could share your quotation process, expected timelines, and any technical documents you would like me to provide.', '{"Prototyping Services","Product Engineering Services","Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report)","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)"}', '10 - 15 Lakhs INR (Upto 20000 USD)', '3 - 4 months', 'type c cable smart module', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'need manufacturing ready product', 3, 'Google', '2026-07-10', '03:00 PM', NULL, '2026-07-09 12:22:44.24+00', '[{"id":"reply-reminder-1783654206561","to":"sag9029@gmail.com","cc":["crm@iuova.in","info@iuova.in","support@iuova.in"],"subject":"Reminder: Your IUOVA meeting is today","body":"Hi SAGAR,\n\nThis is a reminder that your meeting is today.\n\nDate: Friday, July 10, 2026\nTime: 03:00 PM (Asia/Kolkata)\nMeeting link: https://meet.google.com/ztg-jwux-chy\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email.\n\nRegards,\nIUOVA Team","sentAt":"2026-07-10T03:30:06.561Z","status":"sent","templateId":"meeting-reminder-today","messageIdHeader":"<b0268507-3dfd-1d6e-f984-70aab78cc26c@iuova.in>","references_id":"<f04ea8ae-e590-4769-732b-61d52c239da9@iuova.in> <994fde7c-70a2-f867-3bbe-0bc1984f563f@iuova.in>","gmailThreadId":null,"direction":"outbound","source":"smtp"}]', 'https://meet.google.com/ztg-jwux-chy', NULL, '<994fde7c-70a2-f867-3bbe-0bc1984f563f@iuova.in>', '<f04ea8ae-e590-4769-732b-61d52c239da9@iuova.in>', false, false, NULL, 'smart type c module', false, NULL, NULL),
	('f683d6e6-ae7c-4594-94f8-8645814f9260', 'Anupam Biswas', 'anupam@innoii.com', '7596806052', 'innoii Technology , Aero Knowledge Solutions Pvt Ltd', 'NA', 'Ill develop the product first, then company.', 'NA', 'Wall Messenger', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design), Manufacturing Services"}', '3 - 5 lakhs INR (Up to 5000 USD)', 'As soon as possible', 'Special Voice Recorder', false, 'NA', false, true, '100-500 first', 'NA', 4, 'NA', '2025-05-05', '20:47:10', 'https://drive.google.com/open?id=1HqWmbqtMnhjEeELtenlWXGJrYs-Miz-9', '2026-07-22 10:16:17.456741+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'NA', false, NULL, NULL),
	('f802a3b5-2829-41fc-b812-f8082404aba3', 'Vikram', 'vikram.apte@plastocrafts.com', '9920525637', 'scientiquipp pvt.ltd', 'www.scientiquipp.com', 'We manufacture Laboratory centrifuges', '0 -10 Crores INR', 'This involves Designing the Rotor Locking Mechanism with an Interlock and inclusive of the Tool-less design.', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report), Product Design Services (Industrial Design), Product Engineering Services."}', '5- 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '6 months-9 months', 'Fool Proof Rotor and Lid Interlock with Tool Less Design', false, 'NA', true, false, '100-120 units per annum', 'NA', 5, 'Google', '2025-08-02', '08:28:44', 'NA', '2026-07-22 10:16:17.456741+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'NA', false, NULL, NULL),
	('fb7bca2f-4b86-4248-b549-3e3452d36acd', 'Nikhil', 'n.sankpal@zitrushealthcare.com', '9768627499', 'Zitrus Healthcare (OPC) Pvt. Ltd.', 'Na', 'Zitrus Healthcare is a manufacturer of medical sterilizers based out of Navi Mumbai.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'Product Description

The project involves the development of a 46-Liter Class B Steam Sterilizer (EN 13060 compliant design philosophy) intended for sterilization of wrapped, unwrapped, porous, hollow, and solid medical instruments. The proposed model will be an upscaled version of our existing 23-Liter Class B Steam Sterilizer platform, while maintaining equivalent sterilization performance, safety standards, reliability, and cycle efficiency.

The sterilizer shall operate with pre-vacuum and post-vacuum cycles, saturated steam sterilization at standard temperatures (121°C and 134°C), and shall be designed for healthcare, dental, laboratory, and clinical applications. The objective is to optimize chamber capacity while maintaining acceptable cycle times, energy efficiency, vacuum performance, steam quality, and overall system reliability.
Scope of Work for Design & Technical Support

The design vendor shall provide engineering consultation, calculations, recommendations, and technical documentation for the development of the 46L Class B Steam Sterilizer.

1. System Design Review
Review existing 23L sterilizer architecture.
Identify scaling factors and design modifications required for the 46L model.
Recommend improvements to enhance performance, reliability, and manufacturability.
2. Pressure Vessel / Chamber Engineering
Chamber volume optimization and sizing.
Pressure vessel calculations.
Material selection recommendations.
Structural analysis for operating and test pressures.
Recommendations for chamber geometry and wall thickness.
3. Vacuum System Design
Vacuum pump sizing calculations.
Selection criteria for suitable vacuum technology (rotary vane, dry pump, piston pump, etc.).
Vacuum evacuation time calculations.
Steam-air removal efficiency assessment.
Vacuum pipeline sizing and optimization.
4. Steam Generation System
Steam generator sizing.
Heater power calculations.
Steam generation rate requirements.
Water consumption calculations.
Steam quality considerations.
5. Condenser / Radiator Design
Condenser sizing calculations.
Heat rejection requirements.
Cooling water requirements (if applicable).
Optimization of drying cycle performance.
6. Heating System
Chamber heating requirements.
Steam generator heater selection.
Power consumption estimation.
Warm-up time optimization.
7. Door & Locking Mechanism
Mechanical locking force calculations.
Safety factor evaluation.
Door seal requirements.
Recommendations for locking mechanism architecture.
8. Sensor & Instrumentation Selection

Technical recommendations and specifications for:

RTD temperature sensors.
Chamber temperature sensors.
Steam generator temperature sensors.
Pressure transmitters.
Vacuum sensors.
Thermostats.
Water level sensors.
Safety switches and interlocks.
9. Process Performance Optimization
Sterilization cycle optimization.
Heating phase optimization.
Vacuum phase optimization.
Drying cycle optimization.
Energy efficiency improvements.
Water consumption reduction opportunities.
10. Control System Inputs

Provide technical inputs for:

Sensor placement.
Control logic requirements.
Alarm conditions.
Safety interlocks.
Performance monitoring requirements.
11. Deliverables

The vendor shall provide:

Engineering design calculations.
Component sizing calculations.
Technical recommendations report.
Bill of Materials recommendations.
Performance estimation report.
Risk and design review observations.
Design validation recommendations.
Technical consultation during prototype development and testing.
Exclusions (Unless Specifically Agreed)
Detailed CAD modeling.
Manufacturing drawings.
PLC/HMI programming.
Regulatory certification activities.
Prototype manufacturing.
Installation and commissioning.
Expected Outcome

A technically validated design package enabling successful development of a 46L Class B Steam Sterilizer with optimized performance, reduced development risk, and clear engineering justification for major component selections and system architecture decisions.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Product Analysis Services","Manufacturing Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '3 - 4 months', 'Display- 5" capacitive touch screen color display HMI for user navigation. 
Electro mechanical fully automatic door locking mechanism.
EN 13060 compliant design.
IOT enabled.
External printer easy integration.
', true, 'Gearbox for door opening mechanism.
Stepper Motor for door mechanism.
', true, false, NULL, 'Na', 5, 'Reference via person', '2026-06-03', '11:00 AM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1780306494713-twxrtr.pdf","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1780306494717-xql6bl.pdf","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1780306494718-v4br8b.pdf"]', '2026-06-01 09:35:10.942+00', '[{"id":"reply-tc-client-19ea6e691424f186","to":"support@iuova.in","cc":[],"subject":"Re: Techno - Commercial offer update follow up","body":"<html><body><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Hey team,</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">I have shared the available drawings I had with me on your support@iuova.in id. Please check, you must have received a Google drive folder link from zitrushealthcare@gmail.com.</div><div style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\" dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div id=\"ms-outlook-mobile-body-separator-line\" data-applydefaultfontstyles=\"true\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\" dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></div></div><div style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\" id=\"ms-outlook-mobile-signature\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12