	('1c57cf8c-6c10-4c2f-9cfa-5668a4dd8d4a', 'RITURAJ SINGH', 'binnu@msigroups.com', '8171348777', 'MAA SHARDA INDUSTRIES', 'WWW.ORWOFLAME.COM', '**Maa Sharda Industries** is engaged in the manufacturing and supply of Home appliances products. The company is committed to delivering quality products, reliable service, and customer-focused solutions while maintaining high standards of workmanship and timely delivery.
