', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report)","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Prototyping Services","Product Engineering Services","Product Analysis Services","Manufacturing Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'Powerful Suction (1400–1800 m³/hr), Low Noise Level.', true, 'CHIMENY MOTOR AND PCB SETS ETC ', true, false, NULL, 'Do you have experience designing premium kitchen chimneys? Can you share your portfolio?
