gst no 27DJZPS1187K1Z3', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'we need your services, to redesign AND MAKE COMPACT OUR PRODUCTS with THE HELP OF  cad drawings /3d designs. aLSO A PROTOTYPE OF THE PRODUCT IS REQUIRED AND ONCE THE PROTOTYPE IS APPROVED AND OK FROM BOTH SIDES WE MOVE TO PRODUCTION.', '{"Prototyping Services","Manufacturing Services","Product Engineering Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '2 - 3 months', 'UV PROTECTED GLASS/ACRYLIC OUTER HOUSING. SHOULD BE MARINE GRADE TO WITHSTAND MARINE WEATHER BY USING MARINE GRADE ALLUMINIUM.', true, '3WATTS/ 18WATTS SMD AND COB LEDS
