	('83d8e8c9-8df6-481e-8063-e26e1d32185f', 'vatsal gudhka', 'vatsalgudhka@gmail.com', '08369083208', 'IUOVA', 'www.kaspell.com', 'Abcd', '10 - 50 Crores INR', 'Qwert', '{"Product Research and development (On field Research and Study Report)","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'Abcd', false, NULL, false, true, '1000', 'Na', 5, 'Google', '2026-09-14', '11:00 AM', NULL, '2026-09-13 05:59:04.621+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Kaspell', false, 'D2c', 'Manufacturer'),
	('c6e21432-ec81-4b22-b756-683809429768', 'Mohnish Sugand', 'mohnish_sugand@hotmail.com', '9920690195', 'Beauty Touch', 'NA', 'I am developing VYUN, a premium reusable scent/incense consumer object designed for modern homes and hospitality spaces.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'I''m looking for a product-development partner to take the concept through engineering, CAD, functional prototyping, DFM, and a production-ready design.

The product is a vertical architectural object with a thermally isolated incense combustion system, visible burn progression and a removable ash system. It also includes a passive Smoke Sculptor: an interchangeable top element designed to influence the smoke plume into distinctive natural forms such as a spiral, twin plume or halo
Our current retail pricing hypothesis is approximately ₹999–₹1,499, so the design needs to be commercially disciplined and aesthetically strong.

We are therefore particularly interested in:
low part count and efficient assembly
Prototyping with different materials
practical manufacturing processes
scalable architecture
transparent BOM/cost thinking
a clear path from prototype to approximately 1,000–10,000 units
avoiding unnecessary tooling or complexity at this stage', '{"Prototyping Services","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'Create an object that reads as a piece of contemporary interior design rather than conventional incense 
packaging 
 Keep the central incense axis, large top opening, visible burn state and ash containment legible without 
exposing a cluttered mechanism 
 Use a restrained material palette: powder-coated aluminium, SS304, borosilicate glass, alumina ceramic 
and limited brass accents. (Provisional hypothesis and can be changed) 
 Preserve the ability to refill and service the product rather than treating it as disposable packaging. 
 Design the architecture for eventual hospitality use: stable, cleanable, repeatable, easy to inspect and 
suitable for small production batches', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Further, detailed technical information can be shared under an NDA.
Please let me know a suitable time for an introductory call.', 4, 'AI model', '2026-09-21', '03:00 PM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1789655054866-577pz8.png","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1789655054867-lnjuaf.png","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1789655054867-bmglqc.pdf"]', '2026-09-17 14:24:17.111+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'VYUN -  Indian-origin, reusable incense/scent consumer product brand for India', false, 'Packaging and FMCG products', 'Startup or new brand'),
	('93008501-2f59-40dd-bdb6-c5c9f9248929', 'Priyanka Agarwal', 'priyanka.nivara@gmail.com', '07665918025', 'Nivara Life Pvt. Ltd.', 'no website ', 'Nivara Life is not incorporated yet but it aims to be a consumer appliance company meant for modern, accessible and low-water/energy usage portable needs of new modern and minimalistic living ', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'A compact countertop dishwasher, sized for 2 people or a small household’s dishes, that needs no plumbing connection and no mains electrical wiring. It runs on 12V DC, delivered through a standard USB-C Power Delivery charger or a solar power bank. It has no heating element — the user pours in already-hot water. The machine runs a full automatic wash-and-rinse cycle from a single pour of water, using a passive mechanical mechanism to split that one pour into a wash volume and a separate, clean rinse volume, with no second fill, no second pump, and no electronically controlled valve sequencing to achieve the split.', '{"Prototyping Services","Product Analysis Services","Manufacturing Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'I can share all details post NDA signing and discussion', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'I would like to sign an NDA before revealing more details and exact engineering drawings/features. Provisional patent filing is pending ', 4, 'Google', '2026-09-26', '12:00 PM', NULL, '2026-09-21 10:35:41.011+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Nivara BD-1', false, 'Home appliances', 'Individual entrepreneur or inventor'),
	('da9de020-e090-45cc-946c-25f45c568f62', 'Nnayan Shah', '711perfume@gmail.com', '8657117119', '711 Perfume ', '711perfumes.in', '711 PERFUME is a new premium fragrance brand focused on creating modern, distinctive and high-quality fragrance products for Indian consumers.

We are currently developing our initial fragrance range and exploring innovative fragrance formats and accessories. As part of our product innovation, we are developing a wearable fragrance product called the 711 Scent Band.

The brand is currently at the early-stage product development and launch phase, and we are looking for professional product design, engineering and prototyping support.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'We are developing a premium wearable fragrance product under our brand, 711 PERFUME.

The concept is a luxury wrist band with a compact fragrance module integrated into the centre of the band. The module will contain a small replaceable fragrance cartridge and a controlled fragrance dispensing system.

We are currently at the concept and prototype stage. We want to explore a miniature button-operated micro-spray mechanism that can release a very small and controlled amount of fragrance through a fine nozzle.

The product should have a premium, minimal and jewellery-inspired appearance, with a black and gold design direction.

We require assistance with product engineering, mechanism development, CAD design and functional prototyping. The first objective is to develop 1–3 working prototypes and test the feasibility of the concept before moving towards commercial manufacturing.', '{"Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services","Product Design Services (Industrial Design)"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '1 - 2 months', 'The most important features are:

1. Compact and comfortable wrist-worn form factor.
2. Premium jewellery-inspired black and gold aesthetic.
3. Replaceable and sealed fragrance cartridge.
4. Miniature button-operated fragrance dispensing mechanism to be explored and engineered.
5. Controlled release of a very small amount of fragrance through a fine nozzle.
6. Leak-resistant design with no direct contact between fragrance liquid and the user''s skin.
7. Easy cartridge replacement.
8. Secure internal mechanism suitable for daily wrist movement, sweat and normal usage.
9. The mechanism should be compact enough to be integrated into the centre module without making the band bulky.
10. The design should be suitable for future manufacturing at commercial scale.', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'We would like your team to evaluate the technical feasibility of developing this product as a compact wearable fragrance dispenser.

The key challenge is integrating a small, safe and reliable fragrance dispensing mechanism within a premium wrist-worn form factor while maintaining comfort, aesthetics, leak resistance and ease of cartridge replacement.

We would like your engineering team to advise us on the most suitable dispensing mechanism, cartridge capacity, nozzle, internal components, materials and overall architecture.

At this stage, we are looking for a functional proof-of-concept and prototype rather than mass production. We would also like to understand the estimated development timeline, prototype cost, engineering scope, intellectual property ownership and the pathway towards scalable manufacturing if the prototype is successful.', 5, 'Google', '2026-09-28', '05:00 PM', '["https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1790328958115-0flij.jpg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1790328958116-o5vpml.jpg","https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/1790328958116-42h6ge.jpg"]', '2026-09-25 09:35:59.721+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, '711 Scent Band ', false, 'Personal care, beauty, and wellness', 'Startup or new brand'),
	('be8be84f-7c5e-46a4-9e9e-19ed2682e87e', 'Kenneth Sterlin', 'official.kennethsterlin@gmail.com', '+919980857777', 'Pre-incorporation Startup', 'Pre-incorporation startup – website currently under development', 'Early-stage consumer product startup developing a proprietary modular food-container system. The product is currently at concept and initial physical prototype stage, with the core architecture established. I am now looking to take it through industrial design refinement, mechanical engineering, functional prototyping, DFM and manufacturing readiness, with production intended in China.', '0 - 10 Crores INR', 'A proprietary modular food-container system currently at concept and initial physical prototype stage. The fundamental product architecture has already been established, and I am looking for a design and engineering partner to develop it into a validated, manufacturing-ready product.
The scope would primarily include industrial design refinement, mechanical and structural engineering, material and manufacturing-process development, sealing and closure engineering, tolerance development, functional prototyping and testing, DFM, production-ready CAD and technical documentation.
The product combines stainless-steel, injection-moulded polymer and silicone components within a common modular platform. Manufacturing is currently intended to be undertaken in China, so I would also require the design to be developed with tooling and manufacturing feasibility in mind, followed by technical handover/support with the selected manufacturer.
Detailed architecture, CAD, prototype information and proprietary mechanisms can be shared following execution of an NDA.', '{"Product Design Services (Industrial Design)","Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services"}', '5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)', '3 - 4 months', 'The product must operate as a genuinely modular system, with interchangeable food modules working reliably within a common platform. Key requirements include secure leak-resistant sealing, intuitive closure and release, reliable stacking and alignment, durability under repeated daily use, food-safe materials, ease of cleaning and a compact form suitable for everyday carrying.
The Premium version combines insulated stainless-steel food-contact components with injection-moulded polymer components and silicone seals, making cross-material tolerances, sealing performance and interface reliability particularly important.
The underlying architecture should also be scalable across additional sizes and future variants while retaining common interfaces and platform logic. Detailed proprietary architecture and mechanisms can be shared following execution of an NDA.', false, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'I would like to understand IUOVA''s experience taking mechanically complex consumer products from an established concept through detailed engineering, functional validation and manufacturing handover.
In particular, I would like to discuss how you structure projects where industrial design, mechanical engineering, multiple manufacturing processes and tolerance development need to be considered as one integrated system.
I would also like to understand the proposed project stages, expected timeline, commercial structure, number of prototype iterations included, ownership of all project-specific IP and CAD/deliverables, and the level of technical support IUOVA can provide during DFM and handover to a manufacturer in China.
As the product contains proprietary architecture, I would prefer to execute a mutual NDA before sharing the detailed technical brief, CAD and prototype information.', 5, 'Google', '2026-09-28', '11:00 AM', NULL, '2026-09-26 08:01:21.858+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Modular Food-Container System (Working Title: LAYR)', false, 'Consumer kitchenware / food-storage product — a proprietary modular food-container system.', 'Startup or new brand'),
	('217e73e2-af4d-457c-bc84-efb69667b07a', 'Ritwick Mukhopadhyay', 'ritwickm12197@gmail.com', '8240244470', 'Luminous Power Technologies', 'Luminous Power Technologies', 'Luminous Power Technologies is one of India''s leading Energy Solutions organization. We make Inverters, BESS, batteries and solar products. ', '1000 Crores INR and above', 'We have multiple projects associated with Inverters and Batteries which need to kicked-off in the next quater. The project IDs are already worked upon by the in-house Industrial Design Team, but we need to develop Engineering CAD and Prototypes for the same. ', '{"Prototyping Services","Product Engineering Services"}', 'NA', '1 - 2 months', 'Real-time look and feel, CMF match. Basic functionalities.', false, NULL, true, false, NULL, 'NA', 5, 'Over time', '2026-09-30', '11:00 AM', NULL, '2026-09-29 04:48:12.094+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Inverter & Battery Designs', false, 'Energy, batteries, and power systems', 'Manufacturer'),
	('09c03211-dcd2-442e-a450-331a4c73c82f', 'Ritwick Mukhopadhyay ', 'ritwick.mukhopadhyay@luminousindia.com', '8240244470', 'Luminous Power Technologies Pvt Ltd ', 'www.luminousindia.com', 'Energy Solutions', '1000 Crores INR and above', 'We need to develop some Engineering CAD and Protos for some of our recently done ID.', '{"Product Engineering Services","Prototyping Services"}', 'NA', '1 - 2 months', 'CMF match, basic functionalities, Manufacturing friendly ', true, 'MOSFET, Pcb, etc.', true, false, NULL, 'NA', 5, 'Google', '2026-09-30', '12:00 PM', NULL, '2026-09-29 04:57:28.967+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, false, NULL, 'Battery and Inverter CAD & Proto', false, 'Energy, batteries, and power systems', 'Manufacturer');


