	('e54cdc6f-ab9e-492b-bec1-9e414d2f042e', NULL, 'satish.ramavat@aisglass.com', 'client', 'rfq-techno-commercial', 'Techno-Commercial Proposal — Product Design & Development of Door Handle for AIS Windows', 'Hi Satish,

Following our meeting, we are pleased to share the revised Techno-commercial document for the handle design for your reference.

The enclosed document provides a detailed overview of the key activities, project timelines, commercials, and associated deliverables. 

As discussed, the quotation is provided on a per-SKU basis and includes two options: one for three concept designs and another for six concept design options.
Further to the techno-commercial proposal, please find below a simplified commercial summary for better clarity regarding the costing structure for four SKUs.

For Phase 1 – Industrial Design + CMF with Schematics:

Option 1 – 3 Concept Designs per SKU

Cost per SKU: ₹ 3,32,000
For 3 SKUs: ₹ 3,32,000 × 3 = ₹ 9,96,000

& for the 4th SKU : ₹ 3,32,000 / 2 = ₹ 1,66,000

Option 2 – 6 Concept Designs per SKU

Cost per SKU: ₹ 4,32,000
For 3 SKUs: ₹ 4,32,000 × 3 = ₹ 12,96,000

& for the 4th SKU : ₹ 4,32,000 / 2 = ₹ 2,16,000

For Phase 2 – Product Engineering:

Cost per SKU: ₹ 1,32,000
For 4 SKUs: ₹ 1,32,000 × 4 = ₹ 5,28,000

(This cost remains same for both options.)

For Phase 2.3 – Reverse Engineering of mechanism

Cost per SKU: ₹ 52,000

And the cost for Phase 3 - Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing will be a one-time cost of ₹ 2,00,000 applicable to the overall project.

Also please note that the above costings are base fees and are exclusive of the GST charges. 

Furthermore, should you choose to carry forward the design language from any presented concept to any future SKU, the cost for Phase 1 (Industrial Design + CMF with Schematics) will be reduced by fifty percent.

Please review the document and provide your confirmation to proceed with making the existing designs.', 'sent', '2026-06-05 12:54:34.869+00', '<883a574c-7d01-2d79-3a5b-174ae8f3e9c4@iuova.in>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-05 12:54:35.83941+00', NULL),
