      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
        <h2 style="color: #1A1D21; margin-top: 0;">Project Details</h2>
        <p><strong>Services Needed:</strong> Product Design Services (Industrial Design)</p>
        <p><strong>Project Description:</strong></p>
        <p style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px;">The proposed product is an ultra-thin, behind-the-ear wearable health intelligence device designed to continuously monitor cardiovascular, neurological, and physiological signals using a multi-sensor platform. Positioned over the mastoid region, the device integrates dry ECG, ear-EEG, PPG, temperature, IMU, and optional GSR sensors with low-power edge AI to provide continuous health insights while remaining comfortable for up to 15 days of wear. The initial prototype will focus on core capabilities including heart rate and heart rate variability, irregular heart rhythm awareness, sleep staging, sleep apnoea screening, fatigue and drowsiness detection, stress monitoring, body temperature trends, fall detection, circadian rhythm tracking, and balance monitoring.

The scope of work includes human-factor studies, ergonomic design, industrial design, mechanical enclosure development, flexible PCB architecture, sensor placement optimization, electronics integration, firmware development, BLE connectivity, companion mobile application integration, and cloud-based data visualization. The project will also include CAD modelling, prototype fabrication, rapid iteration through 3D printing and flexible electronics, functional testing, signal validation, battery optimization, adhesive and skin-contact evaluation, and preparation for engineering validation testing (EVT). The final deliverable will be a fully functional engineering prototype with complete mechanical, electrical, and software documentation, providing a foundation for regulatory testing, clinical validation, and future design-for-manufacturing (DFM) activities.</p>
        <p><strong>Budget Range:</strong> 5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)</p>
        <p><strong>Timeline:</strong> 1 - 2 months</p>
