        <p><strong>Project Description:</strong></p>
        <p style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px;">We are working on a premium automated retail amenity machine based on an existing plain/base vending machine platform. The base machine will be sourced from a vending machine manufacturer, and the internal vending mechanism, core cabinet structure, electronics, and dispensing system will remain largely unchanged.

The required scope is exterior cosmetic redesign and industrial design refinement within the feasibility of the existing machine platform. This includes front fascia refinement, CMF direction, premium appliance-like exterior treatment, side/back panel detailing, logo integration, subtle lighting direction, and overall visual transformation.

We are not looking for a complete vending machine engineering redesign or a full cabinet redevelopment at this stage. The objective is to convert a plain/base vending machine into a premium, minimal, architectural, luxury-appliance-inspired automated retail amenity suitable for high-end residential clubhouses, corporate lobbies, hotels, gyms, and commercial spaces.

To clarify, this is not a vinyl sticker branding, graphic wrap, or basic logo application project. We are looking for a premium industrial-design-led exterior transformation with an appliance-grade feel, refined CMF, panel treatment, detailing, and high-end product finish.</p>
        <p><strong>Budget Range:</strong> 5 - 10 Lakhs INR (Upto 10000 USD)</p>
