        <p><strong>Project Description:</strong></p>
        <p style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px;">A compact countertop dishwasher, sized for 2 people or a small household’s dishes, that needs no plumbing connection and no mains electrical wiring. It runs on 12V DC, delivered through a standard USB-C Power Delivery charger or a solar power bank. It has no heating element — the user pours in already-hot water. The machine runs a full automatic wash-and-rinse cycle from a single pour of water, using a passive mechanical mechanism to split that one pour into a wash volume and a separate, clean rinse volume, with no second fill, no second pump, and no electronically controlled valve sequencing to achieve the split.</p>
