	(11, '2026-05-20 04:50:26.042196+00', 'Built to suit refined urban lifestyles', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Frame%2033948%20(3).png', 'Minimal in Form. Intelligent in Experience.', 'ZUERST is envisioned as a refined, AI-enabled water heater that blends seamlessly into contemporary spaces. 

The design focuses on clarity, precision, and understated elegance—transforming a functional appliance into a visually calming presence.', 'ZUERST'),
	(12, '2026-05-20 05:50:58.72841+00', 'Crafted for intuitive everyday use', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Frame%2033948%20(4).png', 'Sculpted Harmony', 'LUXEBLEND was designed around a seamless square-to-circular form language that creates a soft yet confident visual identity. 

The glossy body, matte grip zones, metallic top trim, and minimal LED interface together deliver a refined balance of usability, sophistication, and modern lifestyle aesthetics for contemporary kitchen environments.', 'LUXEBLEND'),
	(14, '2026-05-20 06:22:27.023222+00', 'Created for effortless everyday convenience', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Frame%2033948%20(1).png', 'Active Minimalism', 'ARCOS was designed with a clean yet energetic visual language that balances bold character with refined usability. The signature scooping design element seamlessly connects the jar and body, creating a cohesive form that enhances grip and handling confidence.

The dual-tone body, diagonal ventilation details, and premium gloss trim introduce movement and sophistication, while the minimal interface maintains a clean contemporary aesthetic.', 'ARCOS'),
	(2, '2026-01-05 10:34:45.693617+00', 'Paisley cools the room, lights the moment', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/slide2-1.webp', 'Where Form, Function, and Flow Meet', 'Designed for quiet evenings and unhurried moments, it blends airflow, ambient light, and thoughtful storage into a single, seamless presence. With refined finishes and fluid transitions, Paisley stands apart.', 'Paisley'),
	(1, '2026-01-05 06:50:52.625515+00', 'From bustling streets to quite bedrooms', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/slide1-1-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Where clean air meets quiet comfort.', 'More than purification, it curates calm, Clean air, subtle light, and soothing sound blend seamlessly to elevate your mood and slow the moment.', 'Enso'),
	(15, '2026-05-20 06:56:40.905607+00', 'Inspired by the symmetry and rhythm of mandala art', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Frame%2033949.png', 'Unconventional in Form. Elegant in Presence.', 'Treble blends contemporary ceiling fan styling with subtle Indian artistic influence through its integrated mandala-inspired detailing. 

The artwork flows seamlessly from the motor housing into the blade trims, creating a visually connected centrepiece rather than isolated decorative elements. 

Combined with soft metallic finishes and balanced proportions, the design delivers a sophisticated premium identity tailored for modern aspirational interiors.', 'TREBLE'),
	(13, '2026-05-20 06:17:22.639316+00', 'Designed to feel precise, elegant, and effortlessly modern.', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Frame%2033949%20(2).png', 'Designed to feel precise, elegant, and effortlessly modern.', 'ZUVI is envisioned as a sleek, design-forward water purifier that blends effortlessly into modern kitchens. 

The focus is on creating a refined, minimal form that integrates intelligent functionality without visual complexity.', 'ZUVI'),
	(16, '2026-05-20 10:31:03.470563+00', 'Designed to stand out subtly—through form, proportion, and light quality.', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Frame%2033949%20(4).png', 'Unconventional in Form. Elegant in Presence.', 'T-BULB reimagines the lighting archetype by exploring horizontal orientations and alternative geometries beyond the standard T-bulb format. The goal was to create a product that not only illuminates but also enhances the surrounding space.

Its sleek, elongated form introduces a new visual language—one that feels modern, refined, and quietly expressive. The warm glow is designed to create a soft ambient experience, adding depth and character to interiors.', 'T BULB'),
	(17, '2026-07-13 04:52:01.082593+00', 'What  if  the  air  purifier  became  portable', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003178.png', 'How can air purifier look good on persons neck', 'The ideation phase focused on creating a wearable air purifier that users would enjoy wearing every day. Multiple concepts explored different form factors, placement strategies, and airflow mechanisms while maintaining a clean, minimalist aesthetic. The final direction, Loop i, emerged as a balance between functionality, comfort, and a design-first approach, with an integrated LED indicator providing intuitive real-time air quality feedback.', 'loop'),
	(18, '2026-07-13 05:17:03.686918+00', 'What if technology stopped asking for your attention?', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003176.png', 'How might AI become a companion instead of another screen', 'The ideation process began by taking inspiration from the reference board while keeping the research findings, ergonomic understanding, and component analysis at the center of the design approach. These references helped in setting the visual tone and gave direction for exploring different forms, details, and overall product language. During this phase, the goal was to turn all the learnings from the previous stages into concepts that feel both functional and meaningful. ', 'livo'),
	(19, '2026-07-13 06:03:03.475281+00', 'Designed  for  accurate  data  analysis  while ensuring  user  comfort.', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%2020.png', 'Preventive Cardiac Care. Designed for Every Indian Home.', 'Vitus draws inspiration from everyday home and wellness objects, featuring a soft, capsule-inspired form that feels familiar, approachable, and non-clinical. Its minimal design language reduces the intimidation often associated with medical devices while fostering trust, comfort, and emotional connection. 

Designed to feel like a personal object rather than a medical instrument, it combines warmth, simplicity, and premium aesthetics with the precision required for reliable health monitoring.', 'vitus'),
	(20, '2026-07-13 06:27:07.877548+00', 'Created for effortless everyday convenience', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003187.png', 'How can air purifier look good on persons neck', 'FLUXA was designed with a clean yet energetic visual language that balances bold character with refined usability. The signature scooping design element seamlessly connects the jar and body, creating a cohesive form that enhances grip and handling confidence.

The dual-tone body, diagonal ventilation details, and premium gloss trim introduce movement and sophistication, while the minimal interface maintains a clean contemporary aesthetic.', 'fluxa'),
	(21, '2026-08-05 04:56:57.737671+00', NULL, 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003302.png', 'How can A contemporary electric iron support multiple variants on a single platform', 'The ideation phase explored multiple concepts to define a distinctive, ergonomic, and modern electric iron. Various forms, handle geometries, and control layouts were evaluated to establish a strong brand identity while ensuring user comfort, manufacturability, and a scalable platform for future product variants.', 'emphor'),
	(22, '2026-08-11 05:16:51.902011+00', 'Luxury CMF enhances perceived product value', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003304.png', 'How can a single platform support multiple lock safe variants?', 'A modular platform enables multiple variants by integrating interchangeable lock systems, configurable storage modules, and customizable interior layouts on a common structural chassis. Shared components reduce manufacturing complexity and tooling costs, while premium materials, refined finishes, and scalable features ensure every variant maintains a consistent brand identity, superior security, and an elevated user experience.', 'safe'),
	(23, '2026-09-09 05:34:51.123557+00', 'What  if  irons  look  modern, trend-driven', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003191.png', 'Perfromance device with a blend of EMPHASIZED
sophistication and toughness of modern India.', 'Desgined intentional which wins users
psycological first and then physically. Build the
trust and relaibility.

The design language and refined detailing are intentionally crafted to communicate durability and confidence in demanding environments. Holding it conveys a sense of precision, control, and professional capability.', 'Legacy'),
	(24, '2026-09-09 07:52:35.588558+00', 'Air  Purified  with  utmost  aesthetics  and  precision', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003306.png', 'purification device with a blend of carbon collection tray. Premium design language', 'The ideation phase explored multiple form directions, airflow configurations, and interaction possibilities to move beyond conventional air purifier aesthetics. Concepts were developed around a distinctive premium silhouette, integrated carbon collection, accessible maintenance, and ambient air-quality feedback. The selected direction balances functional airflow requirements with a refined modern-home aesthetic, creating a product that feels both technologically advanced and visually desirable.', 'Carbonyx'),
	(25, '2026-09-17 11:05:29.978499+00', 'Make the interaction the identity.', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003311.png', 'What does today’s youth look  for in Pens?', 'By turning familiar interactions into a part of the product’s identity. Aspire integrates the clip and click mechanism into one seamless interaction, while a subtle scooping element adds both grip and visual character. The result is a pen that feels simple to use, yet distinctive in the way it looks, feels, and responds.', 'ASPIRE'),
	(26, '2026-09-18 11:05:12.246724+00', '“Where Airflow Takes Form”', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide3/Group%201000003314.png', 'Minimal in Form. Fluid in Motion.', 'The concept explores how the language of airflow can shape the entire product.
Every element—from the blade sweep to the central hub—is developed as part of one continuous form, creating a fan that appears to move even while standing still.
The sculpted blades transition smoothly from the centre and gradually taper toward their ends, creating a lightweight and dynamic appearance.', 'Fluenza');


