INSERT INTO "public"."slide5" ("id", "created_at", "image", "title", "statement", "product_name", "caption") VALUES
	(6, '2026-01-29 06:55:59.001115+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/1769680718147_zem048-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Engineered for Efficient Stillness.', 'The engineering of this ceiling fan focuses on delivering high-performance airflow with minimal noise and visual distraction.

Optimized blade profiles ensure smooth air movement while reducing turbulence, allowing consistent circulation across the room.', 'Gatik_neo', 'Blending  comfort  into  living  spaces'),
	(7, '2026-01-29 10:35:02.615263+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/1771393044338_sy5xre-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Engineered  Beneath  the Surface', 'The design integrates a high-efficiency BLDC motor architecture within a structurally tapered enclosure to reduce vibration transfer. 

Jar-lid lock detection and sensor-based safety cut-offs enhance operational reliability, while modular internal mounting simplifies assembly and serviceability.', 'FLORA', 'Where  utility  meets  warmth'),
	(8, '2026-01-29 10:50:55.014109+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/1770031894893_1zvt9k-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Designed for Performance & Reliability', 'The charger architecture was re-engineered from the inside out, reorganizing power electronics, structural ribs, and mounting points to improve load distribution and durability. 

Weather-resistant materials, controlled airflow paths, and reinforced connector interfaces ensure consistent performance in outdoor conditions. The integrated cable management system minimizes strain on connectors, extending operational life and reducing maintenance requirements.', 'CHARGE GRID', 'Making charging feel effortless'),
	(9, '2026-01-29 11:15:56.724738+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/1771392669130_s96r0p-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Excellence of Functional Engineering Framework', 'KASPELL optimizes fluid flow, pulp separation, and safety within a compact JMG design. Its in-body juice collector reduces spillage, while the strainer–blade system minimizes clogging and motor strain. 

A side-locking mechanism ensures secure operation, and the integrated controls provide stable speed and enhanced durability.


A side-locking mechanism ensures secure operation, and the integrated controls provide stable speed and enhanced durability.', 'KASPELL', 'Engineering clarity for everyday juicing'),
	(2, '2026-01-05 10:51:10.941992+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Frame%2038%20(2).webp', 'The perfect balance of art, design and engineering.', 'High-end finishes and seamless transitions elevate Paisley into a premium presence. Every curve is intentional, every function naturally placed, making it more than a fan.
It becomes furniture, lighting, and experience in one.', 'Paisley', 'Inspired by pattern          .           Shaped by flow          .           Designed for living.'),
	(5, '2026-01-06 10:19:11.481724+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/DSC045081-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Engineered to adapt to the body', 'CURA is built on the idea that effective relief doesn’t need complexity just thoughtful engineering. The internal structure is designed to balance flexibility and support, adapting to different body contours without creating pressure points.', 'Cura', 'Quiet engineering, designed to care'),
	(10, '2026-02-02 04:55:41.568833+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/1770009045166_l47x1d-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Engineered  for  Efficient Stillness.', 'The engineering of this ceiling fan focuses on delivering high-performance airflow with minimal noise and visual distraction.

Optimized blade profiles ensure smooth air movement while reducing turbulence, allowing consistent circulation across the room.', 'Myro', 'Where  Motion  Becomes  Calm'),
	(1, '2026-01-05 07:48:35.317443+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/1770192997060_yeisg7-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'engineering is not an afterthought it is the silent structure that allows design to breathe.', 'Every seamless surface hides precision. Every experience is engineered to last, perform, and adapt.', 'Enso', 'BREATHE CLEANER. FEEL CALMER.'),
	(11, '2026-05-20 04:50:26.870268+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Frame%2033948%20(2).png', 'Integrated Intelligence with Refined Engineering', 'ZUERST combines smart functionality with a streamlined physical interface. The front touch panel enables precise temperature control, removing the need for traditional knobs and mechanical elements. AI-enabled behavior enhances usability by adapting to user patterns and optimizing performance. Available in 3 sizes.

The outer body is crafted to maintain a seamless grey finish, eliminating visible joints or parting lines, ensuring a clean and uninterrupted surface. Chrome trims are carefully integrated to enhance edge definition and perceived quality.', 'ZUERST', 'Built to maintain comfort without dominating the space'),
	(3, '2026-01-05 10:52:09.235091+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/1770199186348_ulrfcj-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Engineered for Efficient Stillness.', 'The engineering of this ceiling fan focuses on delivering high-performance airflow with minimal noise and visual distraction. Optimized blade profiles ensure smooth air movement while reducing turbulence, allowing consistent circulation across the room.', 'Lustra', 'Where Motion Becomes Calm'),
	(12, '2026-05-20 05:50:59.613614+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Frame%2033948.png', 'Built for smooth usability and refined user experience', 'The implementation phase focused on integrating high-performance functionality within a visually uninterrupted form.

The bold bottom trim was engineered to improve grip stability while handling the powerful 1000W blending system. Its broader geometry enhances control during operation and reinforces the product’s grounded visual stance.

The LED interaction point was intentionally minimized to maintain clarity and reduce visual noise.', 'LUXEBLEND', 'Built for smooth usability and refined user experience'),
	(4, '2026-01-05 10:53:02.967199+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/1771393747851_768wag-ezgif.com-png-to-webp-converter.webp', 'Ellipse is not just about cooling air.', 'Every detail is considered to reduce noise, visual clutter, and mechanical harshness Transforming everyday cooling into a more refined, human experience.', 'Ellipse', 'Designed to cool without disrupting the space'),
	(14, '2026-05-20 06:22:27.930644+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Frame%2033948%20(2).png', 'Seamlessly Integrated Functionality', 'ARCOS was engineered to combine compact performance with intuitive usability. The sculpted scooping feature improves handling ergonomics while visually unifying the product architecture. Integrated diagonal ventilation enhances airflow efficiency while adding depth and movement to the form.

The tall ergonomic jar and secure grip band improve portability and everyday convenience, while the minimal button interface preserves the product’s clean and refined appearance.
', 'ARCOS', 'Engineered for powerful performance in a compact form'),
	(15, '2026-05-20 06:56:41.887957+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Frame%2033949%20(1).png', 'Refined Form with Efficient Performance', 'Treble was developed using advanced In-Mould Decoration (IMD) technology to integrate high-definition mandala-inspired graphics directly into the moulded components.

This approach eliminated multiple post-processing steps while improving scratch resistance, print longevity, and finish consistency. Special attention was given to tooling precision, graphic alignment across intersecting surfaces, and maintaining pattern continuity between the motor housing and blade trims for production-ready scalability.
', 'TREBLE', 'Built to balance decorative detailing with functional performance'),
	(13, '2026-05-20 06:17:23.587312+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Frame%2033949%20(3).png', 'Seamless Integration with Smart Functionality', 'ZUVI redefines interaction through the integration of a sensor-based dispensing system within a redesigned front fascia. This eliminates the need for physical contact, improving hygiene while offering a smooth and responsive user experience.

The front surface is carefully composed to unify dispensing, control, and visual clarity into a single cohesive interface. Its form is optimized for both wall-mounted and countertop use, ensuring flexibility without compromising stability or accessibility.
Every detail is engineered to reduce visual noise while enhancing usability—resulting in a balanced, modern appliance.', 'ZUVI', 'Built to maintain comfort without dominating the space'),
	(16, '2026-05-20 10:31:04.247946+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Frame%2033949%20(5).png', 'Refined Form with Efficient Performance', 'T-BULB integrates energy-efficient lighting technology within a horizontally oriented structure, ensuring optimal light distribution while maintaining a slim, elegant profile.

Multiple form explorations were undertaken to break away from conventional bulb silhouettes, resulting in configurations that balance aesthetics with performance. The final design achieves durability and thermal efficiency without compromising on visual lightness. 

Material and surface treatment enhance the perception of quality, while the form factor allows versatile placement across varied interior settings.', 'T BULB', 'Engineered to perform without disturbing the environment'),
	(18, '2026-07-13 05:17:04.469713+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003180.png', 'engineered in a way which makes it look more compact', 'The components were analyzed by understanding the functions and features the product needed to perform. This mainly focused on identifying the space requirements of each component and how they would be arranged together to support the overall working of the product.
The volume helped create a practical boundary for the design process and gave a clearer direction for form development. It also helped in balancing the internal structure with the external form, ensuring that the product remains functional, well-organized, and comfortable to use while maintaining a clean and refined design language.', 'livo', 'Full integrated ecosystem with custom hardware + AI intelligence + contextual sensing'),
	(19, '2026-07-13 06:03:04.340424+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003182.png', 'Design which makes performance more efficient', 'Vitus is an AI-powered, multi-vital health monitoring device that combines thoughtful design, medical-grade accuracy, and intelligent diagnostics in a compact, ergonomic form. Its intuitive, no-gel, three-step experience makes preventive healthcare accessible for users of all ages. 
By integrating ECG, SpO₂, blood pressure, body composition, and spirometry with edge AI, Vitus delivers real-time, personalized insights while protecting user privacy. Combining multiple diagnostic tools into a single device reduces e-waste and expands access to telemedicine. 
With a scalable roadmap and strong potential for clinical validation, Vitus redefines accessible, sustainable, and intelligent home healthcare.', 'vitus', 'Engineered to perform without disturbing the environment'),
	(17, '2026-07-13 04:52:02.000835+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003179.png', 'Design which makes product look premium', 'The engineering of Loop i focused on integrating efficient air purification technology within a compact, wearable form. Internal components were strategically arranged to optimize airflow while maintaining a lightweight and ergonomic profile. The product incorporates a high-efficiency filtration system, a low-noise fan, a rechargeable battery, and an LED air-quality indicator, ensuring reliable performance, user comfort, and extended daily use.', 'loop', 'unique  brand  language  direction'),
	(20, '2026-07-13 06:27:08.638668+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003188.png', 'Seamlessly Integrated Functionality', 'FLUXA was engineered to combine compact performance with intuitive usability. The directional grip improves handling ergonomics while visually unifying the product architecture. Integrated diagonal ventilation enhances airflow efficiency while adding depth and movement to the form.

The tall ergonomic jar and secure grip band improve portability and everyday convenience, while the minimal button interface preserves the product’s clean and refined appearance.
', 'fluxa', 'Engineered for powerful performance in a compact form'),
	(22, '2026-08-11 05:16:52.730822+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003305.png', 'Design which makes product look premium', 'The engineering phase transformed the design concept into a robust, secure, and manufacturable luxury safe. The internal architecture was optimized to accommodate watch winders, storage drawers, and security mechanisms while maintaining structural strength and a refined exterior. The modular interior supports multiple configurations, enabling product variants and simplifying assembly. Material selection, sheet metal thickness, reinforcement strategies, hinge mechanisms, locking systems, and precision fastening methods were carefully engineered to ensure superior security, long-term durability, premium quality, and cost-effective manufacturing.', 'safe', 'Refined materials and lighting reinforce a premium identity'),
	(21, '2026-08-05 04:56:58.988836+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003303.png', 'Design which makes product look premium', 'The engineering phase translated the design concept into a manufacturable and high-performance product. Internal components were optimized for efficient heat distribution, steam generation, and structural integrity while maintaining a compact form. The modular architecture supports multiple product variants, simplifies assembly, and accommodates interchangeable decorative trims. Material selection, wall thickness, fastening methods, and thermal insulation were carefully engineered to ensure durability, safety, and cost-effective manufacturing.', 'emphor', 'Comfortable  use  during  extended  ironing  sessions.'),
	(23, '2026-09-09 05:34:52.505196+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003307.png', 'Design which makes product look premium', 'The engineering phase translated the design concept into a manufacturable and high-performance product. Internal components were optimized for efficient heat distribution, steam generation, and structural integrity while maintaining a compact form. The modular architecture supports multiple product variants, simplifies assembly, and accommodates interchangeable decorative trims. Material selection, wall thickness, fastening methods, and thermal insulation were carefully engineered to ensure durability, safety, and cost-effective manufacturing.', 'Legacy', 'Comfortable  use  during  extended  ironing  sessions.'),
	(24, '2026-09-09 07:52:37.560234+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003308.png', 'Design which makes product look premium', 'A modular internal architecture integrates the airflow path, filtration system, carbon collection tray, and electronics within a compact premium form. The removable tray enables easy maintenance, while integrated ambient lighting provides intuitive air-quality feedback. Chrome-finished accents and modular construction support a premium, manufacturable design suited to modern home interiors.', 'Carbonyx', 'Purified  air  in  the  world  of  carbon  infused  air'),
	(25, '2026-09-17 11:05:31.018187+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003312.png', 'A considered assembly of components, designed to function as one seamless system.', 'Every component is designed with a clear purpose and a defined relationship to the whole. From the outer barrel and front section to the integrated clip, click mechanism, slider, and internal components, Aspire brings together a compact and cohesive system within a minimal form. The considered part breakup enables a seamless interaction while maintaining the pen’s clean, contemporary character.', 'ASPIRE', 'Refined materials and lighting reinforce a premium identity'),
	(26, '2026-09-18 11:05:13.43723+00', 'https://oscdtdlwdrwvjvteqcix.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/video%20and%20image/slide5/Group%201000003315.png', 'Engineered for Smooth Motion', 'The engineering approach focuses on translating the refined form into a reliable everyday appliance.
The blade geometry, central motor housing, and structural connections are developed to work together while maintaining the intended visual character.
Optimized blade proportions help support consistent air movement, while the balanced three-blade configuration contributes to a smooth rotational experience.', 'Fluenza', '“Where Engineering Meets Elegance”');


