pplicable.\",\"Quote is inclusive of all taxes.\",\"Any additions or changes to the Scope of Work (SOW) after finalizing the design or beyond three iterations will incur additional charges as applicable.\"],\"timeline\":\"23-24 Weeks from Commencement of Project.\",\"deliverablesNote\":\"As per above mentioned.\",\"bankDetailsNote\":\"See \\\"Project Investment & Banking\\\" page for full wire transfer details.\",\"outOfScope\":[\"Mass production tooling, mold making, and tool fabrication costs\",\"Regulatory certifications (BIS, EMC, FCC, CE) — quoted separately\",\"IP filings, design registration government fees, and trademark prosecution\",\"Post-launch warranty support beyond 30 days from handover\"],\"successMetrics\":[{\"metric\":\"Design freeze achieved within Phase 1 timeline\",\"target\":\"4 weeks from kick-off\"},{\"metric\":\"CAD files reviewed and signed off by tooling partner\",\"target\":\"≥ 1 vendor sign-off\"},{\"metric\":\"Prototype passes agreed-upon test plan\",\"target\":\"≥ 90% pass rate\"},{\"metric\":\"Final BOM cost variance vs. quoted target\",\"target\":\"≤ 5% deviation\"}]}","{\"id\":\"pkg_4hyw1h2\",\"is_custom\":false,\"label\":\"Growth Package\",\"enabled\":true,\"productName\":\"\",\"phases\":[{\"name\":\"Phase 1 - Industrial Design + CMF with Schematics\",\"weeks\":\"5\",\"inr\":495000,\"activities\":[\"Kick off meeting & brief discussion\",\"Brainstorming & Ideation on schematic\",\"Client review & refinement of schematic\",\"Brainstorming & Concept Ideation for design\",\"Internal review & refinement of Design\",\"Concept 3D models\",\"Concept Renders\",\"ID presentation\",\"Client review & ID Refinement\",\"Final Presentation\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Design presentation with 3 concept designs.\\n2) 3 CMF combinations for selected concept.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 1.1 – Alpha Prototype\",\"weeks\":\"Included\",\"inr\":\"Included\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"One Visual prototype of one selected concept.\",\"enab