ased\non final prototype of one Handle.(Step or\nParasolid)\n2) Bill Of Materials of one selected concept of handle."}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 2.1 - 2D CAD Drawings", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) 2D drawings of one selected concept of one handle. (In IUOVA''s drawing format)"}, {"inr": "As per Actual", "name": "Phase 2.2 – Beta Prototype", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) Functional/Near real Prototype as per approved materials."}, {"inr": "52000", "name": "Phase 2.3 – Reverse engineering of internal components of one mechanism of handle", "weeks": "2", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "CAD file of all internal components of one mechanism of handle along with 2D drawings."}, {"inr": 200000, "name": "Phase 3 – Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing (One time cost)", "weeks": "3", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Vendor development", "Tool development", "Batch production", "Component Sourcing"], "deliverables": "1) Vendor development for tool\nmanufacturing & production.\n"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Additional Phase 6 - Product Strategy, 360 Research Architecture", "weeks": "-", "enabled": false, "activities": ["Online & Offline survey", "Client study", "E-commerce study", "Area of opportunities as per survey", "Geographic study", "CMF study", "Threshold"], "deliverables": "1) Customized solutions as per client requirement"}], "enabled": true, "timeline": "13-14 Weeks from Commencement of Project.", "is_custom": false, "outOfScope": ["Mass production tooling, mold making, and tool fabrication costs", "Regulatory certifications (BIS, EMC, FCC, CE) — quoted separately", "IP filings, design registration government fees, and trademark prosecution", "Post-launch warranty support beyond 30 days from handover"], "productName": "Product Design & Development of Door Handle (per SKU)", "paymentSummary": ["50% Advance, 30% against Phase 1 and 20% against Project handover.", "Cost of all Prototyping is extra as per applicable.", "Quote is inclusive of all taxes.", "Any additions or changes to the Scope of Work (SOW) after finalizing the design or beyond three iterations will incur additional charges as applicable."], "successMetrics": [{"metric": "Design freeze achieved within Phase 1 timeline", "target": "4 weeks from kick-off"}, {"metric": "CAD files reviewed and signed off by tooling partner", "target": "≥ 1 vendor sign-off"}, {"metric": "Prototype passes agreed-upon test plan", "target": "≥ 90% pass rate"}, {"metric": "Final BOM cost variance vs. quoted target", "target": "≤ 5% deviation"}]}, {"id": "pkg_6sla4qa", "label": "Development of Door Handle (per SKU)", "phases": [{"inr": "332000", "name": "Phase 1 - Industrial Design + CMF with Schematics", "weeks": "4", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Kick off meeting & brief discussion", "Brainstorming & Ideation on schematic", "Client review & refinement of schematic", "Brainstorming & Concept Ideation for design", "Internal review & refinement of Design", "Concept 3D models", "Concept Renders", "ID presentation", "Client review & ID Refinement", "Final Presentation"], "deliverables": "1) Design presentation with 3 concept designs of one handle.\n2) 3 CMF combinations for one selected concept of handle."}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 1.1 – Alpha Prototype", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "One Visual prototype of one selected concept of handle with one CMF option."}, {"inr": "132000", "name": "Phase 2 - Product Engineering & Prototyping", "weeks": "3", "enabled": true, "activities": ["3D CAD models", "Review, update CAD files", "Engineering review & Updated CAD files", "File submission for prototyping/mold maker''s review", "Updated CAD files based on prototype/mold maker''s feedback", "Internal review & Engineering refinement", "Value Engineering", "Final submission"], "deliverables": "1) Engineering 3D CAD file of one selected\nco