he design space", "duration": "2–3 weeks", "activities": "Concept ideation, mood-boarding, CMF studies, rough volumetrics, IP scan"}, {"title": "Render", "letter": "R", "output": "Frozen industrial design + CMF spec ready for engineering", "tagline": "Lock the visual + ergonomic identity", "duration": "3–4 weeks", "activities": "Refined ID, surface modelling, photoreal rendering, hand-feel mock-ups"}, {"title": "Generate", "letter": "G", "output": "Validated engineering prototype with passing test report", "tagline": "Build the engineering reality", "duration": "4–8 weeks", "activities": "CAD authoring, electronics architecture, prototype build, test cycles"}, {"title": "Engineer", "letter": "E", "output": "Production-ready CAD + tooling files + pilot run sign-off", "tagline": "Hand off to manufacturing", "duration": "4–6 weeks", "activities": "DFM, tooling design, vendor coordination, pilot run support, regulatory paperwork"}], "logos_enabled": true, "exec_objective": "To develop a market-ready industrial design and engineering platform for [Product Name] — combining differentiated form, validated function, and tooling-grade documentation that enables Q3 2026 manufacturing handover.", "project_status": "hold", "sign_show_bank": false, "banking_enabled": true, "outcome_enabled": true, "recordCreatedAt": "2026-07-10T11:58:26.55+00:00", "sign_iuova_role": "Founder & Managing Director, IUOVA Design Company", "timeline_enabled": true, "comparison_enabled": true, "payment_milestones": [{"pct": "50%", "label": "Advance", "trigger": "On signed proposal"}, {"pct": "30%", "label": "Phase 1 Sign-off", "trigger": "Industrial Design freeze"}, {"pct": "20%", "label": "Project Handover", "trigger": "Final deliverables"}], "comparison_structure": [{"id": "p1", "name": "Phase - 01\nIndustrial Design & Schematic", "parameters": [{"key": "01_id", "label": "Industrial Design"}, {"key": "01_cmf", "label": "CMF options"}, {"key": "01_pres", "label": "ID Presentation"}, {"key": "01_mock"