"07_pkg_testing", "label": "Product placement and protection approach"}, {"key": "07_pkg_artwork", "label": "Packaging graphics"}]}], "forge_detail_enabled": false, "sign_acceptance_text": "By signing below, the parties acknowledge that the scope, deliverables, commercials, and Terms & Conditions stated in this document have been reviewed and are mutually agreed.", "sign_iuova_signatory": "Vatsal Gudhka", "exec_investment_summary": "Total engagement of 9-10 weeks at the Foundation package level. Investment from ₹16.7L (Foundation) to ₹21.2L (Flagship), excluding GST and prototype costs at actuals."}', '2026-07-03 10:12:03.691+00', '2026-09-16 12:52:09.16+00', '2026-09-16 00:00:00+00', '', '', 'hold'),
