M cost variance vs. quoted target", "target": "≤ 5% deviation"}], "bankDetailsNote": "See \"Project Investment & Banking\" page for full wire transfer details.", "deliverablesNote": "As per above mentioned."}, {"id": "pkg_tmypo05", "label": "Flagship Package", "phases": [{"inr": 594000, "name": "Phase 1 - Industrial Design + CMF with Schematics", "weeks": "4", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Kick off meeting & brief discussion", "Brainstorming & Ideation on schematic", "Client review & refinement of schematic", "Brainstorming & Concept Ideation for design", "Internal review & refinement of Design", "Concept 3D models", "Concept Renders", "ID presentation", "Client review & ID Refinement", "Final Presentation"], "deliverables": "1) Design presentation with 4 concept designs.\n2) 3 CMF combinations for selected concept."}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 1.1 – Alpha Prototype", "weeks": "Included", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "Visual prototype of all 4 concepts with one selected CMF option."}, {"inr": 385000, "name": "Phase 2 - Product Engineering & Prototyping", "weeks": "6", "enabled": true, "activities": ["3D CAD models", "Review, update CAD files", "Engineering review & Updated CAD files", "File submission for prototyping/mold maker''s review", "Updated CAD files based on prototype/mold maker''s feedback", "Internal review & Engineering refinement", "Value Engineering", "Final submission"], "deliverables": "1) Engineering 3D CAD file of one selected concept''s components & Assembly based on final prototype. (Step or Parasolid)"}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 2.1 - 2D CAD Drawings", "weeks": "Included", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) 2D drawings of selected concept. (In IUOVA''s drawing format)"}, {"inr": "As per Actual", "name": "Phase 2.2 – Beta Prototype", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) Functional/Near real Prototype as per approved materials."}, {"inr": 850000, "name"