ne selected concept''s components & Assembly based on final prototype. (Step or Parasolid)"}, {"inr": "As per Actual", "name": "Phase 2.1 - 2D CAD Drawings", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) 2D drawings of selected concept. (In IUOVA''s drawing format)"}, {"inr": "As per Actual", "name": "Phase 2.2 – Beta Prototype", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) Functional/Near real Prototype as per approved materials."}, {"inr": 850000, "name": "Phase 3 - Electrical & Electronics Development", "weeks": "12", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Identify the components", "PCB architecture", "PCB design", "Review & refinements", "Final PCB design submission"], "deliverables": "1) Embedded Hardware (Bill Of Materials)\n2) Embedded Software (Gerber File)"}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 3.1 – PCB Prototype", "weeks": "Included", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) One Prototype of PCB for POC."}, {"inr": "As per Actual", "name": "Phase 4 - Product Validation", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Load test/stress analysis", "Drop test", "Thermal analysis", "FEA simulation"], "deliverables": "1) Customized solutions as per client requirement"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Phase 5 – Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Vendor development", "Tool development", "Batch production", "Component Sourcing"], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Additional Phase 6 - Product Strategy, 360 Research Architecture", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Online & Offline survey", "Client study", "E-commerce study", "Area of opportunities as per survey", "Geographic study", "CMF study", "Threshold"], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": 120000, "name": "Phase 7 - Packaging Development", "weeks": "2", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Packaging design development ", "Product placement and protection approach", "Packaging graphics & product communication", "Material & finish selection", "Packaging refinement & finalisation"], "deliverables": "1) Final packaging design\n2) 3D packaging visualisation using existing product CAD\n3) Packaging specification sheet (material, finish & dimensions)\n4) Final vendor handover files"}], "enabled": true, "timeline": "23-24 Weeks from Commencement of Project.", "is_custom": false, "outOfScope": ["Mass production tooling, mold making, and tool fabrication costs", "Regulatory certifications (BIS, EMC, FCC, CE) — quoted separately", "IP filings, design registration government fees, and trademark prosecution", "Post-launch warranty support beyond 30 days from handover"], "productName": "New product development ", "paymentSummary": ["50% Advance, 30% against Phase 1 and 20% against Project handover.", "Cost of all Prototyping is extra as per applicable.", "Quote is inclusive of all taxes.", "Any additions or changes to the Scope of Work (SOW) after finalizing the design or beyond three iterations will incur additional charges as applicable."], "successMetrics": [{"metric": "Design freeze achieved within Phase 1 timeline", "target": "4 weeks from kick-off"}, {"metric": "CAD files reviewed and signed off by tooling partner", "target": "≥ 1 vendor sign-off"}, {"metric": "Prototype passes agreed-upon test plan", "target": "≥ 90% pass rate"}, {"metric": "Final BOM cost variance vs. quoted target", "target": "≤ 5% deviation"}], "bankDetailsNote": "See \"Project Investment & Banking\" page for full wire transfer details.", "deliverablesNote": "As per above mentioned."}, {"id": "pkg_tkjz69a", "label": "Growth Package", "phases": [{"inr": 495000, "name": "Phase 1 - Industrial Design + CMF with Schematics", "weeks": "5", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Kick off meeting & brief discussion", "Brainstorming & Ideation on schematic", "Client review & refinement of schematic", "Brainstorming & Concept Ideation for design", "Internal review & refinement of Design", "Concept 3D