hrough tooling, vendor alignment, pilot run, and post-launch — the 70% of work that determines whether your product actually ships.", "title": "Hardware Commercialization Partner — Not a Design Studio"}, {"body": "Most studios outsource engineering. Most engineering firms outsource design. We run all three in-house, which collapses 4–6 weeks of vendor coordination overhead per project and ensures the BOM matches the brief.", "title": "Design × Engineering × Supply Chain Under One Roof"}, {"body": "From Bajaj fans to boAt audio devices to industrial Siemens enclosures — our team has shipped at scale across consumer electronics, smart appliances, medical devices, and industrial categories. Pattern recognition compounds.", "title": "Track Record Across 200+ Shipped Products"}, {"body": "Every project follows the same FORGE™ framework: Frame → Orient → Render → Generate → Engineer. Every phase has explicit entry/exit criteria, documented deliverables, and a client sign-off gate. No surprises.", "title": "FORGE™ Methodology — Stage-Gated, Auditable"}], "workstreams": "Product Strategy, 360 Research Excellence & Architecture\nIndustrial Design + CMF\nProduct Engineering + DFM\nProduct Value Engineering and Validation\nPrototyping, Model Making & Reverse Engineering\nBranding Architecture & Animation Content Development\nVisuals Communication & Packaging Development", "exec_enabled": true, "instagramUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/iuovadesign/", "project_name": "New product development ", "recordStatus": "Draft", "risk_enabled": true, "sign_enabled": true, "team_enabled": true, "team_members": [{"name": "Vatsal Gudhka", "role": "Founder & Managing Director", "specialty": "Strategy, business development, and senior client engagement across all engagements."}, {"name": "Anirudha Masurkar", "role": "Design Manager", "specialty": "Industrial design, CMF strategy, and concept-to-pre-tooling oversight."}, {"name": "Waseed Saad", "role": "Engineering Manager", "specialty": "Mechanical engineering, DFM, and structural validation across consumer hardware."}, {"name": "Mandar Ambelkar", "role": "Product Manager", "specialty": "Project orchestration, stage-gate enforcement, and client delivery cadence."}, {"name": "Prabhakar Nachare", "role": "Supply Chain Manager", "specialty": "Vendor development, tooling alignment, and BOM commercial strategy."}, {"name": "Rupali Sirsath", "role": "Business Development", "specialty": "Engagement scoping, commercial structuring, and account management."}], "exec_approach": "IUOVA will execute a phased product realization sprint covering industrial design, engineering, embedded electronics, and manufacturing readiness. Each phase concludes with a stage-gate review giving the client decision authority before downstream investment.", "exec_outcomes": ["Two refined design concepts with full CMF (color, material, finish) options", "Production-grade 3D CAD models reviewed and signed off by tooling partners", "Functional prototype validated against agreed-upon test plan", "Manufacturing-ready BOM, Gerber files, and vendor-aligned documentation"], "forge_enabled": true, "forge_pillars": [{"title": "Frame", "letter": "F", "output": "Approved Product Brief + Success Criteria document", "tagline": "Define the problem before designing the solution", "duration": "1–2 weeks", "activities": "Stakeholder interviews, market scan, competitive teardown, brief consolidation"}, {"title": "Orient", "letter": "O", "output": "3–5 concept directions with rationale and selection matrix", "tagline": "Map the design space", "duration": "2–3 weeks", "activities": "Concept ideation, mood-boarding, CMF studies, rough volumetrics, IP scan"}, {"title": "Render", "letter": "R", "output": "Frozen industrial design + CMF spec ready for engineering", "tagline": "Lock the visual + ergonomic identity", "duration": "3–4 weeks", "activities": "Refined ID, surface modelling, photoreal rendering, hand-feel mock-ups"}, {"title": "Generate", "letter": "G", "output": "Validated engineering prototype with passing test report", "tagline": "Build the engineering reality", "duration": "4–8 weeks", "activities": "CAD authoring, electronics architecture, prototype build, test cycles"}, {"title": "Engineer", "letter": "E", "output": "Production-ready CAD + tooling files + pilot run sign-off", "tagline": "Hand off to manufacturing", "duration": "4–6 weeks", "activities": "DFM, tooling design, vendor coordination, pilot run support, regulatory paperwork"}], "logos_enabled": true, "exec_objective": "To develop a market-ready industrial design and engineering platform for [Product Name] — combining differentiated form, validated function, and tooling-grade documentation that enables Q3 2026 manufacturing handover.", "project_status": "meeting not done", "sign_show_bank": false, "banking_enabled": true, "outcome_enabled": true, "recordCreatedAt": "2026-07-18T17:02:51.072+00:00", "sign_iuova_role": "Founder & Managing Director, IUOVA Design Company", "timeline_enabled": true, "comparison_enabled": true, "payment_milestones": [{"pct": "50%", "label": "Advance", "trigger": "On signed proposal"}, {"pct": "30%", "label": "Phase 1 Sign-off", "trigger": "Industrial Design freeze"}, {"pct": "20%", "label": "Project Handover", "trigger": "Final deliverables"}], "comparison_structure": [{"id": "p1", "name": "Phase - 01\nIndustrial Design & Schematic", "parameters": [{"key": "01_id", "label": "Industrial Design"}, {"key": "01_cmf", "label": "CMF options"}, {"key": "01_pres", "label": "ID Presentation"}, {"key": "01_mock", "label": "Visual Mock-up"}]}, {"id": "p2", "name": "Phase - 02\nProduct Engineering", "parameters": [{"key": "02_3d", "label": "3D Cad model"}, {"key": "02_mod_proto", "label": "Modification based on Prototype"}, {"key": "02_mod_tool", "label": "Modifications based on Tooling person''s review"}, {"key": "02_val", "label": "Value Engineering"}, {"key": "02_2d", "label": "2D drawing files"}]}, {"id": "p3", "name": "Phase