ement based on IUOVA''s prior work in similar product categories. Each risk is paired with a concrete mitigation that is built into our project workflow.", "tc_enabled": true, "team_intro": "Your engagement is led by a senior team with combined 80+ years of product development experience across India, US, EU, and APAC markets.", "websiteUrl": "http://www.iuovadesign.com/", "clientEmail": "nikhilj@pmcona.in", "faq_enabled": true, "faq_heading": "Frequently Asked Questions", "forge_intro": "FORGE™ is IUOVA''s proprietary methodology for taking hardware products from idea to market. Five stage-gated phases, each with explicit entry/exit criteria and client sign-off.", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/iuovadesigncompany", "logos_intro": "Our work has shipped at scale across India''s leading consumer brands and global industrial OEMs.", "why_enabled": true, "why_pillars": [{"body": "We don''t hand off CAD files at \"concept ready\" and walk away. IUOVA stays through tooling, vendor alignment, pilot run, and post-launch — the 70% of work that determines whether your product actually ships.", "title": "Hardware Commercialization Partner — Not a Design Studio"}, {"body": "Most studios outsource engineering. Most engineering firms outsource design. We run all three in-house, which collapses 4–6 weeks of vendor coordination overhead per project and ensures the BOM matches the brief.", "title": "Design × Engineering × Supply Chain Under One Roof"}, {"body": "From Bajaj fans to boAt audio devices to industrial Siemens enclosures — our team has shipped at scale across consumer electronics, smart appliances, medical devices, and industrial categories. Pattern recognition compounds.", "title": "Track Record Across 200+ Shipped Products"}, {"body": "Every project follows the same FORGE™ framework: Frame → Orient → Render → Generate → Engineer. Every phase has explicit entry/exit criteria, documented deliverables, and a client sign-off gate. No surprises.", "title": 