oundation package level. Investment from ₹16.7L (Foundation) to ₹21.2L (Flagship), excluding GST and prototype costs at actuals."}', '2026-07-22 10:16:17.456741+00', '2026-07-22 10:16:17.456741+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
