ept.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 2 - Product Engineering & Prototyping\",\"weeks\":\"5\",\"inr\":299000,\"activities\":[\"3D CAD models\",\"Review, update CAD files\",\"Engineering review & Updated CAD files\",\"File submission for prototyping/mold maker''s review\",\"Updated CAD files based on prototype/mold maker''s feedback\",\"Internal review & Engineering refinement\",\"Value Engineering\",\"Final submission\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Engineering 3D CAD file of one selected concept''s components & Assembly based on final prototype. (Step or Parasolid)\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 2.1 - 2D CAD Drawings\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"As per Actual\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"1) 2D drawings of selected concept. (In IUOVA''s drawing format)\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 2.2 – Beta Prototype\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"As per Actual\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"1) Functional/Near real Prototype as per approved materials.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 3 - Electrical & Electronics Development\",\"weeks\":\"12\",\"inr\":850000,\"activities\":[\"Identify the components\",\"PCB architecture\",\"PCB design\",\"Review & refinements\",\"Final PCB design submission\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Embedded Hardware (Bill Of Materials)\\n2) Embedded Software (Gerber File)\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 3.1 – PCB Prototype\",\"weeks\":\"Included\",\"inr\":\"Included\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"1) One Prototype of PCB for POC.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 4 - Product Validation\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"As per Actual\",\"activities\":[\"Load test/stress analysis\",\"Drop test\",\"Thermal analysis\",\"FEA simulation\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Customized solutions as per client requirement\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 5 – Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[\"Vendor development\",\"Tool development\",\"Batch production\",\"Component Sou