port beyond 30 days from handover"], "productName": "Project VinDi", "paymentSummary": ["50% Advance, 30% against Phase 1 and 20% against Project handover.", "Cost of all Prototyping is extra as per applicable.", "Quote is inclusive of all taxes.", "Any additions or changes to the Scope of Work (SOW) after finalizing the design or beyond three iterations will incur additional charges as applicable."], "successMetrics": [{"metric": "Design freeze achieved within Phase 1 timeline", "target": "4 weeks from kick-off"}, {"metric": "CAD files reviewed and signed off by tooling partner", "target": "≥ 1 vendor sign-off"}, {"metric": "Prototype passes agreed-upon test plan", "target": "≥ 90% pass rate"}, {"metric": "Final BOM cost variance vs. quoted target", "target": "≤ 5% deviation"}], "bankDetailsNote": "See \"Project Investment & Banking\" page for full wire transfer details.", "deliverablesNote": "As per above mentioned."}, {"id": "pkg_prs9pkx", "note": "", "label": "Flagship Package", "phases": [{"inr": 594000, "name": "Phase 1 - Industrial Design + CMF with Schematics", "weeks": "5", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Kick off meeting & brief discussion", "Brainstorming & Ideation on schematic", "Client review & refinement of schematic", "Brainstorming & Concept Ideation for design", "Internal review & refinement of Design", "Concept 3D models", "Concept Renders", "ID presentation", "Client review & ID Refinement", "Final Presentation"], "deliverables": "1) Design presentation with 4 concept designs.\n2) 3 CMF combinations for selected concept."}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 1.1 – Alpha Prototype", "weeks": "Included", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "Visual prototype of all 4 concepts with one selected CMF option."}, {"inr": 385000, "name": "Phase 2 - Product Engineering & Prototyping", "weeks": "5", "enabled": true, "activities": ["3D CAD models", "Review, update CAD files", "Engineering review & Updated CAD files", "File submission for prototyping/mold maker''s review", "Updated CAD files based on prototype/mold maker''s feedback", "Internal review & Engineering refinement", "Value Engineering", "Final submission"], "deliverables": "1) Engineering 3D CAD file of one selected concept''s components & Assembly based on final prototype. (Step or Parasolid)"}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 2.1 - 2D CAD Drawings", "weeks": "Included", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) 2D drawings of selected concept. (In IUOVA''s drawing format)"}, {"inr": "As per Actuals", "name": "Phase 2.2 – Beta Prototype", "weeks": "As per Actuals", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) Functional/Near real Prototype as per approved materials."}, {"inr": "415000", "name": "Phase 3 - Electrical & Electronics Development", "weeks": "5", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Identify the components", "PCB architecture", "PCB design", "Review & refinements", "Final PCB design submission"], "deliverables": "1) Embedded Hardware (Bill Of Materials)\n2) Embedded Software (Gerber File)"}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 3.1 – PCB Prototype", "weeks": "Included", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) One Prototype of PCB for POC."}, {"inr": "200000", "name": "Phase 4 - Product Validation", "weeks": "3", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Value Engineering", "Mold flow Analysis", "Mold Feasibility", "DFM"], "deliverables": "1) One report of CFD Analysis (2 Iterations).\n2)3D Cad files of product''s assembly & component based on analysis. (Mentioned in Phase 1)."}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Phase 5 – Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Vendor development", "Tool development", "Batch production", "Component Sourcing"], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Additional Phase 6 - Product Strategy, 360 Research Architecture", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Online & Offline survey", "Client study", "E-commerce st