any/iuovadesigncompany", "logos_intro": "Our work has shipped at scale across India''s leading consumer brands and global industrial OEMs.", "remark_date": "2026-09-08", "why_enabled": true, "why_pillars": [{"body": "We don''t hand off CAD files at \"concept ready\" and walk away. IUOVA stays through tooling, vendor alignment, pilot run, and post-launch — the 70% of work that determines whether your product actually ships.", "title": "Hardware Commercialization Partner — Not a Design Studio"}, {"body": "Most studios outsource engineering. Most engineering firms outsource design. We run all three in-house, which collapses 4–6 weeks of vendor coordination overhead per project and ensures the BOM matches the brief.", "title": "Design × Engineering × Supply Chain Under One Roof"}, {"body": "From Bajaj fans to boAt audio devices to industrial Siemens enclosures — our team has shipped at scale across consumer electronics, smart appliances, medical devices, and industrial categories. Pattern recognition compounds.", "title": "Track Record Across 200+ Shipped Products"}, {"body": "Every project follows the same FORGE™ framework: Frame → Orient → Render → Generate → Engineer. Every phase has explicit entry/exit criteria, documented deliverables, and a client sign-off gate. No surprises.", "title": "FORGE™ Methodology — Stage-Gated, Auditable"}], "workstreams": "Product Strategy, 360 Research Excellence & Architecture\nIndustrial Design + CMF\nProduct Engineering + DFM\nProduct Value Engineering and Validation\nPrototyping, Model Making & Reverse Engineering\nBranding Architecture & Animation Content Development\nVisuals Communication & Packaging Development", "exec_enabled": false, "instagramUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/iuovadesign/", "project_name": "Outdoor Air Purifier Development", "recordStatus": "Draft", "risk_enabled": false, "sign_enabled": true, "team_enabled": false, "team_members": [{"name": "Vatsal Gudhka", "role": "Founder & Managing Director", "specialty": 