old maker''s review\",\"Updated CAD files based on prototype/mold maker''s feedback\",\"Internal review & Engineering refinement\",\"Value Engineering\",\"Final submission\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Engineering 3D CAD file of one selected concept''s components & Assembly based on final prototype. (Step or Parasolid)\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 2.1 - 2D CAD Drawings\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 2.2 – Beta Prototype\",\"weeks\":\"As per Actuals\",\"inr\":\"As per Actuals\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"1) Functional/Near real Prototype as per approved materials.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 3 - Electrical & Electronics Development\",\"weeks\":\"12\",\"inr\":850000,\"activities\":[\"Identify the components\",\"PCB architecture\",\"PCB design\",\"Review & refinements\",\"Final PCB design submission\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Embedded Hardware (Bill Of Materials)\\n2) Embedded Software (Gerber File)\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 3.1 – PCB Prototype\",\"weeks\":\"Included\",\"inr\":\"Included\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"1) One Prototype of PCB for POC.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 4 - Product Validation\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[\"Value Engineering\",\"Mold flow Analysis\",\"Mold Feasibility\",\"DFM\"],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 5 – Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[\"Vendor development\",\"Tool development\",\"Batch production\",\"Component Sourcing\"],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Additional Phase 6 - Product Strategy, 360 Research Architecture\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[\"Online & Offline survey\",\"Client study\",\"E-commerce study\",\"Area of opportunities as per survey\",\"Geographic study\",\"CMF study\",\"Threshold\"],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Ph