ign & Development Workflow", "weeksPerMonth": 4}, "v1_image": "/assets/ellipse-CanjMELi.jpg", "v1_title": "Ellipse Tower Fan", "v2_image": "/assets/cura-CbGykKv3.jpg", "v2_title": "Cura Heat Therapy Device", "faq_intro": "Below are answers to common questions clients ask before engaging with IUOVA on a product development partnership.", "page_order": ["cover", "exec", "about", "why", "team", "forge", "forge_detail", "timeline", "packages", "comparison", "banking", "outcome", "risk", "tc", "faq"], "risk_intro": "The following risks have been identified for this engagement based on IUOVA''s prior work in similar product categories. Each risk is paired with a concrete mitigation that is built into our project workflow.", "tc_enabled": true, "team_intro": "Your engagement is led by a senior team with combined 80+ years of product development experience across India, US, EU, and APAC markets.", "websiteUrl": "http://www.iuovadesign.com/", "clientEmail": "parthvikamsey@gmail.com", "faq_enabled": true, "faq_heading": "Frequently Asked Questions", "forge_intro": "FORGE™ is IUOVA''s proprietary methodology for taking hardware products from idea to market. Five stage-gated phases, each with explicit entry/exit criteria and client sign-off.", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/iuovadesigncompany", "logos_intro": "Our work has shipped at scale across India''s leading consumer brands and global industrial OEMs.", "remark_date": "2026-08-11", "why_enabled": true, "why_pillars": [{"body": "We don''t hand off CAD files at \"concept ready\" and walk away. IUOVA stays through tooling, vendor alignment, pilot run, and post-launch — the 70% of work that determines whether your product actually ships.", "title": "Hardware Commercialization Partner — Not a Design Studio"}, {"body": "Most studios outsource engineering. Most engineering firms outsource design. We run all three in-house, which collapses 4–6 weeks of vendor coordination overhead per project and ensures the BOM matches the brief.", "title": "Design × Engineering × Supply Chain Under One Roof"}, {"body": "From Bajaj fans to boAt audio devices to industrial Siemens enclosures — our team has shipped at scale across consumer electronics, smart appliances, medical devices, and industrial categories. Pattern recognition compounds.", "title": "Track Record Across 200+ Shipped Products"}, {"body": "Every project follows the same FORGE™ framework: Frame → Orient → Render → Generate → Engineer. Every phase has explicit entry/exit criteria, documented deliverables, and a client sign-off gate. No surprises.", "title": "FORGE™ Methodology — Stage-Gated, Auditable"}], "workstreams": "Product Strategy, 360 Research Excellence & Architecture\nIndustrial Design + CMF\nProduct Engineering + DFM\nProduct Value Engineering and Validation\nPrototyping, Model Making & Reverse Engineering\nBranding Architecture & Animation Content Development\nVisuals Communication & Packaging Development", "exec_enabled": true, "instagramUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/iuovadesign/", "project_name": "ORCA", "recordStatus": "Draft", "risk_enabled": true, "sign_enabled": true, "team_enabled": true, "team_members": [{"name": "Vatsal Gudhka", "role": "Founder & Managing Director", "specialty": "Strategy, business development, and senior client engagement across all engagements."}, {"name": "Anirudha Masurkar", "role": "Design Manager", "specialty": "Industrial design, CMF strategy, and concept-to-pre-tooling oversight."}, {"name": "Waseet Saad", "role": "Engineering Manager", "specialty": "Mechanical engineering, DFM, and structural validation across consumer hardware."}, {"name": "Mandar Ambelkar", "role": "Product Manager", "specialty": "Project orchestration, stage-gate enforcement, and client delivery cadence."}, {"name": "Prabhakar Nachare", "role": "Supply Chain Manager", "specialty": "Vendor development, tooling alignment, and BOM commercial strategy."}, {"name": "Rupali Sirsath", "role": "Business Development", "specialty": "Engagement scoping, commercial structuring, and account management."}], "exec_approach": "IUOVA will execute a phased product realization sprint covering industrial design, engineering, embedded electronics, and manufacturing readiness. Each phase concludes with a stage-gate review giving the client decision authority before downstream investment.", "exec_outcomes": ["Two refined design concepts with full CMF (color, material, finish) options", "Production-grade 3D CAD models reviewed and signed off by tooling partners", "Functional prototype validated against agreed-upon test plan", "Manufacturing-ready BOM, Gerber files, and vendor-aligned documentation"], "forge_enabled": true, "forge_pillars": [{"title": "Frame", "letter": "F", "output": "Approved Product Brief + Success Criteria document", "tagline": "Define the problem before designing the solution", "duration": "1–2 weeks", "activities": "Stakeholder interviews, market scan, competitive teardown, brief consolidation"}, {"title": "Orient", "letter": "O", "output": "3–5 concept directions with rationale and selection matrix", "tagline": "Map the design space", "duration": "2–3 weeks", "activities": "Concept ideation, mood-boarding, CMF studies, rough volumetrics, IP scan"}, {"title": "Render", "letter": "R", "output": "Frozen industrial design + CMF spec ready for engineering", "tagline": "Lock the visual + ergonomic identity", "duration": "3–4 weeks", "activities": "Refined ID, surface modelling, photoreal rendering, hand-feel mock-ups"}, {"title": "Generate", "letter": "G", "output": "Validated engineering prototype with passing test report", "tagline": "Build the engineering reality", "duration": "4–8 weeks", "activities": "CAD authoring, electronics architecture, prototype build, test cycles"}, {"title": "Engineer", "letter": "E", "output": "Production-ready CAD + tooling files + pilot run sign-off", "tagline": "Hand off to manufacturing", "duration": "4–6 weeks", "activities": "DFM, tooling design, vendor coordination, pilot run support, regulatory paperwork"}], "logos_enabled": true, "exec_objective": "To develop a market-ready industrial design and engineering platform for [Product Name] — combining differentiated form, validated function, and tooling-grade documentation that enables Q3 2026 manufacturing handover.", "project_status": "under discussion", "sign_show_bank": false, "banking_enabled": true, "outcome_enabled": true, "recordCreatedAt": "2026-08-03T08:28:17.927+00:00", "sign_iuova_role": "Founder & Managing Director, IUOVA Design Company", "why_media_links": ["https://www.iuovadesign.com/media?video=f21526ed-ad59-41fb-92a7-72a5072ef891", "https://www.iuovadesign.com/media?video=e1524160-6dc7-40ff-acf5-bdf7dfaef0ab", "https://www.iuovadesign.com/media?video=fe8e5a11-b611-42a9-8375-8c072bd9453b", "https://www.iuovadesign.com/media?video=2094df21-a2dc-4eb7-b06e-09963c37036d"], "timeline_enabled": true, "comparison_enabled": true, "payment_milestones": [{"pct": "50%", "label": "Advance", "trigger": "On signed proposal"}, {"pct": "30%", "label": "Phase 1 Sign-off", "trigger": "Industrial Design freeze"}, {"pct": "20%", "label": "Project Handover", "trigger": "Final deliverables"}], "comparison_structure": [{"id": "p1", "name": "Phase - 01\nIndustrial Design & Schematic", "parameters": [{"key": "01_id", "label": "Industrial Design"}, {"key": "01_cmf", "label": "CMF options"}, {"key": "01_pres", "label": "ID Presentation"}, {"key": "01_mock", "label": "Visual Mock-up"}]}, {"id": "p2", "name": "Phase - 02\nProduct Engineering", "parameters": [{"key": "02_3d", "label": "3D Cad model"}, {"key": "02_mod_proto", "label": "Modification based on Prototype"}, {"key": "02_mod_tool", "label": "Modifications based on Tooling person''s review"}, {"key": "02_val", "label": "Value Engineering"}, {"key": "02_2d", "label": "2D drawing files"}]}, {"id": "p3", "name": "Phase – 03\nElectrical & Electronics", "parameters": [{"key": "03_poc", "label": "Development of POC"}, {"key": "03_pcb_arch", "label": "PCB Architecture"}, {"key": "03_pcb_design", "label": "PCB Design"}, {"key": "03_rev", "label": "Review & Refinements"}]}, {"id": "p4", "name": "Phase – 04\nAnalysis", "parameters": [{"key": "04_mold", "label": "Drop test and CFD analysis"}]}, {"id": "p5", "name": "Phase – 05\nManufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing", "parameters": [{"key": "05_vendor_dev", "label": "Vendor development"}, {"key": "05_tool_dev", "label": "Tool development"}, {"key": "05_batch_prod", "label": "Batch production"}, {"key": "05_comp_sourcing", "label": "Component Sourcing"}]}, {"id": "p6", "name": "Phase – 06\nProduct Strategy, 360 Research Architecture", "parameters": [{"key": "06_survey", "label": "Online & Offline survey"}, {"key": "06_client_study", "label": "Client study"}, {"key": "06_ecommerce", "label": "E-commerce study"}, {"key": "06_opportunities", "label": "Area of opportunities as per survey"}, {"key": "06_geographic", "label": "Geographic study"}, {"key": "06_cmf_study", "label": "CMF study"}, {"key": "06_threshold", "label": "Threshold"}]}, {"id": "p7", "name": "Phase – 07\nPackaging development", "parameters": [{"key": "07_pkg_design", "label": "Packaging design development"}, {"key": "07_pkg_testing", "label": "Product placement and protection approach"}, {"key": "07_pkg_artwork", "label": "Packaging graphics"}]}], "forge_detail_enabled": false, "sign_acceptance_text": "By signing below, the parties acknowledge that the scope, deliverables, commercials, and Terms & Conditions stated in this document have been reviewed and are mutually agreed.", "sign_iuova_signatory": "Vatsal Gudhka", "exec_investment_summary": "Total engagement of 9-10 weeks at the Foundation package level. Investment from ₹16.7L (Foundation) to ₹21.2L (Flagship), excluding GST and prototype costs at actuals."}', '2026-08-03 08:28:17.927+00', '2026-08-11 07:58:58.259+00', '2026-08-11 00:00:00+00', '', '', 'under discussion'),
	('tc_pdetnffbk', 'Lifeline Pharma', 'We have developed a patented patient shifting stretcher named SHIFTEEZ,designed to transfer patients with minimumdisturbance and maximum comfort during treatment.', 'kiran khobare', 'lifelinepharma01@gmail.com', '9821053512', '{"{\"id\":\"pkg_eqg3s7y\",\"is_custom\":false,\"label\":\"Foundation Package\",\"enabled\":true,\"productName\":\"We have developed a patented patient shifting stretcher named SHIFTEEZ,designed to transfer patients with minimumdisturbance and maximum comfort during treatment.\",\"phases\":[{\"name\":\"Phase 1 - Industrial Design + CMF with Schematics\",\"weeks\":\"4\",\"inr\":396000,\"activities\":[\"Kick off meeting & brief discussion\",\"Brainstorming & Ideation on schematic\",\"Client review & refinement of schematic\",\"Brainstorming & Concept Ideation for design\",\"Internal review & refinement of Design\",\"Concept 3D models\",\"Concept Renders\",\"ID presentation\",\"Client review & ID Refinement\",\"Final Presentation\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Design presentation with 2 concept designs.\\n2) 3 CMF combinations for selected concept.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 1.1 – Alpha Prototype\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 2 - Product Engineering & Prototyping\",\"weeks\":\"4\",\"inr\":299000,\"activities\":[\"3D CAD models\",\"Review, update CAD files\",\"Engineering review & Updated CAD files\",\"File submission for prototyping/mold maker''s review\",\"Updated CAD files based on prototype/mold maker''s feedback\",\"Internal review & Engineering refinement\",\"Value Engineering\",\"Final submission\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Engineering 3D CAD file of one selected concept''s components & Assembly based on final prototype. (Step or Parasolid)\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 2.1 - 2D CAD Drawings\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 2.2 – Beta Prototype\",\"weeks\":\"As per Actuals\",\"inr\":\"As per Actuals\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"1) Functional/Near real Prototype as per approved materials.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 3 - Electrical & Electronics Development\",\"weeks\":\"12\",\"inr\":850000,\"activities\":[\"Identify the components\",\"PCB architecture\",\"PCB design\",\"Review & refinements\",\"Final PCB design submission\"],\"deliverables\":\"1) Embedded Hardware (Bill Of Materials)\\n2) Embedded Software (Gerber File)\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 3.1 – PCB Prototype\",\"weeks\":\"Included\",\"inr\":\"Included\",\"activities\":[],\"deliverables\":\"1) One Prototype of PCB for POC.\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 4 - Product Validation\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[\"Value Engineering\",\"Mold flow Analysis\",\"Mold Feasibility\",\"DFM\"],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 5 – Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[\"Vendor development\",\"Tool development\",\"Batch production\",\"Component Sourcing\"],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Additional Phase 6 - Product Strategy, 360 Research Architecture\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[\"Online & Offline survey\",\"Client study\",\"E-commerce study\",\"Area of opportunities as per survey\",\"Geographic study\",\"CMF study\",\"Threshold\"],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true},{\"name\":\"Phase 7 - Packaging Development\",\"weeks\":\"-\",\"inr\":\"-\",\"activities\":[\"Packaging design development \",\"Product placement and protection approach\",\"Packaging graphics & product communication\",\"Material & finish selection\",\"Packaging refinement & finalisation\"],\"deliverables\":\"-\",\"enabled\":true}],\"paymentSummary\":[\"50% Advance, 30% against Phase 1 and 20% against Project handover.\",\"Cost of all Prototyping is extra as per applicable.\",\"Quote is inclusive of all taxes.\"