ronics Development", "weeks": "12", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Identify the components", "PCB architecture", "PCB design", "Review & refinements", "Final PCB design submission"], "deliverables": "1) Embedded Hardware (Bill Of Materials)\n2) Embedded Software (Gerber File)"}, {"inr": "Included", "name": "Phase 3.1 – PCB Prototype", "weeks": "Included", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) One Prototype of PCB for POC."}, {"inr": 200000, "name": "Phase 4 - Product Validation", "weeks": "3", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Value Engineering", "Mold flow Analysis", "Mold Feasibility", "DFM"], "deliverables": "1) One report of CFD Analysis (2 Iterations).\n2)3D Cad files of product''s assembly & component based on analysis. (Mentioned in Phase 1)."}, {"inr": 200000, "name": "Phase 5 – Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing", "weeks": "3", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Vendor development", "Tool development", "Batch production", "Component Sourcing"], "deliverables": "1) Vendor Development for material sourcing, costing, & tooling."}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Additional Phase 6 - Product Strategy, 360 Research Architecture", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Online & Offline survey", "Client study", "E-commerce study", "Area of opportunities as per survey", "Geographic study", "CMF study", "Threshold"], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": 158000, "name": "Phase 7 - Packaging Development", "weeks": "2", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Packaging design development ", "Product placement and protection approach", "Packaging graphics & product communication", "Material & finish selection", "Packaging refinement & finalisation"], "deliverables": "1) Final packaging design\n2) 3D packaging visualisation using existing product CAD\n3) Packaging specification sheet (material, finish & dimensions)\n4) Final vendor handover files"}], "enabled": true, "timeline": "30-31 Weeks from Commencement of Project.", "is_custom": false, "outOfSc