otype of one selected concept."}, {"inr": 299000, "name": "Phase 2 - Product Engineering & Prototyping", "weeks": "4", "enabled": true, "activities": ["3D CAD models", "Review, update CAD files", "Engineering review & Updated CAD files", "File submission for prototyping/mold maker''s review", "Updated CAD files based on prototype/mold maker''s feedback", "Internal review & Engineering refinement", "Value Engineering", "Final submission"], "deliverables": "1) Engineering 3D CAD file of one selected concept''s components & Assembly based on final prototype. (Step or Parasolid)"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Phase 2.1 - 2D CAD Drawings", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": "As per Actuals", "name": "Phase 2.2 – Beta Prototype", "weeks": "As per Actuals", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "1) Functional/Near real Prototype as per approved materials."}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Phase 3 - Electrical & Electronics Development", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Identify the components", "PCB architecture", "PCB design", "Review & refinements", "Final PCB design submission"], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Phase 3.1 – PCB Prototype", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": [], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Phase 4 - Product Validation", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Value Engineering", "Mold flow Analysis", "Mold Feasibility", "DFM"], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Phase 5 – Manufacturing Readiness, Vendor Development & Sourcing", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Vendor development", "Tool development", "Batch production", "Component Sourcing"], "deliverables": "-"}, {"inr": "-", "name": "Additional Phase 6 - Product Strategy, 360 Research Architecture", "weeks": "-", "enabled": true, "activities": ["Online & Offline survey", "Client study", "E-commerce study", "Area of opportunities as per survey", "Geographic study", "CMF study", "Thr