	('fa5e19fb-7cef-426d-89c9-f0faded91dfe', '919423451756', 'incoming', 'Hello, I am Yukta Nagori , a Design student from Karnavati University with a strong passion for Product Design . I have had the opportunity to study in globally recognised design programs such as Swinburne University (Australia), Poli. Design (Italy), and SCAD University (USA), which has helped me develop a diverse and interdisciplinary approach to design.

I am particularly interested in joining Iuova as a product designer. Your studio’s reputation for creating user-centric and impactful designs strongly resonates with my design philosophy. My experience in sketching, prototyping, research, modelling, illustration, and ideation allows me to approach challenges with both creativity and practicality.

I am eager to contribute my skills while continuing to learn and grow in a dynamic, collaborative environment. This opportunity will allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team while further refining my design practice.

Please find my work attached for your consideration. Looking forward to your response.
https://shorturl.at/zqlD7
https://www.behance.net/gallery/221290037/Interdisciplinary-Portfoilo

Thank you

Yukta Nagori
9423451756', 'sent', NULL, NULL, '2026-09-29 07:50:27.427836+00', 'Yukta'),
	('1cfc95d1-861c-4d37-bff8-613cc849751f', '919423451756', 'text', 'At IUOVA, we offer top-tier design and development services:
💡 *Industrial Design* — Concept sketching, styling, and CMF combinations.
⚙️ *Product Engineering* — 3D CAD design, component assembly, and engineering drafts.
🔬 *Prototyping* — Functional visual Beta and Alpha physical prototyping.
⚡ *PCB & Systems Development* — Bill of materials, schematics, and embedded software.

🗓️ *Schedule an Online Meeting*
🔗 https://iuovadesign.com/contact#schedule-meeting

For more information mail us at *support@iuova.in*

Reply *menu* to return to the options.', 'sent', 'wamid.HBgMOTE5NDIzNDUxNzU2FQIAERgSNzE3OUMyRDU5RkYzRUZEMkRBAA==', NULL, '2026-09-29 07:50:28.982663+00', 'Yukta'),
